<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Melo New Testament Latin</book>
  <para style="h">Maatoosa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Maatoosa Xaafeez Yesuus Kiristtoosa Wonggile</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maatoosa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Maatoosa Xaafeez Yesuus Kiristtoosa Wonggile</para>
  <para style="imt">Gelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Maatoosa Wonggilay, Yesuusa yi7ith ufayssay kase E bagga odintteezayinnee ashshizaya maaqqeezana Xoossii tiina caaqayid fa asayis inggeez ufayss qaala poleezay E baggar maaqqeezana odiza Wonggile. Yha Wonggilay Yesuusa u gancce yelinttii dicceez Ayihuditay aaddas baazin alame ubbayisii.</para>
  <para style="ip">Maatoosa Wonggilay, lo7ithii naaginttor xaafintteez maxaafe. Maatoosa fa maxaafa Yesuusa yelintteezaypp aykkii, E xammaqinttannee E paacintta odii maaqqii, Galila biitta E sabbakeez baz, taamarsseez bazinnee harggintteezita patheez bazita odiza. Ezayillakka, Yesuusa Galilapp Yerusalaame yhanigeezanee E yha sa7all yezeez wode wurssith saamintta haneez bazita beeziza. Yeykka E sottintta, E yhayiqannee E dendda wolalli odiza.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yha Wonggilay, Yesuusa Xooss higge billodayis mawuter yezannee Xooss kaatetith baz taamarssiza bayira asitamaare udii shiishiza. E timirttaypp gaanggiza baggay duma duma muurar ichchin aqo shaakinttiza.</para>
  <para style="ili">1. Xooss kaatetitith asay hanotitha, ooso, mawutennee u wurisith anja odiza ambal afa Timirtte (Shem 5–7).</para>
  <para style="ili">2. Taphpho nam77ii tamaaritay Wonggile sabbakodayis yhanigeez wode unttisi inggintteez higge (Shem 10).</para>
  <para style="ili">3. Xoossa kaatetith baz tamaarssodayis shiiqeez duma duma aaziso (Shem 13).</para>
  <para style="ili">4. E tamaare maaqqithis yez bilitha odiz timirtte (Shem 18).</para>
  <para style="ili">5. Yha alamay wurssithannee Xooss kaatetithay folo yi7ithi baz odiz timirtte (Shem 24—25).</para>
  <para style="iot">Maatoosa Wonggilay aykkeez qofita</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuus Kiristtoosa zare xussinnee e yelintto <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 1:1-2:23">1:1—2:23</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xammaqqiza Waannisa ooso <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">3:1-12</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuusa Xinqqatennee paacintto <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">3:13—4:11</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuusa Galila biitta fa ooso aykkeeza <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 4:12-18:35">4:12—18:35</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuusa Galilapp Yerusalaame hellodayis ootheez ooso <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 19:1-20:34">19:1—20:34</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuusas wurissithi saaminttannee, Yerusalaame heera <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 21:1-27:66">21:1—27:66</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Goday yhayiqopp dendonnee bentithi <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 28:1-20">28:1-20</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa yeletith xussii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luq. 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1"/>Dawute na7a Afraame na7a maaqqeez Yesuus Kiristtoosa yeletith.<verse eid="MAT 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2"/>Afraame Isaaqa yeleeza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:2">Isaaqa Yayqqooba yeleeza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:2">Yayqqooba Yihudarannee e ishita yeleeza;<verse eid="MAT 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3"/>Yihuda Ti7imaaripp Paaresannee Zaara yeleeza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:3">Paaresa Asroome yeleeza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:3">Asrooma Raame yeleeza;<verse eid="MAT 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4"/>Raame Aminadaba yeleeza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:4">Aminadaba Na7asoona yeleeza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:4">Na7asoona Salmoone yeleeza;<verse eid="MAT 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5"/>Salmoona Ra7aabppe Boo7eeza yeleeza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:5">Boo7eeza Uritppe Iyobeede yeleeza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:5">Iyobeede Issaye yeleeza;<verse eid="MAT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6"/>Issaye kaata Dawite yeleeza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:6">Kaat Dawite Ooriyo machchattippe Solomone yeleeza;<verse eid="MAT 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7"/>Solomone Robi7aama yeleeza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:7">Robi7aame Abiya yeleeza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:7">Abiye Asaafe yeleeza;<verse eid="MAT 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8"/>Asaafe Iyosaafexe yeleeza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:8">Iyosaafixe Iyoraame yeleeza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:8">Iyoraame Oozanee yeleeza;<verse eid="MAT 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9"/>Oozanee Iyo7ataame yeleeza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:9">Iyo7ataame Akkaza yeleeza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:9">Akkaza Hiziqasa yeleeza;<verse eid="MAT 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10"/>Hiziqasa Minaase yeleeza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:10">Minaase Amooxa yeleeza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:10">Amooxa Iyosaasa yeleeza;<verse eid="MAT 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11"/>Iyosaasa Ikonaanarannee e ishita yeleez ya laythate Isreele asay di7inttii Baabiloone biitta yhanigeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:14-15">2 Kaat. 24:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:10">2 Zeena. 36:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 27:20">Erim. 27:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12"/>Baabiloone biitta Isreele asay di7inttii yhanigeezaypp guye Ikonaana Salatiyaale yeleeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:12">Salatiyaale Zerubaabela yeleeza;<verse eid="MAT 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13"/>Zerubaabela Abdiyu yeleeza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:13">Abdiyu Eliyaaqeme yeleeza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:13">Eliyaaqeme Azoora yeleeza;<verse eid="MAT 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14"/>Azoora Sadooqe yeleeza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:14">Sadooqe Akime yeleeza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:14">Akime Eliyuuda yeleeza;<verse eid="MAT 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15"/>Eliyuuda Alaazara yeleeza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:15">Alaazare Maatane yeleeza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:15">Maatane Yayqqooba yeleeza;<verse eid="MAT 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16"/>Yayqqooba Yooseefa yeleeza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:16">Yooseefa Kiristtoosa giz Yesuusana yeleez Mayramii azina.<verse eid="MAT 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17"/>Yikkee, yeletithii Afraamepp Dawute hellodayis taphpho oydde. Dawutepp yhanigii Baabiloone di7a hellodayis taphpho oydde. Baabiloone di7aypp yhanigii Kiristtoosa hellodayis taphpho oyddii yeletithi maaqqiza.<verse eid="MAT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuus Kiristtoosa yeletithi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luq. 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18"/>Yesuus Kiristtoosa yelintto taarikay yhaypp kaalliza. E indat Mayrama Yooseefas oyccinttii yezar Yooseefar wolla aqekkazar geeshsha Ayyanapp woddexeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:27">Luq. 1:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19"/>Yooseefa geesh as maaqqeez gisho izo asii ododay garkk koyekkazay gishos geemar ashshodayis qoppeeza. <verse eid="MAT 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20"/>E ye qofayil yezin Xoossa kiitanchchay abukkar ees benttii, «Dawute na7a, Yooseefa, Mayrama woddexeezay geesha Ayyanapp maaqqeez gisho izo ekkodayis yashittippe» yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21"/>Iza dhiirath na7a yeloda, E woyita u nagaraypp ashshizay gisho e suntha ne Yesuusa gi xeegoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:31">Luq. 1:31</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22"/>Goday nabay doonar, <verse eid="MAT 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23"/>«Yeezako wudirtta wodexxoda; dhiirath na7a yeloda; e sunthay Amanu7eela ginttinttoda» geezay polinttoday garkk yha ubbay haneeza. Amanu7eela guusayis birshshithay «Xoossay nuuri yeza» guussii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:14">Isa. 7:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24"/>Yooseefa genttapp barkkii Goday kiitanchchay kiitteezay garkk Mayramo fa kara kanggeeza. <verse eid="MAT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25"/>Zin fa bayra na7a yelod gatho izo bochchekaya;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Izo bochchekaya: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Machchir azinar aqizaygarkk wolla aqekka guussii.</char></note> yelintteez na7akka Yesuusa gi xeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:21">Luq. 2:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Awa kess baggapp ye7eez asita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1"/>Kaat Herodoosa wode Yesuusa Yihuda biitta Beeteleme katama yelintteezaypp guye xoolintto filagizitay awa kess baggapp Yerusalaame yi7ii, <verse eid="MAT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2"/>«Yelintteez Ayihuditay kaatay aba yenee? Nu awa kess baggar kezeez xoolintto bi7ii ezisi goynnodayis ye7eeza» yeegii oycceeza.<verse eid="MAT 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3"/>Kaat Herodoosa yeya si7ii dagameeza. Yerusalaame yez as ubbaykka dagameeza. <verse eid="MAT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4"/>Herodoosa qeese halaqitannee higge asitamaarita faako xeegii «Kiristtoosa aba yelinttodeshsha?» yeegii unttan oyceeza. <verse eid="MAT 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5"/>Unttikka, «Yihuda Beeteleme nabay,<verse eid="MAT 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6"/>« ‹Yihuda yez Beeteleme,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mika. 5:2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">Yihuda yez gade aqisizitaypp,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">ne abarakka kawuzhooya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">Ta woya Isreele haarizay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">neepp kezoda eekka ta woya Isreele heenggiza maaqqada›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 2:6">gi xaafeeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7"/>Yeypp guye, Herodoosa awa kess baggapp ye7eez asita geemar xeegii, xoolintto u be7eez layitha unttapp lo7ithii oyicii ereeza. <verse eid="MAT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8"/>E unttan Beeteleme dakkittar, «Yhanigii yelintteez na7a miinthii kozhoytta; eza yi denggiko taakka yhanigii ezisi goynnodgarkk maaqqittar taasi odoytta» yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9"/>Unttikka kaatay Herodoosa odeezana si7ii qiteeza. U awa kess baggar be7eez xoolinttay unttan kaalithittar na7ay yeza aqayid eqqod hellodayis kanggii heltheeza. <verse eid="MAT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10"/>U ye xoolintta bi7ii aqopp aath ufayss ufaytteeza. <verse eid="MAT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11"/>Kara gelii na7ay fa indat Mayramir yezana be7eeza. Ees xuggunii goynneeza. Fa saaxina dooyii worqqera, ixaanerannee karbera eesi inggeeza. <verse eid="MAT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12"/>U Heroodosako guye maaqqaamay garkk Xoossay abukkar unttis odin, hara oger fa biitta maaqqeeza.<verse eid="MAT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Na7a ekkii Gibxxe qosintto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13"/>Awa kess baggapp ye7eez asay qiteezaypp guye, Goday kiitanchchay Yooseefas abukkar benttii, «Herodoosa na7ana wodhodayis koyizigishos denddoba; ellisii na7ayira na7ay indatira ekkii Gibxxe biitta yhanigoba. Ne maaqqad gallasa nees odod gatho ezayid gam7oba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14"/>Yey gishos, Yooseefa qammar denddii, na7ayira na7ay indatira ekkii Gibxxe yhanigeeza. <verse eid="MAT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15"/>Nabe doonar Xoossay, «Taanii, ta na7a, Gibxxe biittapp xeegeeza»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 11:1">Hosa. 11:1</ref></char></note> ginttintteez qaalay polinttod garkk Herodoosa yhayqqod hellodayis E ezayid gam7eeza.<verse eid="MAT 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16"/>Yeypp guye, awa kess baggapp ye7eez asay eza dooshsheezana erii iita yiloteeza. E tiin unttapp si7eezay garkk Beetelemennee ye heera yez nam77ii laythi kumezitannee nam77ii laythapp sulle yez dhiirath na7ita ubba fa wotaaddarita dakkii wodhiseeza.<verse eid="MAT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17-18"/>Nabe Ermaasa doonar,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:17-18">«Yeefonnee zelalisii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:17-18">Raama sintteeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:17-18">Iraheela fa na7itayis yeekkiza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:17-18">u yhayqqeez gishos</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:17-18">Minggodayis danda7ekkaya»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 2:17-18">gi odeezay polintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:15">Erim. 31:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 2:17-18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gibxxepp Naazirete maaqqith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19"/>Herodoosa yhayqqeezaypp guye Goda kiittanchchay Yooseefas Gibxxe abbukkar benttii, <verse eid="MAT 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20"/>«Na7a wodhodayis koyizitay yhayqqeez gishos denddii na7ayira na7ay indatira ekkii Isreele biitta maaqqoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21"/>Yooseefa denddii na7ayira na7ay indatira ekkii Isreele biitta maaqqeeza. <verse eid="MAT 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22"/>Zin Arkkiloosa Yihudal fa aday Herodoosa aqo kawuteezana si7ii ye aqa yhammadayis yashitteeza. Xoossay abukkar eza beezin Galila biitta yhanigeeza. <verse eid="MAT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23"/>Nabitay doonar, «Naazirete as ginttinttoda» gi odintteezay polinttod garkk Naazirete katama yhanigii ezayid gam7eeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:24">Mar. 1:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:39">Luq. 2:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:45">Wan. 1:45</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Xammaqiza Waannisa timirtte</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar. 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-17">Luq. 3:1-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Wan. 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1-2"/>Ye wode xammaqiza Waannisa, «Xooss kaatetithii ukkeez gishos yi nagaraypp maaqqoytta» yeegii sabbakittar Yihuda liizho gadhar ye7eeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1-2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:17">Mat. 4:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:15">Mar. 1:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 3:1-2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3"/>Nabe Isayaasa odeezay Waannisa bagga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">«Liizho gadha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">pettii athay fa qaala dhoqqi udii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">‹Goday goossa lo7ithoytta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">E oga pitithakka luulisoytta› geeza»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa. 40:3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 3:3">yeegintteezay eesii yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4"/>Waannisa gimaale ikisepp dadintteez afila ma77iza. Fa xeessayidakka dafe dancciza. E miiz kathaykka boolerannee degera eessara.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:8">2 Kaat. 1:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5"/>Asay ye wode Yerusalaame katamappe, Yihuda biitta ubbaypperannee Yorddanoose borkka heerape eeko yi7iza. <verse eid="MAT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6"/>Fa nagara buuxittar Yorddanoose borkka e kushe xammaqinttiza.<verse eid="MAT 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7"/>Ezkka, gaame Ferisaawitayppennee Saduqaawitaypp gaamitay xammaqinttodayis faako yi7izita bi7ii, unttiko, «Yha shoosh na7untho, ye7od Xooss kachchaypp qosinttodaygarkk yinttan oonoo zoreezay?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mat. 12:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8"/>Yikkee, yinttii, yi nagaraypp maaqqeezana beeziza aafe aafoytta. <verse eid="MAT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9"/>Yi, yi wozinara, ‹Afraame, nu ade gi yi qoppizaygarkk› yinttis maaqqippe. Lo7ithii si7oytta! Xoossay yha shuchchitayp Afraames na7a kessodayis danda7iza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:33">Wan. 8:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10"/>Gande minxxay xaphayid giigii betteeza; lo77o aafe aafowa mith ubbay gachchinttii tama gancce wodhdhoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Mat. 7:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11"/>«Yi, yi nagaraypp maaqqeezana erisodayis ta yinttan haathar xammaqiza. Zin taapp guyer yi7izay yinttan geesha Ayyanarannee tamar xammaqoda. E taapp lo7ithii miinggiza; ta hara attozin E caamma tookkodayis beezooya. <verse eid="MAT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12"/>Katha geeshshiz pithe E kushayid yeza. Katha lo7ithii geeshshiza; gistta fa shaalayid oloda, zin bunna to7oowa tamayid xuuggoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa xammaqintto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mar. 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luq. 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13"/>Ye wode Yesuusa Waannisa kushayid xammaqinttodayis Galilappe Yorddanoose borkka yhanigeeza. <verse eid="MAT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14"/>Zin Waannisa eza kayodayis koyii, «Ta ne kushayid xammaqinttodayis beezodar ne taako yi7inee?» yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Xoossii nuuppe kozhiz baz ubba nu polodayis beezizay gishos yhatti taasi ero goba» yeegeeza. Waannisa ezis ero gi eeza xammaqqeeza. <verse eid="MAT 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16"/>Yesuusa xammaqintteezan garkk borkkapp kezeeza. Izirakka salo dooyinttin Xoossa Ayyanay holle garkk yi7ii ezal wodhdhodar be7eeza. <verse eid="MAT 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17"/>Ye wode «Ta qadhdhiza na7ay, ta ufayttiza na7ay yhaya» yeegiz qaala salopp ye7eeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:18">Mat. 12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:5">17:5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar. 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Luq. 9:35</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa paacintto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mar. 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luq. 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1"/>Yeypp guye, daabuloosa Yesuusa faaccod garkk Geeshsha Ayaanay Yesuusana liizho gadha kanggeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:18">Ibr. 2:18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 4:15">4:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2"/>Ezayid oyttam qammannee oyttam gallas xoomeezaypp guye nayintteeza. <verse eid="MAT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3"/>Paaccizay Yesuusako yi7ii «Ne Xooss na7azako, an yha shuchchunthan boora maaqqoday garkk azazoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4"/>Yesuusa mahii eeko, « ‹Asii Xooss doonapp keziz qaala ubbayir yezizapp attin boora aaddar yezooya› yeeginttii Xoossa qaalayid xaafintteeza»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Nam7i. 8:3</ref></char></note> yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5"/>Ezaypp maaqqikka, daabuloosa Yesuusana geesha katama kanggii, Xooss keeth kusttel afa kessii, <verse eid="MAT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6"/>«Ne Xooss na7a maaqqiko, an sull guppii wodhdhoba.» Abis giiko,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11">Maz. 91:11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">« ‹Ne tokay shuchchar dhubinttaamay garkk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">fa kusher nena denthoday garkk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">Xoossay fa kiitanchchita ne gishos kiittoda›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 4:6">yeeginttii Xooss qaalayid xaafintteeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7"/>Yesuusa eeko, «Maakka, ‹Xooss qaalayid ne Goda, ne Xoossa paaccippe› yeeginttii xaafintteeza» gi maheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Nam7i. 6:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8"/>Wurssithal daabuloosa Yesuusana pettii damma amba xeeral kessii alame kaatetitha u bonchchayir wolla beezii, <verse eid="MAT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9"/>«Ne taasi xuugunii goyiniko ta neesi yhaya ubba immada» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10"/>Yesuusa mahii eeko, «Yha xalahayyo, taapp haakkoba! ‹Ne Goda, ne Xoossayis goynnoba, eza aadda goyinnoba› yeeginttii Xooss qaalayid xaafintteeza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Nam7i. 6:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11"/>Yeypp guye, eza Xalahay ashshii qiteeza; kiitanchchitay yi7ii eza maaddeeza.<verse eid="MAT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa taamarsso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mar. 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luq. 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12"/>Yesuusa, Waannisa accintteezana si7ii Galila biitta yhanigeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mat. 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mar. 6:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Luq. 3:19-20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13"/>Naazirete katama ashshii Zaabiloonannee Niftaaleme heera, abba lanqqe yez qifirnahoome katama yhanigii ezayid gam7eeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:12">Wan. 2:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14"/>Yey haneezay nabe Isayaasa doonar,<verse eid="MAT 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15"/>«Zaabiloone biitta, Nifttaaleme biitta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">Yorddanoos borkkapp seko pino,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">abbako kanggiz oge gaxa yezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">Ayihude baa asay gancce yez Galila biitta,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15-16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:1-2">Isa. 9:1-2</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16"/>Dhuma yez woya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">woliqqama poo7o be7eeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">Yhayiqo kuya betteezitayiskka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">poo7o kezeeza»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 4:16">yeegii odintteez qaalay polinttod garkke.<verse eid="MAT 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17"/>Ye wodepp aykkii Yesuusa, «Xooss kaatetithay ukkeez gishos yi nagarapp maaqqoytta» yeegii qaala sabbako aykkeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:2">Mat. 3:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa tiin xeegeez taamarita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mar. 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luq. 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18"/>Yesuusa Galila Abba lanqqer aadhittar nam77ii ishita, Phixiroosa ginttinttiz Simoonarannee e isha Indiraase be7eeza. Unttii molo aykkizita maaqqeez gishos fa gitana abba gancce olizana be7eeza. <verse eid="MAT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19"/>Yesuusa unttan, «Yhana ye7oytta; tana kaaloytta! Molo aykkizay garkk, ta yinttan as aythi tamarssoda» yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20"/>Unttikka, ellis fa gitana olii ashii Yesuusana kaalo aykkeeza.<verse eid="MAT 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21"/>Yesuusa yeypp xiqqa gede tiinal yhanigii hara nam77ii ishita, Zabddosa na7ita, Yayqqoobara Waannisara be7eeza. Fa ada Zabddoosara wolla wogolo gancce fa gite loythizin bi7ii xeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22"/>Unttikka, ellisii fa wogolo gancce fa ada ashshii Yesuusana kaalleeza.<verse eid="MAT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa hariginttizita patheeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luq. 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23"/>Yesuusa Ayihuditay Woosa keetha tamaarssittar, salo kaatetith Wongile oditara duma duma harggepp asa pathittar Galila biitta ubba yuuyeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:35">Mat. 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:39">Mar. 1:39</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24"/>Yeypp denideezayid e waaray Soora biitta ubba si7intteeza. Duma duma harger wobbeezitannee metinttizita, tuna ayyana aykintteezita, shoccii oliz harger yezitannee, sileezita eziko kanggeeza; ezikka unttan patheeza.<verse eid="MAT 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25"/>Asay Galilap, Taphphii Katamitaypp, Yerusalaamepp, Yihudappera Yorddanoosapp seko pino yez biittapp ye7eez gaame asay eza kaalleeza.<verse eid="MAT 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa ambal afa taamarsseez timirtte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1"/>Gaame woya shiiqeezana Yesuusa bi7ii amball afa kezii betteeza. E tamaaritay eziko shiiqin, <verse eid="MAT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2"/>yhay garkk yeegii taamarsseeza:<verse eid="MAT 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tuma ufayss</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:2-23">Luq. 6:2-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3"/>«Ayyanar manqqitay anjjintteezita,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ayanar manqqitay guusay Xoossal afa kattizitannee ammaninttiza asa guusii.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">salo kaatetithay unttisii.<verse eid="MAT 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4"/>Yeekkizitay anjjintteezita,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">u minthatho demmada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:2">Isa. 61:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5"/>Haayitay anjjintteezita,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">u sa7a laattoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 37:11">Maz. 37:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6"/>Geeshshetith nayinttizitaynnee saaminttizitay anjjintteezita,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">u mizhoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:1">Isa. 55:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7"/>Maarizitay anjjintteezita,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">u maarotithi demmada.<verse eid="MAT 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8"/>Wozina geeshshitay anjjintteezita,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">u Xoossa be7ada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 24:3">Maz. 24:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9"/>Iginthizitay anjjintteezita,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">u Xooss na7ita ginttinttii xeeginttoda.<verse eid="MAT 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10"/>Geesh bazis gi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">bayi7inttizitay anjjintteezita,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">salo kaatetithay unttissii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:14">1 Phix. 3:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11"/>«Asay yinttan ta gishos gi cazhii bayi7ii yinttal afa iita baz ubba worddor odiko yi anjjintteezita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 4:14">1 Phix. 4:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12"/>Yi salo yhanigii ekkod woyitay damma maaqqeez gishos ufayttoytta, habba goytta. Yinttapp tiina yez nabita yhay garkk bayi7eeza.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">2 Zeena. 36:16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:52">Haw. O. 7:52</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Alamayis maxinennee poo7o maaqqith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13"/>«Yi biittas maxine; maxine fa maxinettitha ashshiko, fa mal7ottitha wayizii mahii demmadee? Bale olin asar yedhinttodaypp attin abiskka maaddooya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mar. 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luq. 14:34-35</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14"/>«Yi biittas poo7o; derell afa yez katamtta geemodayis danda7ooya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:12">Wan. 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:5">9:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15"/>Xomppe ayithii kara yez as ubbayis poo7oday garkk dhoqqa aqo gaddizapp attin ota gancce gaddizay baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:21">Mar. 4:21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:16">Luq. 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">11:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16"/>Yey garkk asay yi lo77o oosa bi7ii, salo yez yi ada bonchchoday garkk yi poo7ay as tiina poo7o.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:12">1 Phix. 2:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Muse higge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17"/>«Taanii Muse higgannee nabitay qaala shaarodayis ye7eeza yinttis aazppe. Ta, polodayis ye7eezapp attin shaarodayis ye7ekkaya. <verse eid="MAT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18"/>Ta yinttis turo odiza; salonnee sa7a aadhod hellodayis higge ubbay polinttodaypp attin higgaypp pettii qaala woy pidaale xuuqakka aadhaamii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 16:17">Luq. 16:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19"/>Yey gishos, yha kiititaypp xiqqiza pettii kiita menthiza oonkka ma yhankkita yey garkk oothod garkk tamaarssizay oonkka salo kaatetititha ubbapp laafa maaqqoda. Zin yha kiita polizitaynnee yhankkitakka polod garkk tamaarssizay salo kaatetitha aath maaqqoda. <verse eid="MAT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20"/>Ta yinttis odiza; yi xillotithay Ferisaawitay xillotithayppennee higge asitamaaritay xillotithaypp aadhekka attiko, salo kaatetith yi yesha gelaamii.<verse eid="MAT 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Shemppo wodho bagga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21"/>«Yi mayzitayis, ‹Wodhippatte; shemppo wodhiz oonkka pirddinttoda› ginttintteezana yi si7eeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13">Kes. 20:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Nam7i. 5:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22"/>Zin ta yinttis odiza; fa ishayir kacinttiz ubbay pirddinttoda. Fa isha curqay giz oonkka daynna tiina pirddas shiiqoda. Fa ishayiko, ‹Tullay› giz oonkka gaanname tama pirddinttoda.<verse eid="MAT 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23"/>«Yey gishos, neenii ne yarisha yarshshodar ne isha shifisheez baz neesi qoofinttiko, <verse eid="MAT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24"/>ne yarisha ya aqayid ashshii qitoba; tiinatii yhanigii ne ishayir giigoba; yeezii maaqqii, ne yarisha Xoossis yarshshoba.<verse eid="MAT 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25"/>«Nena mootizayira pirdde keeth yhanigttar ogell afa ezar dabbotoba. Yey atto giiko E nena daynna tiina kanggoda. Daynnay nena accizayis aathii immada; E nena woyine oloda. <verse eid="MAT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26"/>Ta turo odiza; miishaypp pettii santife attekazin ciggii haasod hellodayis achch keethapp ne kezaamii.<verse eid="MAT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Laammodayis beezooya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27"/>« ‹Laammippate› ginttintteezana yi si7eeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Kes. 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Nam7i. 5:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28"/>Zin ta yinttis odiza, maachchi bi7ii, amotteez ubbay fa wozina gancce izir laammeeza. <verse eid="MAT 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29"/>Ne ushachchi aafay nena nagara beeziza maaqqiko, kessii oloba. Ne ashay kunthizin gaanname tama gancce wodhdhodaypp ne asetithayppe pettay dhabiko neess lo77o.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:9">Mat. 18:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:47">Mar. 9:47</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30"/>Ne ushachch kushay nena nagara oothisiza maaqqiko, izo gachchii oloba. Ne gallay kunthizin gaanname tama gancce wodhdhodaypp ne asetithayppe pettay dhabiko, neess lo77o.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:8">Mat. 18:8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:43">Mar. 9:43</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Machcho anjjo bagga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mat. 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mar. 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luq. 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31"/>«Fa machchato dakkiz oonkka anjjo warqqatte inggo» ginttintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:7">Mat. 19:7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:4">Mar. 10:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32"/>Zin ta yinttis odiza; fa machchato lagitekkazin bili7iz oonkka iza laammod garkk oothiza. Yey garkkekka, anjjintteez asito ekkiza ubbay laammiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mat. 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mar. 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luq. 16:18</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10-11">1 Qor. 7:10-11</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Caaqo bagga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33"/>«Yi mayzitayko, ‹Worddor caaqqippate; yi Xooss tiina caaqqezana poloytta› ginttintteeza yi si7eeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:12">Lewii. 19:12</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 30:2">Tay. 30:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:21">Nam7i. 23:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34"/>Zin ta yinttis odiza; ubbarakka caaqqippate. Xoossay bettiza zufaane maaqqeez gishos salor caaqqippate.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:22">Mat. 23:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35"/>E tokay yedhdhiz aqo maaqqeez gishos sa7arakka caaqqippate. Gita kaat katama maaqqeez gishos Yerusalaamerakka caaqqippate.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Isa. 66:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 48:2">Maz. 48:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36"/>Yi binanaypp pettakka boothi woy karthi udodayis danda7oowa gishos yinttii yi ubbarakka caaqqipppate. <verse eid="MAT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37"/>Yey gishos, yi qaalay, ‹Ee› woy ‹Wa77a› maaqqo. Yeypp atteezay iitapp yi7iza.<verse eid="MAT 5:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kushe kessodays beezooya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38"/>« ‹Aafe gishos aafe; achch gishos achch› ginttintteeza yi si7eeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:24">Kes. 21:24</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:20">Lewii. 24:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:19">Nam7i. 19:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39"/>Zin ta yinttis odiza; yinttal afa iita baz oothiz athakka ixxippate. Oonkka ne ushachch shanggala baqqiko ne haddiris shanggalakka beezoba. <verse eid="MAT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40"/>Pettii asii ne shaamizhito ekkodayis nena dayinal mootiko, ne kootato gujjii inggoba. <verse eid="MAT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41"/>Oonkka asii nena wolqqar fabaz toossii pettii kilo mitire bagga oge faari yhanigod garkk nena ciphphichiko, ezar nam77ii dakko oge yhanigoba. <verse eid="MAT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42"/>Woossiza ooskka inggoba; neeppe garxxodayis koyiz oonakka kayppe.»<verse eid="MAT 5:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ne morkkita qadhdhoba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luq. 6:27-28</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43"/>« ‹Nena qadhdhizana qadhdhoba; nena ixxizana ixxoba› ginttintteezana yi si7eeza. <verse eid="MAT 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44"/>Zin ta yinttis odiza; yi morkkita qadhdhoytta; yinttan qohizitayis woossoytta. <verse eid="MAT 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45"/>Yey garkk yi oothiko, salo yez yi adayis yi na7ita maaqqoda. E iititayisinnee lo77itayis awa kessiza; xillitayisinnee nagaranchchitayis fa ira bukisiza. <verse eid="MAT 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46"/>Yinttan qadhdhiza as aadda yi qadhiko, yinttis aba woytto yenee? Hara attozin, qaraxe gachchisizitaykka yinno oothoosa? <verse eid="MAT 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47"/>Yinttii, yi ishitay aadda sarothiko, yhankkitaypp abi hara aadhizibaz ootheenee? Hara attozin, Xooss ammanoowa asaykka yeya oothoosa? <verse eid="MAT 5:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48"/>Yikkee, salo yez yi aday folo maaqqeeza ygarkk yinttikka folo maaqqoytta.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:2">Lewii. 19:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:13">Nam7i. 18:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 5:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Manqqitayis inggith bagga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1"/>«Gujjikka Yesuusa yhay garkk yeegeeza; Asii bo7o gi yi lo77o oosa as tiina oothaamay garkk naaginttoytta. Yeypp attiko salo yez yi Adaypp woyito denggaamii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:5">Mat. 23:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2"/>«Yinttii manqqitayis inggittar as tiina bonchchinttodayis gi cubbitay oge doonayidannee Ayihuditay Woosa keethitayid oothizay garkk asii bo7o gi tulitula puggisppate. Ta yinttis turo odiza; unttii fa waaga ekkeeza. <verse eid="MAT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3"/>Zin yi manqqitayis inggodar yi ushachch kushay oothizana yi haddirss kushay erippe; <verse eid="MAT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4"/>Yikkee imay geema maaqqo. Geema oothizana bi7iza yi aday yinttis woyito pidhdhe immada.<verse eid="MAT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Woosa bagga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luq. 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5"/>«Woosa woossittar cubbo asay garkk hanppatte. U, fana asii bo7o gi Ayihuditay Woosa Keeth ganccennee oge doonal eqqii woossizana dosiza. Ta yinttis turo odiza; unttii fa kunth gate ekkeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 18:10-14">Luq. 18:10-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6"/>Zin ne woossittar ne qol7a gelii, gazara gorddii geema yez ne Adayiko woossoba; geema oosintteez baz bi7iza ne aday neesi ne gata immada. <verse eid="MAT 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7"/>Yi woossittar Ammanoowa as garkk cere qaala mahii mahii adussis woossippatte. U adussisi woossiko Xoossii si7iza gi qoppiza. <verse eid="MAT 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8"/>Yey gishos, unttiisay garkk hanppatte. Abis giiko, yi aday yinttis abii koshshizako yi woossodaypp tiinattii eriza. <verse eid="MAT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9"/>Yikkee, yi yeegii woossoytta:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">« ‹Salo yez nu adayyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">Ne sunthay anjjintto.<verse eid="MAT 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10"/>Ne kaatetithay ye7o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">ne shenay salo haneezay garkk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">sa7allakka hano.<verse eid="MAT 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11"/>Gallasa katha yhayino nuus inggoba.<verse eid="MAT 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12"/>Nuunii nuna qoheezitayis, atto gizay garkk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">nuuskka nu qoheez baz atto goba.<verse eid="MAT 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13"/>Nuna iitapp ashshobapp attin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">paace gncce gelisippe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">Kaatetithii, wolqqannee bonchcho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">medhinas neesi. Amin7e.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:13</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kaatetithii, wolqqannee Boncho medhinas neesii. Amin7e: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gizay pettii pettii binii maxaafitayid baaya.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14"/>«Yi yinttan qoheezitayis atto giiko, salo yez yi Aday yi qoheez bazkka atto goda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 11:25-26">Mar. 11:25-26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15"/>Zin yi hara as nagara atto gaam ixxiko yi Aday yi nagara atto gamii.»<verse eid="MAT 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xooma bagga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16"/>«Yi xoomttar cubbitay garkk shullippatte. Abis giiko, unttii xoomizana asii erod garkk fa sina kayisiza. Ta turo odiza; unttii fa gata ekkeeza.<verse eid="MAT 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17"/>«Zin ne xoomittar ne aafa meeccoba, ne omma tizhinttoba. <verse eid="MAT 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18"/>Yey garkk ne oothiko ne xoomiza xoomay asapp geemiza, zin geema yez ne Aday eriza xooma maaqqada. Geema oosintteez baz bi7iza ne Aday neess woyito immada.<verse eid="MAT 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Shalo salo shiisho bagga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19"/>«Bilannee woosho dhabisiza aqo, kayzo bookkii ekkiza aqo, yha sa7all, yinttis shalo shiishippate.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:2">Yay. 5:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20"/>Zin bilannee, woosho, dhabisoowa, kayzo bookkii ekkowa aqo salo yinttis shalo shiishoytta. <verse eid="MAT 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21"/>Ne shalay yeza aqo ne wozinaykka ezayid yezoda.<verse eid="MAT 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22"/>«Aafe asetith ubbas xomppe. Yey gishos, ne aafay path maaqqiko ne gallay ubbay poo7o maaqqiza. <verse eid="MAT 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23"/>Ne aafay harginttiza maaqqiko ne kunth asetithay dhuma maaqqiza. Yikkee, neell yez poo7ay dhuma maaqqiko, dhumay ab garkk aadho dhumodeshsha!<verse eid="MAT 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24"/>«Pettii asii nam77ii goditayis moodinttodayis danda7ooya. Petta qadhdhiko yhankka ixxiza; woy petta bonchchiko yhankka leqqiza. Xoossisinnee miishes moodinttodayis danda7ooya.<verse eid="MAT 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Un77inttippate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">Luq. 12:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25"/>«Yikkee, si7oytta! Yi shemppayis, ‹Ab maadee? Ab uzhode?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:25</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ab uzhode </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gizay binii maxaafitayid baaya.</char></note> Ab ma77ode?› gi qoppippatte; shemppo kathapp, galla ma7opp aadhoosa? <verse eid="MAT 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26"/>Salo kafita bo7oytta; unttii zerooya, buucoya, shaale olooya, zin yi salo aday unttan muziza. Yeezin yi unttapp lo7ithii aadhoosa? <verse eid="MAT 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27"/>Yi ganccepp un77inttii fa laythal afa pettii gallas gujjodayis danda7izay yenee?<verse eid="MAT 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28"/>«Ma yinttii ma77izabazis abis un7inttinee? Wora yez fudhita bo7oytta, u oosor daaburooya woy suqqooya. <verse eid="MAT 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29"/>Hara attozin, kaat Solomone fa bonchcho ubbayir yha fudhitaypp pettay garkk ma77ekkaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1 Kaat. 10:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2 Zeena. 9:3-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30"/>Yinttanno, ammano pacceezitayyo, Xoossay yhayino benttii wontta tama gancce wodhodayis yez maata yeezii ma7isiza maaqqiko, yinttan unttapp aathii wayizii ma7isoosa? <verse eid="MAT 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31"/>Yey gishos, ‹ab maadee? ab uzhode? ab ma77ode?› gi un77inttippete. <verse eid="MAT 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32"/>Yhaya ubba Xooss ammanoowa asay gaanthii denggodayis un77inttiza. Yi salo aday ye ubbay yinttis koshshizana eriza. <verse eid="MAT 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33"/>Zin ubbapp tiin Xooss kaatetithinnee e xillotitha kozhoytta; ye ubbay yinttis guzhinttoda. <verse eid="MAT 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34"/>Yey gishos, wonttas qoppittar un77inttippate. Wontta paass metintto; pettii pettii gallasayis e iitatithay gidoda.<verse eid="MAT 6:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Hara asal afa pirddippate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-42">Luq. 6:37-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1"/>«Yinttal afa pirddinttaamay garkk hara asal afa pirddippate. <verse eid="MAT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2"/>Abis giiko, hara asal afa yi pirddizay garkk yinttal afa pirddoda; yi hara asis makkeez bazar yinttis mahii makinttoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:24">Mar. 4:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3"/>Ne aafe yez tuussa be7ekkazar ne ishay aafe yez buuxa abis be7ee? <verse eid="MAT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4"/>Ne aafe tuussi yezin ne ishay aafe yez buuxa kesso goddayis wayizii danda7ee? <verse eid="MAT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5"/>Neno cubbayyo, tiinatii ne aafayid yezi tuussa kessoba. Ezaypp guye, ne ishay aafayid yez buuxa kessodayis ne milxi udii be7ada.<verse eid="MAT 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6"/>«Guye maaqqii yinttan dhaqamay garkk geesh baz kanitayis olippatte. Fa tokayir yedhdhii iissamay garkk yi al7o inqqu gududayllitay tiina olippatte.<verse eid="MAT 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Woossoytta, kozhoytta, xeegoytta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luq. 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7"/>«Woossoytta yinttis ingginttoda, kozhoytta yi demmada, bale yi7ii xeegoytta yinttis dooyinttoda. <verse eid="MAT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8"/>Woossiza ooskka ingginttoda, koyiz ooskka benttoda, bale yi7ii xeegiz ooskka dooyinttoda.<verse eid="MAT 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9"/>«Yinttapp na7a daabbo woossiko shuchchi inggizay oonoo? <verse eid="MAT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10"/>Woy molo woossiko shooshi inggizay yenee? <verse eid="MAT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11"/>Yeezin yi iititay yi na7itayis lo77o baz imo eriko, salo yez yi aday fana woossizittays lo77o baz wayizii gaanthii inggaamo? <verse eid="MAT 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12"/>Yhankkitay yinttis oothod garkk yi kozhiz baz ubba yinttikka hara asis oothoytta. Abis giiko, Muse higgaynnee nabittay tamaarssizay yhaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:31">Luq. 6:31</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13"/>«Un7a penger geloytta; dhabo kanggiz ogay damma, pengaykka dalgge. Ezayir geliza asaykka gaame. <verse eid="MAT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14"/>Zin de7oko kanggiz ogaynnee pengay un7a; ezayir geliza asaykka xiqqa.<verse eid="MAT 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mithii fa aafer erinttiza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luq. 6:43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15"/>«Afa baggar dure aazii ganccer fuge maaqqii bonqqodayis yi gancce geliza wordo nabitaypp naaginttoytta. <figure style="fig" alt="Sheep and wolves" file="LB00011B.tif" size="span" ref="7:15">Durnnee fuge</figure> <verse eid="MAT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16"/>Yi unttan, u aafayir eroda; angguthapp woynnee, gijjepp balase maxinttoya. <verse eid="MAT 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17"/>Yey garkk lo77o mithii ubbay lo77o aafe aafiza; iita mithii iita aafe aafiza. <verse eid="MAT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18"/>Lo77o mithii iita aafe aafooya, ma iita mithii lo77o aafe aafodayis danda7ooya. <verse eid="MAT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19"/>Lo77o aafe aafowa mithii ubbitay gachchinttii tama gancce olinttoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:10">Mat. 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:9">Luq. 3:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20"/>Yey gishos, yi unttan, u aafatir eroda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:33">Mat. 12:33</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21"/>«Salo yez ta aday azazo oothiza athay salo kaatetithii gelodaypp attin cer tana ‹Godayyo, Godayyo› giz ubbay salo kaatetith gelooya. <verse eid="MAT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22"/>Ye wode gaamitay, ‹Godayyo, Godayyo, ne sunthar tinbbite nu odekkasa? Ne sunthar tuna ayyantta nu kessekasa? Ne sunthar gaame malata nu oothekkasa?› yeegoda. <verse eid="MAT 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23"/>Ye wode, ‹Ta yinttan yesha erooya, yinttii wucitay taapp haakkoytta› yeegoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 6:8">Maz. 6:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24"/>«Yikee, yha ta qaala si7ii oothiza oonkka fa keetha zaallal afa keexxeez wozinaama as garkke. <verse eid="MAT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25"/>Ira bukkeeza, di7o di77eeza, carkkokka carkkii ye keethana urqqeeza. Zin keethay zaallal afa keexxintteez gishos woddekkaya. <verse eid="MAT 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26"/>Yha ta qaala si7ii oothowa oonkka fa keetha shafel afa keexxeez boozo athay garkke. <verse eid="MAT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27"/>Ira bukkii, di7o di77ii, carkkokka carkkii, ye keetha urqqin, ye keethay woddeeza; E woddithaykka woliqqama» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28-29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28-29"/>Yesuusa fa oda wurisseezaypp e timirttay higge asitamaarttay garkk maaqqekka mawuter yez asayisay garkk maaqqiz gishos asay e timirtta yhay malabaz geeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:28-29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:22">Mar. 1:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:32">Luq. 4:32</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 7:28-29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa boriqonttor yez atha patheeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mar. 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luq. 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1"/>Yesuusa derellapp wodhdheez wode gaame woya eza kaalleeza. <verse eid="MAT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2"/>Yeezako pettii borqqonttor hargginttizay eziko shiiqii, e tiinayid xuggunii, «Godayyo, ne shene maaqqiko tana geeshshii pathodayis ne danda7iza» yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3"/>Yesuusa fa kushayid dakkii eza bochchii, «Ee, ta shene, geezhoba» yeegeeza. Athay borqqonttaypp izir geezhii atteeza. <verse eid="MAT 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4"/>Yesuusa eziko, «Ne paxa oossikka odippe. Zin yhanigii ne geezhi paxeezana qeese beezoba. Ne paxeezayis markka maaqqoday garkk yhanigii Muse kiitteez yarshsha yarshshoba» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1">Lewii. 14:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mato halaqay ammana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5"/>Yesuusa qifirnahoome giz katama helleez wode pettii mato halaqay eziko shiiqii, <verse eid="MAT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6"/>«Godayyo, ta ayllay gallay silin iita hargginttii, kara woy7ii yeza» yeegii woosseeza.<verse eid="MAT 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7"/>Yesuusa mahii eziko, «Taanii yhanigii eza pathoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8"/>Zin mato halaqay mahii, «Godayyo, ne ta kara gelodayisi ta beeziza as baaya, zin ne yhannee bettii qaala aadda odoba, ta ayllay paxoda. <verse eid="MAT 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9"/>Taapp afar tana kiitiza asay yeza, ma taapp oommora taasi kiitinttizittay yeza. Unttapp petta, ‹Qitoba› giiko qitiza; ma yhankka ‹yhana ye7oba!› giiko yi7iza. Ta aylla, ‹Yhanno oothoba› giiko oothiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10"/>Yesuusa yeya si7ii malabaz gi, fana kaalliza asayiko, «Ta yinttis turo odiza; taanii yhay garkk xaala ammano Isreele asay ganccekka be7ekkaya. <verse eid="MAT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11"/>Ta yinttis odiza; gaamitay awa kessinnee awa gelo baggapp yi7ii, salo kaatetitha Afraamer, Isaaqarannee Yayqqoobara wolla imatol bettoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 13:29">Luq. 13:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12"/>Zin salo kaatetith laattodayis beezodar atteezitay bale dhuma olinttoda. Ezayid unttisi yeefonnee achch coonch maaqqada» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:13">Mat. 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Luq. 13:28</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13"/>Yesuusa mato halaqayiko, «Ne kara qitoba, ne ammanatii garkk neesi hano» yeegeeza. E ayllay ya saatate paxeeza.<verse eid="MAT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa gaame hargintteezita patheeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mar. 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luq. 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14"/>Yesuusa Phixiroosa kara gelodar Phixiroosa machchat indat oxe misha harger hargginttii woy7ii yezanno be7eeza. <verse eid="MAT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15"/>Yesuusa i kushayid bochcheezan garkk oxaynnee mishay eqqeeza. Paxxii denddii eza mokkeeza.<verse eid="MAT 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16"/>Ye wode omathi tuna ayyanar aykintteez gaame asita, asay Yesuusako ke7eeza. Ezkka tuna ayyantta fa qaalar kesseeza, harggintteezitta ubbita patheeza. <verse eid="MAT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17"/>Yeyidakka nabe Isayaasa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 8:17">«E nu daaburssa faasi ekkeeza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 8:17">e nu hargga tookkeeza»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 8:17">geez qaalay polintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4">Isa. 53:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa kaalizita helliza meto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luq. 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18"/>Yesuusa gaame asay e kale eqqeezita bi7ii, abbapp seko pino piinggod garkk fa taamarita azazeeza. <verse eid="MAT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19"/>Higge asitamaaritaypp pettay, «Asitamaarayyo, ne yhanigiza aqo ubba ta kaalloda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20"/>Yesuusa eziko «Shannitayis olla yeza, salo kafitayis keethii yeza. Zin As Na7ayis fa omma shemppisiza aqo baaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21"/>Yesuusa kaalliza asitaypp pettay, «Godayyo, taanii tiinattii yhanigii ta ada moogii ye7oda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22"/>Zin Yesuusa, «Yhayqqeezitay fa yhayqqita moogo; neenii tana kaalloba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa gote si7ii udeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mar. 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luq. 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23"/>Yesuusa yhammadayis wogolo gancce gelodar e tamaaritaykka ezar yhammadayis kaalleeza. <verse eid="MAT 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24"/>Unttii qoppekka yezin, wolqqama gotte abbayil afa denddin wogolay mitinttodays helleeza. Zin Yesuusa gentteeza. <verse eid="MAT 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25"/>E tamaaritay eziko shiiqii eza barkkithii, «Godayyo, nu dhabooho nuna ashshooyee» yeegii dentheeza.<verse eid="MAT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26"/>Yesuusa unttiko, «Yinttanno, ammano pacceezitayyo, abis yashitte?» yeegeeza. Denddii, carkkannee gota seerin ellisii ubba baz cicirkk geeza.<verse eid="MAT 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27"/>E tamaarttay malabaz gi, «yhayi, hara attozin, gotenne abba kiitinttizay waafa aso?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tuna ayyanay aykkeez nam7i asita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mar. 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luq. 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28"/>Yesuusa abbapp seko pino yez Gerggesoone giz biitta hellodar tuna ayyana aykkeez nam77ii asitay duufopp kezii eza helleeza. U iita yashshiz asita maaqqeez gishos asii ye aqayir aadhodayis danda7ooya. <verse eid="MAT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29"/>Unttikka, «Xooss Na7ayyo, nuurannee neera abi woli helithee? Nu qammay hellekkazin nuna pirddodays ne ye7eenee?» gi uukkeeza.<verse eid="MAT 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30"/>Unttapp gaame haakkekazar gudaylle wude heengginttizitay yeza. <verse eid="MAT 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31"/>Tuna ayyanitay Yesuusa, «Ne nuna kessiza baz maaqqiko, seko gudaylle wuday gancce dakkooye» yeegii woosseeza.<verse eid="MAT 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32"/>Yesuusa, «yhanigoytta» yeegeeza. Tuna ayyanitay kezii gudayllitayll geleeza. Gudayllitay ubbay gaga doonar dirggii yhanigii abba gancce mitinttii yhayqqeeza.<verse eid="MAT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33"/>Gudaylle wude heenggizitay qosinttii katama yhanigii, haneezbazinnee tuna ayyanay aykkeez asayil afa oosintteez baz ubbita odeeza. <verse eid="MAT 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34"/>Yeezin, katama gancce yez as ubbitay Yesuusa be7adayis kezeeza. Unttii Yesuusa be7eez wode fa biittapp kezii qitod garkk woosseeza.<verse eid="MAT 8:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Sileez athay paxo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mar. 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luq. 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1"/>Yeypp guye, Yesuusa wogolo gancce gelii, abba piinggii fa katama yhanigeeza. <verse eid="MAT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2"/>Asay pettii sila atha arssar tookkii Yesuusako ke7eeza. Yesuusa u ammana bi7ii, sila atha, «Ta na7ayyo, yashittippe! Ne nagaray atto ginttintteeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3"/>Ye saatayid, Ayihuditay higge asitamaaritaypp pettay pettay, «Yhayi Xooss cazhiza» yeegii u fa wozinar qoppeeza.<verse eid="MAT 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4"/>Yesuusa u qofa erii, «Iita baz yi wozinar abis qoppee? yeegeeza <verse eid="MAT 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5"/>Zin, ‹Ne nagaray atto ginttintteeza› gizayppenne ‹Denddii qitoba› gizaypp aay aadhee? <verse eid="MAT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6"/>Zin biittal afa nagara atto godays as na7ayis mawute yezana ta yinttan erisoda» yeegii, sila athayiko, «Denddii ne arssa tookkii, ne kara yhanigoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7"/>Sila athay denddii fa kara qiteeza. <verse eid="MAT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8"/>Woyay yeya bi7ii malabaz geeza. Yey garkk mawute asis inggeez Xoossa galatteeza.<verse eid="MAT 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Maatoosa xeeginttithi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mar. 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luq. 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9"/>Yesuusa yeypp denddii yhanigttar Maatoosa giz athay qaraxe gachchisiz aqo betteezin bi7ii, «Tana kaalloba» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:9">Ezikka denddii kaalleeza.<verse eid="MAT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10"/>Yesuusa Maatoosa kara munttall afa betteezin, qaraxe gachchiz gaame asitaynnee nagara oothiz asay yi7ii ezarannee e tamaaritayir wolla maadayis betteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:1-2">Luq. 15:1-2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11"/>Pettii pettii Ferisaawe asay yeya bi7ii, Yesuusa taamarita, «Yi asitamaaray qaraxe gachishizttayirannee nagara oothizitayir abis mee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12"/>Yesuusa yeya si7ii, «Akime koshshizay hariggintteezitayispp attin pathitayis baaya. <verse eid="MAT 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13"/>Zin yi yhanigii, ‹Taanii yi yarshsha baazin maarotith koyiza› guussay waaguusizako eroytta. Abis giiko, ta nagara oothizita xeegodayis ye7eezapp attin xillita xeegodayis ye7ekkaya» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:7">Mat. 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hosa. 6:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa xooma bagga oycintteeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mar. 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luq. 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14"/>Ye wode Waannisa tamaarittay Yesuusako shiiqii, «Nuurannee Farasaawe asay xoomiza, zin ne tamaaritay abis xoomoosa?» yeegii oyceeza.<verse eid="MAT 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15"/>Yesuusa mahii unttiko, «Machcho ekkizay unttar yezin laazanthitay azannodayis danda7inee? Machcho ekkizay u achchapp ekinttod wode ye7oda, u ye wode xoomoda.<verse eid="MAT 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16"/>«Orothi ma7opp peedhii cima ma7ol afa sikkiza oonkka baaya. Yey garkk oothiko orothay cimana peri7iza. Peri7ithaykka gujjii dalggiza. <verse eid="MAT 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17"/>Orothi woyne cima ogoro gancce dakkii gaddiza oonkka baaya. Yey garkk oothiko orothi woynay cima ogora dhuusiza woynaykka lallinttiza; ogoraykka nam7intho adoowa baz maaqqiza. Zin orothi woyine orothi ogoro gancce olinttodayis beeziza. Yey garkk oosinttiko nam7itaykka iitekkazar naaginttiza» yeegeeza. <figure style="fig" alt="Wineskin" file="LB00145B.tif" size="span" ref="9:17">Woyne ogoro</figure><verse eid="MAT 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yhayqqeez na7atonnee Yesuusa afila bochcheez asito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mar. 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luq. 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18"/>Yesuusa yeya odol afa yezin, Ayihude halaqqitaypp pettay eziko yi7ii, e tiinayid xuggunii, «Ta na7ata yhatti yhayqqeeza, zin iza paxodgarkk ne yi7ii ne kushayid Izil afa gaddooye» gi woosseeza. <verse eid="MAT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19"/>Yesuusa denddii ezar yhanigeeza; e tamaaritaykka kaalleeza.<verse eid="MAT 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20"/>E yhammadar taphpho nam7i laythi kunthi suuthii goggi waayithiza pettii asita guyer shiiqii Yesuusa afila macara bochcheeza. <verse eid="MAT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21"/>Iza fa wozinar, «Ta e afila macartto aadda bochchizako paxoda» yeegii qoppeeza.<verse eid="MAT 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22"/>Yesuusa guye maaqqii izo bi7ii, «Ta na7ate, yashitippe! Nena ne ammanay patheeza» yeegeeza. Ye asita izir paxxii atteeza.<verse eid="MAT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23"/>Yesuusa Ayihude halaqay kara hellodar dinkke puggizttannee yeekkizitta bi7ii, <verse eid="MAT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24"/>«Ani hali7oytta; xiqqa na7ata gentteezapp attin yhayqqekkaya» yeegeeza. Zin asay ezal afa miiceeza. <verse eid="MAT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25"/>Asa bale kesseezaypp guye kara gelii, na7atti kushayid aykkin, na7ata denddii eqqeeza. <verse eid="MAT 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26"/>Ye waaray ye biitta ubba helleeza.<verse eid="MAT 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa nam7i to7ita patheeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27"/>Yesuusa ezayir gede tiina yhanigodar nam7i to7itay fa qaala dhoqi udii, «Dawute na7ayyo, nuna maarooye» gi ukkittar eza kaalleeza.<verse eid="MAT 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28"/>Yesuusa kara gelodar to7itay eza kaali ye7eeza. Yesuusa unttiko, «Taanii yeya oothodayis danda7izana yi ammaninee?» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">Unttikka, «Ee, Godayyo» yeegii maheeza.<verse eid="MAT 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29"/>Yeypp guye, Yesuusa u aafana bochchii unttiko, «Yinttis, yi ammanay garkk hano» yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30"/>U aafaykka dooyintteeza. Yesuusa unttiko, «Yhaya ooskka odippate» yeegii miinthii odeeza. <verse eid="MAT 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31"/>Zin asitay yhanigii Yesuusa oosa ye biitta ubbayil odeeza.<verse eid="MAT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32"/>Unttii yeypp kezodar asay tuna ayyanay aykkeez pettii muume as Yesuusako ke7eeza. <verse eid="MAT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33"/>Tuna ayyanay kezeezaypp guye muume athay odintteeza, woyitaykka malabaz gi, «Yhay garkk orothibaz Isreele biittal yesha hanekka bazi» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34"/>Zin Ferisaawitay, «Tuna ayyanitay halaqayir tuna ayyanita kessiza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:25">Mat. 10:25</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:24">12:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22">Mar. 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:15">Luq. 11:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa woyayis qadhintteeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35"/>Yesuusa Ayihuditay Woosa keetha taamaristtar, salo kaatetith Wonggile sabbakittar, asa hargge ubbaypp pathitar katamitayirannee heera ubbayir yuuyeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mat. 4:23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:39">Mar. 1:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:44">Luq. 4:44</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36"/>Gaame woya, heenggiz as baa dur garkk unttan bi7iza as dhabin un77intteezitannee laalinttii yezita bi7ii unttis qadhintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Tay. 27:17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:17">1 Kaat. 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:16">2 Zeena. 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:5">Iziqe. 34:5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:34">Mar. 6:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37"/>Fa tamaaritayiko, «Shiiqod torchche kathay gaame, zin torchche katha shiishiza asay xiqqa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:37-38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:2">Luq. 10:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38"/>Yey gishos, Goday torchche katha shiishodayis ooso asita dakkod garkk torchche goda woossoytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 9:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa kiitteez taphpho nam77ii hawaarita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mar. 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luq. 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1"/>Yesuusa taphpho nam77ii taamarita faako xeegii, tuna ayyanita kessod garkkennee hargge ubba pathoday garkk unttisi mawute inggeeza.<verse eid="MAT 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2"/>Taphpho nam77ii hawaaritay suntha: unttikka Phixiroosa giz Simoonarannee e isha Indiraase, Zabddosa na7a Yayqqoobara e isha Waannisa, <verse eid="MAT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3"/>Filphoosa Barttolomoosa, Toomaasa qaraxe gachchisiz Maatoosa, Ilfoosa na7a Yayqqooba, Taadoosa, <verse eid="MAT 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4"/>Qenena Simoonarannee Yesuusa aathii inggeez Asiqoroto Yihuda.<verse eid="MAT 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5"/>Ye taphpho nam7ita Yesuusa kiittii dakkittar, «Ayihude baazitayiko yhanigipatte, ma Samaaritay katama gelippate. <verse eid="MAT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6"/>Zin Isreele karapp maaqqeez sekk dhabeez duritayiko yhanigoytta. <verse eid="MAT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7"/>Yhanigii, ‹Salo kaatetithay ukkeeza› gi odoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-12">Luq. 10:4-12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8"/>Hargintteezita pathoytta, yhayqqeezita yhayiqoppe denthoytta, boriqontto hargger yezita geeshshii pathoytta, tuna ayyanita kessoytta. Yi cer ekkeezana cer inggoytta. <verse eid="MAT 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9"/>Yi kiise worqqe, woy bira santte aykkippate. <verse eid="MAT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10"/>Yi oges qurbo, nam77ii afila, woy caamma woy gufe aykkippate; ooso oothizitayis katha koshshiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:14">1 Qor. 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1 Xim. 5:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11"/>«Yi katama woy heera gelodar yinttan mokki ekkodayis ufayttiza atha kozhii e kara shemppoytta; yi kezii yhammad gallasa hellodayis ezayid gam7oytta. <verse eid="MAT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12"/>Ma o karakka gelittar sarothoytta. <verse eid="MAT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13"/>Ye keethay yinttan mokkiko yi sarotheez saray unttan hello, zin u mokaam ixxiko yi sarotheez saray yinttis guye maaqqo. <verse eid="MAT 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14"/>Oonkka yinttan mokkowa baz maaqqikonnee yi odeezibaz si7aam ixxiko ye karttipp woy ye katamttipp kezttar yi tokel yez buli7a pittii kezoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Haw. O. 13:51</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15"/>Ta yinttis turo odiza; Xooss pirdda gallas ye katamatippe Soodomesirannee Gamoora katamitayis pirdday kawuzhoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:24">Mat. 11:24</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:24">Medhe. 19:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bayi7ith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16"/>«Ta yinttan duritay garkk fugitay gancce dakkoda. Yey gishos, shoosh garkk ecita, holle garkk haayita maaqqoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:3">Luq. 10:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17"/>Asay yinttan pirdda daynnitayis aathii immada, ma Ayihuditay Woosa Keethayid yinttan alangoda. Yey gishos, unttapp naaginttoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17-20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:9-11">Mar. 13:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:11-12">Luq. 12:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-15">21:12-15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18"/>Ta gishos gi yinttan gade aqisizitay tiinannee kaatitay tiina kanggoda. U tiinayidannee Ayihude baa woya tiina eqqii yi tabaz markkattoda. <verse eid="MAT 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19"/>Zin yinttan pirddas aathii inggodar waago ab maho gi un77inttippate; ye saate yi godbaz Xoossii yinttis immada. <verse eid="MAT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20"/>Abis giiko, yinttar maaqqii odizay yi Aday geeshsha Ayyanapp attin yinttan baaya.<verse eid="MAT 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21"/>«Ishay fa isha, aday fa na7a, yhayiqos aathii immada, na7itay fana yeleezitayil afa denddii wodhoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:12">Mar. 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:16">Luq. 21:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22"/>Ta sunthay gishos gi asii ubbay yinttan ixxoda, zin wurssith hellodayis garzheezay attoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:9">Mat. 24:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:13">Mar. 13:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:17">Luq. 21:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:13">Mat. 24:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:13">Mar. 13:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23"/>Pettii katamapp yinttan u bayi7iko hara katama qosinttoytta. Taanii yinttis turo odiza; As Na7ay ye7od hellodayis, yi Isreele katama ubba polaamii.<verse eid="MAT 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24"/>«Tamaaray fa asitamaaraypp, ayllay fa godaypp aadhooya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luq. 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Wan. 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">15:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25"/>Tamaaray fa asitaamara, ayllay fa goda aaziko ezis gidoda. Kara ada Bi7elzebula giiko e kara asa wayizii iissii xeegodee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mat. 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:24">12:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22">Mar. 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:15">Luq. 11:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26"/>«Yikkee, asis yashittippate, kamintteez baz qonccoda, qosintteez baz pidhdhe kezekkazar attaamii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:22">Mar. 4:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:17">Luq. 8:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27"/>Ta yinttis dhuma odizana yi poo7o odoytta; ta yinttis haye kale kalkkasheez baz derell afa woyas awajjoytta. <verse eid="MAT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28"/>Ashop attin shemppo wodhodayis danda7oozittayis yashittippatte. Zin shempponnee asho gaanname dhabisodays danda7iza Xoossayis aathii yashittooytta. <verse eid="MAT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29"/>Nam77ii suunnitay pettii bakkanna bayizinttoosannee? Zin, unttapp pettakka yi Aday geekkazin sa7a wodhdhii attooya. <verse eid="MAT 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30"/>Hara attozin, yi omma binanaykka payidinttii yeza. <verse eid="MAT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31"/>Yikkee, gaame suunnitaypp yi aadhiz gishos yashittippate.<verse eid="MAT 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32"/>«As tiina taas markkattiz ubbayis taankka salo yez ta aday tiina markkattoda. <verse eid="MAT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33"/>Zin as tiina tana kaddizana taankka salo yez ta aday tiina eza kaddoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 2:12">2 Xim. 2:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34"/>«Ta sa7all saro ko7odayis ye7eeza yinttis aazppe. Ta Olapp attin sarotithi ko7odayis ye7ekkaya. <verse eid="MAT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35"/>Ta ye7eezay,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 10:35">«‹Na7a adaypp</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 10:35">na7ato indattipp;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 10:35">na7ay machchato azinay indattipp shaakkodayisii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:35-36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mika. 7:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36"/>Asis morkkee e kara asita maaqqada.›<verse eid="MAT 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37"/>«Taapp aathii fa ada woy fa indato dosizay, taas maaqqodayis beezooya. Fa dhiirath na7a woy fa maachchch na7ato taapp aathii dosizay, tabaz maaqqodayis beezooya. <verse eid="MAT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38"/>Fa mazqale tookkii tana kaallowa oonkka tabaz maaqqodayis beezooya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:24">Mat. 16:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34">Mar. 8:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23">Luq. 9:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39"/>Fa shemppo ashshodayis koyizay dhabisoda, zin fa shemppo ta gishos aathii inggizay ashshoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:25">Mat. 16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mar. 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luq. 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Wan. 12:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40"/>«Yinttan mokkizay tana mokkiza, tana mokkizay ma tana kiitteez ta ada mokkiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:16">Luq. 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Wan. 13:20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mar. 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luq. 9:48</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41"/>Nabana nabe sunthar mokkizay, nabay garkk woyttinttoda; ma xillana geesh sunthar mokkizay, xillitay garkk woyttinttoda. <verse eid="MAT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42"/>Ta yinttis turo odiza; yha ta tamaaritaypp xiqqiza pettayis tana kaalliza gishos hara attozin hale haath irxxa inggiko e woyitay dhabenna» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Xammaqqiza Waannisa kiitteez asita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luq. 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1"/>Yesuusa taphpho nam77ii tamaaritayis azaza inggeezaypp guye ezaypp denddii tamaarssodayissinnee sabbakodayis Galila katamitayiko qiteeza.<verse eid="MAT 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2"/>Waannisa achch kara yezar Kiristtoosa ootheez bazita si7ii, fa tamaaritaypp nam7ita eziko kiittii, <verse eid="MAT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3"/>«Ye7oda giinttintteezay nenanee? nu hara naago?» yeegii oyceeza.<verse eid="MAT 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4"/>Yesuusa unttiko mahii, «yhanigii yi si7izibazinnee yi be7eez baz Waannisas odoytta. <verse eid="MAT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5"/>To7itay be7ada, shoollizitay yedhdhoda, boriqonttor hargintteez asitay geezhoda, tullitay si7oda, yhayqqeezittay yhayiqoppi dendoda; manqqitayis Wongilay sabbakinttoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5">Isa. 35:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6"/>Taal dhubinttekazay anjjintteezaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7"/>Waannisa tamaaritay guye maaqqii qittin, Yesuusa woyayis Waannisa baz odittar, «Yha liizho gadhayid ab be7adayis kezeene? Carkko eni7isiza maqa be7adayis ye7eenennee? <verse eid="MAT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8"/>Yeezin, ab be7adayis kezeenee? Lo77o afila ma77eez as be7adayisonee? Lo77o afila ma77ezitay kaatitay keetha yeza. <verse eid="MAT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9"/>Yeezin, ab be7adayis kezeenee? Nabe be7adayisonee? Yeezako, yi nabeppekka aadhizana bi7iza.<verse eid="MAT 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10"/>«Ne oga ne tiinayir giigisiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:10">kiitintteezana neepp tiina kiittoda»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 11:10">yeeginttii xaafintteezay eesii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mil. 3:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11"/>Ta yinttis turo odiza; maachchapp yelintteezitay ganccepp Xammaqiza Waannisapp aadhizay oonkka baaya; salo kaatetititha ubbaypp xiqqizay, ezipp aadhoda, <verse eid="MAT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12"/>xammaqiza Waannisa wodepp aykkii yhayino hellodayis salo kaatetithay gaame urqqinttiza, miinggii butintteezitay ye aqa geloda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12-13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 16:16">Luq. 16:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13"/>Nabitay ubbitayinnee Muse higgay Waannisa wode hellodayis hanod baz tinbbite odeeza. <verse eid="MAT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14"/>Yikkee, yi u kiita ammanod maaqqiko, ye7od ginttintteez Eelaasa, yeyi E Waannisa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mil. 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:10">Mat. 17:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15"/>Yikkee, si7iz hayer yezay si7o.<verse eid="MAT 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16"/>«Yikkee, yha wode yeletitha abara aaziso? Gabe gancce bettii woli xeegii,<verse eid="MAT 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17"/>« ‹Nu yinttis impilitte puggin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">yi yexxooya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:17">Nu sabbii zelalin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">yi yeekooya›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 11:17">yeegiz na7ita aaziza. <verse eid="MAT 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18"/>Xammaqiza Waannisa meekazarannee uzhekkazar yi7in, ‹Tuna ayyanar yeza› yi yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19"/>As Na7ay miittarannee uzhittar yi7in, ‹Zhimbarannee ushshii zhaare, qaraxe gachchisizitayinnee nagaranchchitay dabbo› yeegeeza. Yikkee, ecetithi tumatithay e oosayir benttiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammanaam ixxeez katamito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luq. 10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20"/>Yeypp guye, Yesuusa gaame malatita ootheez katamitayid yez asay fa nagarapp maaqqii maaroteth gelaam ixxeez gishos unttan, <verse eid="MAT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21"/>«Ayye Koraazinee katamas, ayye Beetesayda katamas, abis giiko, yi gancce oothintteez malatay Xiroosannee Sidoona oothintteez maaqqeezako, u binii budo tizhinttii, kayo afila ma77ii fa nagaraypp maaqqii attoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Isa. 23:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:26">Iziqe. 26:1—28:26</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Iyu. 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9-10">Amo. 1:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2-4">Zak. 9:2-4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22"/>Zin ta yinttis odiza; pirdda gallas yinttapp aathii Xiroosasinnee Sidoonas pirdday kawuzhoda. <verse eid="MAT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23"/>Ma yhannee qifirnahooma, ne pude salo kezodayis koyinee? Hanaamii! Neenii Si7oole wodhdhoda. Abis giiko, ne gancce oothintteez malatitay Soodoma oosintteezako Soodome yhayino hellodayis yessadazin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13">Isa. 14:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24"/>Zin ta neesi odiza; pirdda gallas neeppi aathii Soodomas pirdday kawuzhoda» yeegii kacceeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:15">Mat. 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:12">Luq. 10:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosar yez shemppo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luq. 10:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25"/>Ye wode Yesuusa, «adayyo, salonnee sa7a Godayyo, neenii yhaya eranchchitayippennee ecitaypp qosii duude na7itayis qoncciseez gishos nena ta galatiza. <verse eid="MAT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26"/>Ee, ta adayyo, yhayi ne lo77o shenay garkk haneeza.<verse eid="MAT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27"/>«Ubbay taasi ta Adaypp ingintteeza. Adaypp hara Na7a erizay baaya, Na7ayppennee E unttisi qonccisodayis koyizttaypp hara Ada erodayis danda7izay baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:35">Wan. 3:35</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:18">Wan. 1:18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:15">10:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28"/>«Yinttano, daabureezitayyo, toofo deexeez ubbitayyo taako yhana ye7oytta; ta yinttan shemppisoda. <verse eid="MAT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29"/>Taanii ta wozinar keehannee haayo maaqqeez gishos ta qambarayid geloytta, taapp tamaaroytta; yinttii, yi shemppos shemppo demmada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:16">Erim. 6:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30"/>Ta qambbaray liiqama, ma ta toofaykka shawuko» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Maala bonchcho bagga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mar. 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luq. 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1"/>Yeypp guye, maala gallas, Yesuusa gade ganccer aadhiza. Yesuusa tamaaritay nayintteez gishos bangga tizha mirkkii muuss aykkeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:25">Nam7i. 23:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2"/>Zin Ferisaawitay yeya bi7ii Yesuusako, «Yha bo7oba, ne tamaaritay maala gallas oothodayis beezoowa baz oothiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3"/>Yesuusa unttiko mahii, «Dawitte nayintteez wode Ezar yezitayira ab ootheezakko yi nabbabekasa?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3-4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Sam. 21:1-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4"/>Dawitte Xooss keetha gelii qeesitay aaddapp attin ezinnee ezar yezitayis beezoowa yarshshintteez daabbo meeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Lewii. 24:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5"/>Woy kahinitay maala woga shaarii Xoossa Keetha maala gallas ooso oothiko unttis nagara maaqqoozana Muse higgaypp yi nabbabekasa?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:9-10">Tay. 28:9-10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6"/>Zin si7oytta! Xooss Keethapp aadhizay yhaydda yeza. <verse eid="MAT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7"/>‹Taanii yi yarshsha baazin yi hara as maarod garkk koyiza› giz qaalay waaguusizako yi ereezako geeshsh asal afa pirdaamii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:13">Mat. 9:13</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hosa. 6:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8"/>As Na7ay maalas Goda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9"/>Yesuusa yeypp yhanigii Ayihuditay Woosa keethi geleeza. <verse eid="MAT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10"/>Ezayid kushe sileez pettii athay yeza. Yesuusana mootodayis sankke koyiz asay, «maala gallas as pathodayis beezinennee beezoosa?» yeegii oyiceeza.<verse eid="MAT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11"/>E unttiko, «Yi ganccepp pettayis durii maala gallas olla wodhdhiko, goochchii kessoozay oonoo?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 14:5">Luq. 14:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12"/>Yeezin asii durapp wayizii lo7ithi aadhoosa? Yeyi gishos, maala gallas lo77o baz oothodayis beeziza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13"/>Yeypp guye, Yesuusa athayiko, «Ne kushayid piddi udoba» yeegin, athaykka piddi udeeza. E kushay paxxii yhankko kushay garkk haneeza. <verse eid="MAT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14"/>Zin Ferisaawitay yeypp bale kezii, Yesuusa wayizii wodhodazako wolla tobbeeza.<verse eid="MAT 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossay dooreez aylla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15"/>Yesuusa u qofa erii ye aqa ashshii hara aqo qiteeza. Gaame asii eza kaallii yhanigeeza, harggintteezita ubba e patheeza. <verse eid="MAT 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16"/>Yesuusa, «Ta bagga oossikka odippatte» yeegii miinthii odeeza. <verse eid="MAT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17"/>Yeykka nabe Isayaasa,<verse eid="MAT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18"/>«Yikkee ta maraxeez ayllay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">ta dosizay, tana ufayssizay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">taanii ta ayyana, ezal afa shemppisoda;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18-21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:1-4">Isa. 42:1-4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">E, Ayihude baa woyas luule pirddebaz awajjoda.<verse eid="MAT 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19"/>E palamooya woy kaccooya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:19">fa qaalakka denbal cer sissooya.<verse eid="MAT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20"/>Luule pirddar gamod hellodayis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">loomeez maqa menthooya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">cuyiz muqaadda to7isooya.<verse eid="MAT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21"/>Ayihude baa woya ubbitay eel ufayttoda»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 12:21">yeegii odintteezay polinttoday garkke.<verse eid="MAT 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusara Bi7elzebuulara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Mar. 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luq. 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22"/>Yeypp guye, tuna ayyana aykkeez to7annee muume as yezana eziko ke7eeza. Yesuusa atha pathin, athay be7eezannee odintteeza. <verse eid="MAT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23"/>Woya ubbay malabaz gi, «Yhayi Dawutte Na7a maaqqadeshshaa?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24"/>Zin Ferisaawitay yeya si7ii, «Yha athay tuna ayyanita kessizay tuna ayyanitay halaqa Bi7elzebula wolqqara» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mat. 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25"/>Yesuusa u qofa erii, «pettii kaatetithii shaakinttii wolalli eqinttiza maaqqiko ye kaatetithay wodhdhoda; ma woli gancce shaakotith medhdhiz katama woy keethi miinggii eqqodayis danda7ooya. <verse eid="MAT 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26"/>Xalahe xalehe kessiza baz maaqqiko fa gancce shagintteez guussii. Yey garkke haniza baz maaqqiko e kaatetithay wayizii miinggii eqqodayis danda7ee? <verse eid="MAT 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27"/>Taanii tuna ayyana kessizay Bi7elzebula wolqqar maaqqiko yinttan kaalliza asay o wolqqar kessodee? Yey gishos, yinttan kaalliza asay yinttan pirddoda. <verse eid="MAT 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28"/>Zin taanii tuna ayyanita kessizay Xooss Ayyanar maaqqiko, Xooss kaatetithay yinttiko ye7eeza.<verse eid="MAT 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29"/>«Woy pettii as wolqqama as kara gelii e shalana bonqqodayis koyko tiinattii ye atha accekka attiko wayizii bonqqodayis danda7ee? Acceezayipp guye e shalana bonqqodayis danda7iza.<verse eid="MAT 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30"/>«Taar baazay oonkka tana ixxiza; ma taar wolla shiishoowa ubbay laaliza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:40">Mar. 9:40</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31"/>Yey gishos, si7oytta; asay oothiza aba nagarakka cashshii ubbay atto ginttinttoda, zin geeshsha Ayaana cazheez oossikka e nagaray atto giinttinttaamii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:31-32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:10">Luq. 12:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32"/>Oonkka As Na7al afa iitta baz odinttiko eesi atto ginttinttoda, zin geeshsha Ayyanal afa iitta baz odinttiza oossikka yha sa7all maaqqin ye7od alamayilakka e nagaray atto giinttinttaamii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:10">Luq. 12:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33"/>«Lo77o mithii lo77o aafe aafiza; ma iita mithii iita aafiza. Yikkee, mithii erinttizay fa aafayira. <verse eid="MAT 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34"/>Yinttanno, shoosh na7untho, yi iita maaqqittar wayizii lo77o baz odinttodayis danda7inee? Asii fa wozina gancce kumii puceez bazapp doonar odinttiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:7">Mat. 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:7">Luq. 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 15:18">Mat. 15:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:45">Luq. 6:45</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35"/>Lo77o asii fa wozina gancce gaddeez lo77o bazapp, lo77o baz kessiza; iita asii fa wozina gancce gaddeez iita bazapp, iitta baz kessiza. <verse eid="MAT 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36"/>Zin si7oytta, asii odinttiza cere oda ubbayiskka pirdda gallas malsse immada. <verse eid="MAT 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37"/>Abis giiko, ne odinttiza neqaalayir xilloda; ne odinttiza ne qaalay neell afa pirddoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Malata be7adayis shiiqeez oyichi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mar. 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luq. 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38"/>Yeypp guye, pettii pettii farasaawitayinnee higge asitamaaritay Yesuusako, «Asitamaarayyo, neenii malata oothii nuna beezooyee» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:1">Mat. 16:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mar. 8:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Luq. 11:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39"/>Zin Yesuusa mahii, «Ammanozitaynnee iita yeletithitay malata koyiza. Zin nabe Yoonasa malatapp hara malata eesi ingginttooya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:4">Mat. 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mar. 8:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40"/>Yoonasa gita molo ulo gancce hayidzii gallasinnee hayidzii qamma gam7eezay garkk As Na7ay hayidzii gallasinnee hayidzii qamma biitta gancce gam7oda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:17">Wan. 1:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41"/>Nenewe asay pirdde gallas denddii yha yeletithayil afa pirddoda; abis giiko, u Yoonasa sibikkata si7ii fa nagaraypp maaqqeeza. Yikkee, Yoonasapp aadhizay yhaydda yeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:5">Wan. 3:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42"/>Pirdda gallas sulle bagga kaatata denddii yha yeletithayir wolla pirddoda; abis giiko, iza Solomone eccetitha si7odayis biitta gaxapp ye7eeza. Yeezako, Solomonepp aadhizay yhaydda yeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1 Kaat. 10:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2 Zeena. 9:1-12</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43"/>«Tuna ayyanay asapp kezeezaypp guye faasi shemppiza aqo koyii haathii baa mela aqo daaburiza, zin fa koyiz shemppo denggenna. <verse eid="MAT 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44"/>Yeyi gishos, ‹Ta ashshii kezeez kara maaqqii yhammada› yeegiza. E maaqqii ye7odar keethay kayisa maaqqizannee pitinttii giigii betteezana denggiza. <verse eid="MAT 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45"/>Yikkee, maaqqii yhanigii, paapp iita hara laappun iita ayyanita ekkii yi7iza; unttikka athay gancce gelii yeziza. Ye athayis tiinaasaypp guyeesay usa iitiza. Yha iita yeletithayil yey garkk baz hanoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 12:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa indatinnee e ishita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mar. 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luq. 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46"/>Yesuusa woyayis odal afa yezin e indatinee e ishitay eer nashodayis koyii bale eqqeeza. <verse eid="MAT 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47"/>Pettii asii eziko, «Ne indatinee ne ishitay neer nashodayis koyii bale eqqeeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 12:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Ta indat oonoo? Ta ishitaykka oonanttara?» yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49"/>Fa kushayir taamarita mallitar, «Bo7oytta, ta indatanne ta ishitay yhayitita. <verse eid="MAT 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50"/>Salo yez ta Aday shene oothiza ubbitay ta ishe, ta mishshonnee ta indo» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Zerithi zeriz athay aaziso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mar. 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luq. 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1"/>Ye gallas Yesuusa karapp kezii abba kantta betteeza. <verse eid="MAT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2"/>Gaame woya e lanqqe shiiqin asa abba gaxa ashshii wogolo gancce gelii betteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:1">Luq. 5:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3"/>Asayis gaame baz aazisor yeegii odeeza:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:3">«Pettii biitta oothiz athay zerithi zerodayis kezeeza. <verse eid="MAT 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4"/>E zerodar pettii pettii zerithay oge gaxa wodhdheeza; unttanakka kafitay yi7ii maxxii meeza. <verse eid="MAT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5"/>Pettii pettii zerthitay oommo sisilqqo yez biittal afa wodhdheeza. Gaame biitta baa gishos ellis doleeza. <verse eid="MAT 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6"/>Zin awa kezin shulleeza; xapho baazay gishos meleeza. <verse eid="MAT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7"/>Pettii pettii zerithay angguthi gancce wodhdheeza; angguthay diccii ye dola cuulleeza. <verse eid="MAT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8"/>Yhankkitay ma irkko biittal afa wodhdheeza; dolii aafe aafeeza. Pettay xeeti, pettay usuppuntam, pettay ma hasttam aafeeza. <verse eid="MAT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9"/>Si7iz hayer yez athay si7o» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10"/>Yesuusa tamaaritay eziko shiiqii, «Abis neenii woyayis aazisor odee?» yeegii oyiceeza.<verse eid="MAT 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11"/>E mahii, «Yinttis salo kaattetithi xuura ingintteeza, zin unttisi ingginttekkaya. <verse eid="MAT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12"/>Yeza ubbayis guzhinttoda, ezisi gaanggoda, zin baazaypp hara attozin ezis yezanakka ekinttoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:29">Mat. 25:29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mar. 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Luq. 8:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">19:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13"/>Yey gishos, taanii unttii, bi7ittar dengaamay garkk, si7ittar si7aam garkk woy akaakam garkk unttisi aazisor odiza.<verse eid="MAT 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14"/>«Isayaasa fa maxaafay giddo odeezay unttal afa polintteeza. E odittar,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">« ‹Yi sis si7iza, zin akaakooya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">yi bi7ith bi7iza, zin dengooya.<verse eid="MAT 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15"/>Abis giiko, yha asay wozinay oriddeeza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">fa haya erittar tulliseeza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">fa aafa goozeeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Yey baazako u fa aafatir bi7ii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">fa hayer si7ii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">fa wozinar akaakii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">taako maaqqoda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">taakka unttan pathodazin› yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16"/>«Zin yi aafay bi7iza gisho yi hayay si7iz gishos yi anjjintteezita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16-17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:23-24">Luq. 10:23-24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17"/>Ta yinttis turo odiza; gaame nabitayinnee geeshsh asitay yi be7eezana be7adayisinne yi si7izana si7odayis amotteeza, zin unttis hanekkaya.<verse eid="MAT 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18"/>«Yikkee, yha zerithi zeriz athay aazisa si7oytta. <verse eid="MAT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19"/>Oge gaxa wodhdheez zerithi aazisay yhaya: salo kaattetith qaala si7ii akaakowa athay wozinaypp Xalahe yi7ii e wozina gancce yez zertha maxii haaseeza. <verse eid="MAT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20"/>Sissilqqo biittal afa zerntteezay beezizay qaala si7ii ellis ufayssar ekkizita. <verse eid="MAT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21"/>Zin yhattesapp attin xapho dakkekkaya. Qaala gisho meto woy bayi7ithii yi7iza wode ellis dhubinttiza. <verse eid="MAT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22"/>Angguthi gancce zerintteezay yhaya qaala si7eeza, zin yha alame yessis hirggaynnee duretithis qofay qaala cuulliza gishos aafe aafekkazar attiza. <verse eid="MAT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23"/>Zin aradda biittal zerinteez zerithay yhaya akaakar qaala si7eez atha. E aafe aafiza; pettay xeeti, pettay usuppuntam pettay ma hasttam inggiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Leeshshor aaziso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24"/>Yesuusa unttis hara aaziso odeeza, «Xooss kaatetithay fa woota gancce lo77o zerithi zereez atha aaziza. <verse eid="MAT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25"/>Zin as ubbay genttin e morkkay yi7ii gistte gancce leeshsho zerii qiteeza. <verse eid="MAT 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26"/>Gisttay diccii ka77iz wode leeshshokka e gancce bentteeza.<verse eid="MAT 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27"/>«Gade goday ayllitay godayko yhanigii, ‹Godayyo, ne wootayid ne lo77o zerithi zerekkasa? Yeezin, leeshsho anapp ye7eenee?› yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28"/>«E unttiko, ‹Yeya morkke ootheeza› yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:28">«Ayllitay godayiko, ‹Nu yhanigii leeshsha shoddod garkk ne koyinee?› yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 13:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29"/>«Zin E, ‹Atto bochchippate; yi leeshsha shoddiz godar gisttekka shodinttoda. <verse eid="MAT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30"/>Bochchippate; maxo wode hellodayis wolla dicco. Ye wode maxiza asitay leeshsha tiinattii maxii tama gancce xuugodayis mirqqer mirqqer mirqqoytta. Zin gistta shiishii ta shaalayid oloytta› yeegoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sanaficce aafe aaziso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mar. 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luq. 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31"/>Ma hara aaziso yeegii odeeza; «Salo kaatetithay pettii asii fa woota gancce bakkeez sanaficce aafe aaziza. <verse eid="MAT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32"/>Ye mithat aafay hara mithii aafitaypp xiqqa, zin dolii diccii hara mith ubbaypp aadhii dammii dicciza. I shaqitayil afa kafitay keexxii bettod hellodayis damma mith maaqqiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Irshsho aaziso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luq. 13:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33"/>Maaqqikka, Yesuusa hara aaziso odeeza; «Salo kaatetithay pettii maachchi hayidzii gongge dhiilla ekkii munuqii, munuqay dendoday garkk ezayid dakkeez irshsho aaziza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34"/>Yesuusa woyayis ye aaziso ubba odeeza. Aaziso baazin pettibazikka odekkaya. <verse eid="MAT 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35"/>Nabay fa maxaafay gancce,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">«Taanii ta doona, aazisor dooyoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">salonnee sa7a medhintteezayppe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">geemmezana ta odiza»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 13:35">yeegii odeezay yeyid polintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:2">Maz. 78:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Leeshsho aazisays birshithi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36"/>Yesuusa woyita ashshii kara geleeza. E tamaaritay eziko shiiqii, «wootayid yez leeshshay bilitha nuus odoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37"/>E mahii, «Lo77o zerithi zereezay As Na7a, <verse eid="MAT 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38"/>Wootay yha alama. Lo77o zerithay salo kaatetithii na7ita. Leeshshay xalahe na7ita. <verse eid="MAT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39"/>Leeshsho zereezay morkke xalahe, maxo woday wode wurssitha, maxizitay kiitanchchita.<verse eid="MAT 13:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40"/>«Leeshshay maxinttii tama gancce xuuginttizay garkk wode wurssithala yhaygarkk hanoda. <verse eid="MAT 13:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41"/>As Na7ay fa kiitanchchita kiittoda. U nagaras sankke maaqqeezittannee iita oothizi ubbita maxii e kaatetithaypp kessoda. <verse eid="MAT 13:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42"/>Maxii shiishii yeefonnee achch coonchii yez to7oowa tama gancce oloda. <verse eid="MAT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43"/>Ye wode xillitay fa Aday kaatetithayid awa garkk poo7oda. Si7iz haye yezay si7o!<verse eid="MAT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44"/>«Xooss kaatetithay woota gancce moogintteez miishe aaziza. Pettii asii ye miisha denggii mahii moogeeza. Gaame ufayttii yhanigii paas yeza baz ubba bayizii ye gadat wonggeeza.<verse eid="MAT 13:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45"/>«Yey garkk, ma salo kaatetithay inqqo giz al7o shuchchita koyiz zal7e as aaziza. <verse eid="MAT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46"/>Gaame al7o inqqo denggii yhanigii paas yeza baz ubba bayizii e wonggeeza.<verse eid="MAT 13:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Molo aykkiz gite aaziso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47"/>«Ma Xooss kaatetithay abba gancce olintteez duma duma molo kochch aykkizi gite aaziza. <verse eid="MAT 13:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48"/>Molo aykkiz asay molo gitayid kumin abbappi gaxa kesseeza. Ezayid bettii lo77a lo77a qurii daachcho gancce oleeza, zin iita molita alla oleeza. <verse eid="MAT 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49"/>Wode wurssithal yey garkk hanoda. Kiitanchchitay yi7ii nagara oothizita xillitaypp quroda. <verse eid="MAT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50"/>Yeefonnee achch coonchii yeza to7oowa tama gancce oloda.<verse eid="MAT 13:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51"/>«Yha ubbitay yinttis geleenee?» yeegii unttan oyceeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">U mahii, «Ee» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 13:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52"/>Yesuusa, «Yikkee, salo kaatetithii xuura ekkii higge taamarssiza ubbitay, fa minjjeez shalaypp orothinnee cima kessiza shalo goda aaziza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 13:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusanana Naazirete helleez ixo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mar. 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luq. 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53"/>Yesuusa yha aazisa odii wursseezaypp guye ezaypp denddii qiteeza. <verse eid="MAT 13:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54"/>Fa yelintteez biitta yhanigii Ayihuditay Woosa Kara taamarsso ayikkeeza. U mala bazi gi, «Yha athay yha ecetithannee yha malata oothiza wolqqa anap ekkeenee? <verse eid="MAT 13:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55"/>Yhayi anaaxay na7a baasannee? E indatii sunthay Mayiramo baasanee? E ishitay Yayqqooba, Yooseefa, Simoonarannee Yihuda baasannee? <verse eid="MAT 13:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56"/>E mishunthikka nuur yezunthuna baasanee? Yeezin, yha athay yha ubba anapp ekkeenee?» yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 13:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57"/>Yey gishos, E giz baza ekkaam ixxeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:57 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:43">Wan. 4:43</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Zin Yesuusa, «Nabe fa yelintteez biittayidannee fa kara asay kale bonchchinttooya» yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 13:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58"/>U ammanaami ixxeez gishos gaame malata ye aqayid oothekkaya.<verse eid="MAT 13:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Xammaqiza Waannisa Yhayiqo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mar. 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luq. 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1"/>Ye wode Galila aqisiz Heroodissa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Heroodissa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yhayi kaata Herodoosa Antiphaasa. E Yihudara Peera Kiristtoosa yelinttodaypp tiini 4-39 Maala hellodayis mooddeeza. E Kaati Heroodosas na7a.</char></note> Yesuusa waara si7eeza. <verse eid="MAT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2"/>Fa ayllitayiko, «Yhay xammaqiza Waannisa; E yhayiqopp dendeeza. Yey gishos yha ubba malatita E oothiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3"/>E yeya geezay Heroodissa fa isha Filphoosa machat Heroodiyada gishos Waannisa achch keetha gelsseez gishosi. <verse eid="MAT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4"/>Waannisa Heroodissa, «Ne izo ekkodayis woga baaya» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3-4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Luq. 3:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 18:16">Lewii. 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:21">20:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5"/>Heroodissa Waannisa wodhodayis koyeeza, zin woyay Waannisa nabe udii bi7iz gishos yashitteeza.<verse eid="MAT 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6"/>Heroodissa fa yelintteez gallasa bonchchiza wode Heroodiyada na7at as tiina yethar doonggii eza ufaysseeza. <verse eid="MAT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7"/>Yeezin, E, «Iza koyiz baz ubba iis immada gi» caaqqeeza. <verse eid="MAT 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8"/>Na7ata fa indat zore si7ii Heroodisako, «xamaaqiza Waannisa qoodhaypp gachchii omma fil7o gancce gaddii taasi inggoba» yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9"/>Iza yeegin kaatay qiiradheeza, zin fa caaqay gishonnee paar yez imathitay gishos gi I oyichay polinttod garkk azazeeza. <verse eid="MAT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10"/>Kaatay as kiittii Waannisa achch keetha yezin e qoodha gachiseeza. <verse eid="MAT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11"/>E omma fil7o gancce aathii ki7ii na7atis inggeeza; na7atakka ekkii fa indatis kanggeeza. <verse eid="MAT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12"/>Waannisa tamaaritay yi7ii e aha kanggii moogeeza. Ezayppe guye haneezibaz ubba yhanigii Yesuusas odeeza.<verse eid="MAT 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa ichchin mukule asita muzeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar. 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luq. 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Wan. 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13"/>Yesuusa haneezibazana si7ii wogolo gancce gelii ye besayppe pettii geemmiza aqo fa aaddas yhanigeeza. Asay yeya si7ii katamitaypp dendii toker eza kaalleeza. <verse eid="MAT 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14"/>Yesuusa wogolopp wodhdhii gaame asa bi7ii unttisi qadhintteeza. U gancce yez hargintteez asita patheeza.<verse eid="MAT 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15"/>Sa7ay omathittar yhanigin Yesuusa tamaaritay eziko shiiqii, «Yha aqay liizho, sa7aykka qammeeza. Yey gishos, heera yhanigii paasi wonggii maad garkk woya dakkoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16"/>Zin Yesuusa unttiko, «Woyay meekkazar yhammadayis koshshooya; u maadbaz yi inggoytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17"/>U mahii, «Nuus yhannee ichchin soollorannee nam77ii molopp hara baaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18"/>Ezikka, «An izo yhana ko7oytta» yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19"/>Ma maaqqikka, woyay maatal bettoday garkk odeeza. Ichchin soollora nam77ii molita ekkii, salo bi7ii galatii maaqqii, soolla duuthii fa tamaaritayis inggeeza; unttii ma woyayis inggeeza. <verse eid="MAT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20"/>Ubbay mi mizheeza. Yesuusa tamaaritay maadar atteezana taphpho nam77ii leemate dentheeza. <verse eid="MAT 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21"/>Katha meez asay maachchinnee na7a attin ichchin mukule maaqqiza.<verse eid="MAT 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa abbal yedhdheeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mar. 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Wan. 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22"/>Yesuusa fa tamaaritay wogolo gancce gelii paapp tiinattii abbaypp seko finthi piinggoday garkk kiittii faasi woya moyizodayis guye atteeza. <verse eid="MAT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23"/>Woya moyizii maaqqii fa aaddas woossodayis pettii derell afa kezeeza. Sa7a qamminkka E fa aaddas ezayid gam7eeza. <verse eid="MAT 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24"/>Ye wode wogolay abbal afar yhammadar tiina baggar carkko dendin gotay wogolana ciphphicheeza.<verse eid="MAT 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25"/>Wontimaathela Yesuusa abbal afa yedhdhittar fa tamaaritayiko ye7eeza. <verse eid="MAT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26"/>E tamaaritay, E abbal afa yedhdhittar unttiko yi7izana bi7ii yashitteeza. Unttikka, «yhayi meeshshe» gi yashittii uukkeeza.<verse eid="MAT 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27"/>Zin Yesuusa ellissii, «Akko baaya! Yashittippatte! yhay tana» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28"/>Phixiroosa eziko, «Godayyo, nena maaqqiko, ta haathayis afar yedhdhii neeko yhanigod garkk tana azazoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29"/>Yesuusa Phixiroosako, «Yhana ye7oba» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 14:29">Phixiroosa wogolopp wodhdhii haathal afa yedhdhittar Yesuusako yhamo aykkeeza. <verse eid="MAT 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30"/>Zin woliqama carkko bi7ii yashitteeza. Haathay eza mitto aykkin «Godayyo, tana ashshooyee» yeegii uukkeeza.<verse eid="MAT 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31"/>Yesuusa ellis fa kushayid dakkii eza aykkii, «Naat, ammano pacceezayyo abis sidhe» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32"/>Yesuusarannee Phixiroosara wogolo gancce gelin carkkay cicirkkii geeza. <verse eid="MAT 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33"/>Wogolo gancce yez e tamaaritay, «Neenii tumakka Xooss Na7a» gi goynneeza.<verse eid="MAT 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34"/>U abba piinggii Gensareexe biitta helleeza. <verse eid="MAT 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35"/>Ya biittayil yez asay Yesuusana erii fa shooro heera yez ubbayis kiita dakkeeza. Asay hargintteez asita ubba eziko ke7eeza. <verse eid="MAT 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36"/>Hargintteez asitay e afila manchcha aadda bochchodayis eza woosseeza. Bochcheez ubbitaykka paxeeza.<verse eid="MAT 14:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Aditay woga bagga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mar. 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1"/>Yeypp guye, pettii pettii Farasaawitayinnee higge asitamaaritay Yerusallemepp Yesuusako yi7ii, <verse eid="MAT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2"/>«Ne tamaaritay abis nu aditay woga menthe? U katha maadaypp tiina fa kusha meecinttooya» yeegii oyiceeza.<verse eid="MAT 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Yinttii, yi woga gishos Xoossa kiita polizana abis ixxeenee? <verse eid="MAT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4"/>Abis giiko, Xoossay, ‹Ne adennee ne indo bonchchoba. Fa ada woy fa indo cazhizay yhayqqo geekkasa?› yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Kes. 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Nam7i. 5:16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 21:17">Kes. 21:17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:9">Lewii. 20:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5"/>Zin yi, pettii as fa ada woy fa indat maaddod baz yezin, ‹Yhaya ta Xoossis yarshsheeza giiko, <verse eid="MAT 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6"/>fa ada woy fa indat bonchchodayis beezooya› yi yeegiza. Yeezii yinttii, yi woga polodayis Xoossa qaala menthiza. <verse eid="MAT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7"/>Yinttanno, cubbitayyo, Isayaasa yi baz turo odeeza,<verse eid="MAT 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8"/>« ‹Yha asay tana fa doonar bonchchiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">zin u wozinay taapp haakko yeza.<verse eid="MAT 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9"/>Asay tana cer goynniza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">u asii medhdheez woga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">Xoossa higge aazisii taamarssiza› geeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">As tunisiza baz</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mar. 7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10"/>Yesuusa gaame asita faako xeegii, «Si7oytta! Akaakoytta! <verse eid="MAT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11"/>As tunisiza bazay doonar geliz baz baazin doonappe keziz bazi» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12"/>Yeypp guye, Yesuusa tamaaritay eziko yi7ii, «Farasaawitay neenii odeeza si7ii dhubintteezana ne ereenee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13"/>Zin Yesuusa unttiko mahii, «Salo yez ta aday tukkekka mith ubbay shodinttoda. <verse eid="MAT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14"/>U bagga hirigipatte; u to7a kaalithizaykka to7ita. To7ay to7a kaalithiko, nam7itaykka gaga qitiza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:39">Luq. 6:39</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15"/>Phixiroosa mahii, «Yha aazisays bilitha nuus odooyye» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16"/>Yesuusa unttiko, «yinttiskka yhanno hellodayis gelekkasa? <verse eid="MAT 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17"/>Doonar geliz baz ubbay ulo gelii bale kezizana yi eroosa? <verse eid="MAT 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18"/>Zin doonar keziz baz wozinapp keziza. As tunisiza bazitay yhayitita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mat. 12:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19"/>Unttikka as wozina ganccepp keziz iita qofa, wodho, lagite, laame, kayzo, worddo markkatithii, as sunth dhabiso, cashshe. <verse eid="MAT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20"/>Yeya azizbazitay as tunisizapp attin meeccinttekka kusher miizay tunisooya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pettii asttii ammano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mar. 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21"/>Yeypp guye, Yesuusa ezaypp kezii Xiroosannee Sidoona katamitay yez biitta yhanigeeza. <verse eid="MAT 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22"/>Pettii Kanaanee biitta astta Yesuusako yi7ii, fa qaala dhoqqi udii, «Godayyo, Dawute na7ayyo, taasi qadhinttooye; ta na7ato tuna ayyana aykkii iita waaythiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23"/>Zin Yesuusa pettii qaalakka mahekkazar si77 atteeza. Yesuusa tamaaritay eziko yi7ii, «Yha astta nu lassa kaallittar, uukiza gishos, ne izo moyzooyee» yeegii woosseeza.<verse eid="MAT 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Taanii wudepp dhabeez durigarkk Isreele karapp dhabeez asitay aaddas kiitintteeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25"/>Zin iza, e tiina xuggunii, «Godayyo, tana maaddooye?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26"/>E mahii, «Na7itay katha ekkii kanitayis olodayis beezooya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27"/>Izakka, «Godayyo, yey tuma, zin hara attozin kanitay fa goditay maadar, gaytapp wodhdhiz gufa miiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Astt yhannee, ne ammanay gita; ne koyeezayigarkk nees hano» yeegeeza. I na7ata izir paxxeeza.<verse eid="MAT 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa gaame hargintteezita patheeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29"/>Yesuusa yeypp denddii Galila Abba lanqqe qiteeza. Pettii amibal afa kezii, ezayid betteeza. <verse eid="MAT 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30"/>Gaame asay far, wobbita, to7ita, sileezita, doona muumeezitannee, hara gaame harggintteez asita ekkii, Eziko ki7ii e tiinayid gaddeeza. Yesuusa unttan patheeza. <verse eid="MAT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31"/>Yey gishos, muumitay nashshodar, sileezitay paxodar, wobbitay yedhdhodar, to7itay be7adar asay bi7ii malabaz gi, Isreele Xoossa galatteeza.<verse eid="MAT 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa oyddii mukule asa muzeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mar. 8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32"/>Yesuusa fa taamarita faako xeegii, «Yha gaame asay taar hayidzii gallas gam7eez gishonnee unttis yhatti miizibaz baazay gishos ta unttisi qadhinttiza. U ogel daaburii fookkam garkk akko muzekka unttan cer dakkodayis ta koyooya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33"/>E tamaaritay mahii, «Nuunii yha liizhayid yhay garkk asayis gidiza katha anapp demmadee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34"/>Yesuusa unttiko, «Yinttis aappun soollo yenee?» yeegii oyceeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">U mahii, «Laappun soollonnee yishshe molitaypp xiqqa yeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35"/>Yesuusa woyita sa7a bettoytta yeegii azazeeza. <verse eid="MAT 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36"/>Yeypp guye, ye laappun soollayira mola ekkii Xooss galateeza. Dusirithii fa tamaaritayis inggeeza. E tamaaritay asayis gisheeza.<verse eid="MAT 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37"/>Asay ubbay mi mizheeza. E tamaaritay, maadar atteez gufa laappun gita leemate kunth dentheeza. <verse eid="MAT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38"/>Meez asay maachchinnee na7a payidekkazin dhiirathi aadda oyddii mukulo. <verse eid="MAT 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39"/>Yesuusa woyita dakkezaypp guye wogolo gancce gelii Magadoona giz biitta qiteeza.<verse eid="MAT 15:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Salopp malata be7adayis oycceez oyichi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mar. 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luq. 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1"/>Farasaawitayinnee Saduqaawitay Yesuusako yi7ii. Eza paaccodayis koyii, fana salopp malata beezo gi oyceeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mat. 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Luq. 11:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2"/>Zin E unttiko, «Sa7a omathodar ‹Salo zoqqi benttiko wontta sa7a booqaloda› yi giza. <verse eid="MAT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3"/>Wonttitar ‹Salo zoqqi shaara aykkiko yhayino ira bukkoda› yi giza. Yeezin yi salo bi7ii mallii erizin wode bi7ii mallii erodayis danda7ekkaya. <verse eid="MAT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4"/>Iititaynnee ammanoowa yeletithii malata koyiza. Zin eesi Yoonasa malataypp hara malata ingginttooya» yeegeeza. Yeypp guye, unttan ezayid ashshii hara aqo qitteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:39">Mat. 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29">Luq. 11:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ferisaawitaynnee Saduqaawitay irshsho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mar. 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5"/>U abbapp seko pino piinggeez wode soollo ekkii ye7odana dogeeza. <verse eid="MAT 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6"/>Yesuusa unttiko, «Ferisaawitayppenne Saduqaawitay irshshopp naaginttoytta» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:1">Luq. 12:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7"/>Unttikka fa gancce, «E yeya geezay nu soollo ekkii ye7ekka gishshos maaqqada» yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8"/>Yesuusa u qofa erii, «Yinttano, ammano pacceezitayyo! Soollo ekkekka ye7eez gishos yi woli giddo abis odinttee? <verse eid="MAT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9"/>Yhattekka yi akaakoosa? Ichchin mukule asayis ichchin soollo gisheezannee u mi mizhin yi aappun leemate kunthi dentheezaka yi dogeenee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:17">Mat. 14:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10"/>Yey garkkekka, laappun soollo oyddii mukule asayis gisheezannee u mi mizhin, yi aappun leemate kunthi dentheezaka yi akaakoosa?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:34">Mat. 15:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11"/>Yikkee, taanii Ferisaawitaynnee Saduqaawitay irshshopp naaginttoytta gi odizay soollobagga baazana yi akaakoosa?» yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12"/>Yeezin, e tamaaritay Yesuusa odizay munuqo denthodayis wodhdhiz irshshobagga baazin Ferisaawitaynnee Saduqaawitay timirttaypp naagintto bagga maaqqeezana akaakeeza.<verse eid="MAT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phixiroosa Yesuusa Mesih maaqqeezana odeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mar. 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luq. 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13"/>Yesuusa Qisaare Filphoosa biitta helleez wode fa tamaaritayiko, «Asay, As Na7a oona gee?» yeegii oyceeza.<verse eid="MAT 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14"/>Unttikka, «Pettay pettay xamaaqiza Waannisa, yhankkitay Eelaasa, ma yhankkittayikka Irmaasa woy nabitaypp petta giza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:1">Mat. 14:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Yeezin, yi tana oona gee?» gi unttan oyceeza.<verse eid="MAT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16"/>Simoona Phixiroosa mahii, «Neenii Kiristtoosa, de7o Xooss na7a» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:68">Wan. 6:68</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17"/>Yesuusa Phixiroosako, «Yoona na7a Simoona, ne anjjintteezaya! Yhaya neesi beezeezay salo yez ta adaypp attin as baaya. <verse eid="MAT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18"/>Ta neesi odiza Phixiroosa, neenii zaalla! Taanii yha zaallayil afa ta woosa keetha keexxoda. Yhayiqo wolqqaykka izo gamenna. <verse eid="MAT 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19"/>Salo kaattetithi qulppitta ta neesi immada. Sa7a ne acceez baz ubba salo Xooss kale accintteez baz maaqqada. Sa7a neenii bili7eez baz ubbay salo Xooss kale bilintteez baz maaqqada» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:18">Mat. 18:18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:23">Wan. 20:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20"/>Yeypp guye, E, Kiristtoosa maaqqeezana ooskka odaamay garkk fa taamarita miinthii azazeeza.<verse eid="MAT 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa fana hellod meta tiinattii odeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21"/>Ye wodepp aykkii Yesuusa fa tamaaritayis, «Taanii Yerusalaame yhammadays beeziza. Ezayid gade cimitaypp, qeese halaqitayppennee higge asitamaaritayipp ta meto ekkodayis beeziza. U tana wodhoda, zin taanii hayidzantho gallas yhayiqopp dendoda» yeegii geeshshii odeeza.<verse eid="MAT 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22"/>Phixiroosa Yesuusana gaxa kessii, «Godayyo, yey hanena! Yey garkk baz nena yesha hellippe!» yeegii gayileeza.<verse eid="MAT 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23"/>Yesuusa Phixiroosako guye maaqqii, «Yha Xalahayyo, taapp haakkoba! Neenii as qofa qoppizapp attin Xooss qofa qoppoowa gishos taassi dhube maaqqiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24"/>Yeypp guye, Yesuusa fa tamaaritayiko, «Oonkka tana kaallodayis koyiz baz maaqqiko fana kado, fa mazqqala tookkii tana kaallo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat. 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Luq. 14:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25"/>Fa shemppo ashshodayis koyiz ubbitay dhabisiza. Zin fa shemppo ta gishos gi aathii inggizay ashshiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat. 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Luq. 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Wan. 12:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26"/>Asii alame kuntha fabaz uddii, fa shemppo dhabisiko eza ab maaddee? Woy asii fa shemppo wozodayis ab inggodayis danda7ee? <verse eid="MAT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27"/>As na7ay fa aday bonchchayir fa kiitanchchitayir ye7oda. Ye wode pettii pettii athayis e oosatgarkk immada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:31">Mat. 25:31</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 62:12">Maz. 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:6">Oro. 2:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28"/>Ta turo odiza; as Na7ay kaatetithayir maaqqii ye7odar be7ad hellodayis yhaydda eqqeez asaypp yhayqqaamizitay yeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 16:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa malay laamintteeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mar. 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luq. 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1"/>Usuppun gallasapp guye Yesuusa Phixiroosa, Yayqqobannee e isha Waannisa paar ekkii u aadda damma ambal afa kezeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:17-18">2 Phix. 1:17-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2"/>Ezayid u tiina Yesuusa malay laamintteeza; e sinaykka awa garkk poo7eeza. E afilaykka booth poo7o garkk poceeza. <verse eid="MAT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3"/>Yikkee, Musennee Eelaasa ezar nashshodar be7eeza. <verse eid="MAT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4"/>Phixiroosa Yesuusako, «Nuunii ne koyiko petto neesi, petto Musesii, petto Eelaasas yhaydda hayidzii shaqara accoda» yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5"/>Phixiroosa yeya haga ododar boothi shaara unttan kammeeza. Shaaray gancce, «Tana ufayssiza, ta qadhdhiza na7ay yhaya, eza si7oytta!» yeegiz giirthii ye7eeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Medhe. 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Maz. 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa. 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat. 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar. 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luq. 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:15">Nam7i. 18:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6"/>Yesuusa tamaaritay yeya si7ii dagamii fa sinayir sa7a guphinggeeza. <verse eid="MAT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7"/>Zin Yesuusa unttiko shiiqii unttan bochchii, «Dendoytta, yashittippatte!» yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8"/>U dhoqqi gi be7adar Yesuusapp hara oonakka be7ekkaya.<verse eid="MAT 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9"/>U ambalapp wodhdhodar Yesuusa unttiko, «As Na7ay yhayiqopp dendod hellodayis yhaya yi be7eez baazana ooskka odippate» gi azazeeza. <verse eid="MAT 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10"/>Yesuusa tamaaritay, «Yeezin, higge asitamaaritay Eelaasa Kiristtoosapp tiinatii ye7od geezay abiso?» yeegii oyceeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mil. 4:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Ee! Eelaasa tiinadhdhii yi7ii ubba baz lo7ithoda. <verse eid="MAT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12"/>Zin ta yinttis turo odiza; Eelaasa tiinatii ye7eeza. Unttikka ezal afa koyeez baz ootheezaypp attin eza shaakkii erekkaya. Yey garkk As Na7ay u kushe metto ekkoda» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:14">Mat. 11:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13"/>Ye wode Yesuusa geezay xamaaqiza Waannisa bagga maaqqeezana u akaakeeza.<verse eid="MAT 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa tuna ayyana aykkeez na7a patheeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mar. 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luq. 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14"/>U ambalapp asayiko maaqqeezan garkk pettii athay Yesuusa tiina bunqittii, <verse eid="MAT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15"/>«Godayyo, magane ta na7ayis qadhinttooye; eza aginar aginar denddii tama ganccennee hathigancce shoccii oliz iita hargge yeza. <verse eid="MAT 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16"/>Ne tamaaritayiko ta ki7in, u pathodayis danda7ekkaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Yinttanno, ammanoowa zhucca yeletithitayyo ayide hellodayis ta yinttar yezodee? Ayide hellodayis ta yinttan danda7odee? An na7a yhana ekkii ye7oytta» yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18"/>Yesuusa tuna ayyana qoddin, tuna ayyanay na7aypp kezeeza; ye saatate na7ay paxeeza. <verse eid="MAT 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19"/>Yeypp guye, Yesuusa tamaaritay fa aaddas eziko shiiqii, «Nuunii tuna ayyana kessodayis danda7ekkazay abiso?» yeegii oycceeza. <verse eid="MAT 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20"/>E unttiko, «Yinttis ammano xiqqeez gishshosii. Ta yinttis turo odiza; sanafice aafe garkk ammano yinttis yezako ‹Yha amba yhaypp denddii gede aadhoba› giiko yinttis kiitinttoda. Yinttis danda7inttoowa baz baaya. <verse eid="MAT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21"/>[Zin yey garkkezay woosappennee xoomapp attin harar kezooya]» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:20-21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:21">Mat. 21:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:23">Mar. 11:23</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1 Qor. 13:2</ref></char></note><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Pettii pettii binii maxaafitayid tayibo 21 baaya.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa fa yhayiqo bagga mahii odeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mar. 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luq. 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22"/>Yesuusa tamaaritay Galila biitta shiiqii yeezin Yesuusa unttiko, «As Na7ay asi kushe aadhii ingginttoda. <verse eid="MAT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23"/>Unttii eza wodhoda, zin E hayidzintho gallas yhayiqopp dendoda» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:23">E tamaaritaykka iita azzaneeza.<verse eid="MAT 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Giira gacho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24"/>Yesuusara e tamaaritayira qifirnahoome katama helleez wode Xoossa Keeth giira ekkizitay Phixiroosako yi7ii, «Yi asitamaaray Woosa Keeth giira giirinennee?» yeegii oyceeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:13">Kes. 30:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25"/>Phixiroosa mahii, «Giiriza» yeegeeza. Phixiroosa kara gelodar Yesuusa tiinatii, «Phixiroosa, neess ab aazee? Yha sa7a kaatetithay qaraxennee giira oopp ekkinnee? Gade asayppennee as gade asapp?» yeegii oyceeza.<verse eid="MAT 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26"/>Phixiroosa «As gade asappee» gi maheeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">Yesuusa mahii, «Gade as giira giiroowa guusso? <verse eid="MAT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27"/>Zin u dhubinttaamay garkk abba yhanigii molo aykkiz manxxaqo oloba. Tiina ne aykkiz molay doona dooyii giiras gidiza miishe ekkii ne gishonnee ta gishos kanggii giiroba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Ubbapp aadhizay oonoo?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mar. 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luq. 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1"/>Ye wode Yesuusa tamaaritay yi7ii, «Salo katettitha ubbapp aadhizay oonoo?» yeegii oyicceeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:24">Luq. 22:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2"/>Yesuusa pettii duude na7a xeegii u gancce essii yhay garkke yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3"/>«Ta yinttis turo odiza; yi laaminttaamixikonnee duude na7a garkk hanaam ixxiko salo kaatetitha gelodayssi yesha danda7ooya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:15">Mar. 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:17">Luq. 18:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4"/>Yikkee, yha duude na7ay garkk fana kawushshiza oonkka salo katettitha ubbapp aadhiza maaqqada. <verse eid="MAT 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5"/>Yhay garkk duude na7a ta sunthar mokkiza oonkka tana mokkiza.<verse eid="MAT 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6"/>«Zin tana ammaniza yha xiqqitaypp petta nagara oothod garkk dhube maaqqiz oonkka damma woxa fa qoodhel accii ciimmo abba gancce mitinttiko eesi lo77o. <verse eid="MAT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7"/>Alamel asii nagara oothod garkk oothizabaz yeza gishos alame ayye. Yey garkk baz ye7ekka attaamii, zin dhube e baggar yi7iz atha ayye.<verse eid="MAT 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8"/>«Ne kushe woy ne toke nena balithiko neepp gachchii oloba. Neenii nam77ii kusher woy nam77ii toker medhina tama gancce wodhdhadaypp kushe woy toke duuxa maaqqii medhina de7o denigizay nees lo77o.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:30">Mat. 5:30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9"/>Ma ne aafay nena balithiko izo woocii kessii oloba. Neenii nam77ii aafer gaanname tama gancce wodhdhadaypp pettii aafer medhina de7o gelizako nees lo77o.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:29">Mat. 5:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10"/>«Ta yinttis odiza; salo yez unttan naagiz kiitanchchitay ubba wode salo yez ta Aday tiina yez gishos yi yha xiqqitaypp pettakka leeqqaam garkk naaginttoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:10-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:10">Luq. 19:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11"/>As Na7ay dhabeezita ashshodayis ye7eeza»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Asi Na7ay dhabeezita ashshodayis ye7eeza: yeegizana pettii pettii binii maxaafitay tayibo 11 gujjiza.</char></note> yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dhabeez dur aaziso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luq. 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12"/>Ma Yesuusa, «Yinttis ab aazee? Pettii athayis xeet duritay yezitayppe pettay dhabiko uddufun tammanne uddufunita ambal afa olii ashshii ye dhabeezana koyodayis yhanigoosa? <verse eid="MAT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13"/>Ta turo odiza; E denggeez wode uddufun tamannee uddufunitaypp aathii dhabii bentteez pettii durayil ufayttiza. <verse eid="MAT 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14"/>Yey garkkekka, salo yez yi aday yha xiqqitaypp pettay dhabod garkk koyooya.<verse eid="MAT 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Qoheez asii wayisade?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15"/>«Ne ishay nena qohiko ne aaddas eziko yhanigii e buutta ezis odoba. E nena si7iko ne isha neesi shalo udoba.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:3">Luq. 17:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16"/>Zin E nena si7aam ixxiko, nam77ii woy hayidzii as markkar mootii wodhiza gishos pettii woy nam77ii as ekkii eziko yhanigoba.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Nam7i. 19:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17"/>E unttan si7aam ixxiko, woosa keethis odoba. Woosa keethi giz baz si7aam ixxiko ammanoowa as garkk woy qaraxe gachchisiz as garkk eza tayiboba.<verse eid="MAT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18"/>«Ta yinttis turo odiza; sa7a yi acciz baz ubbitay salo Xooss kale accintteez baz maaqqada. Sa7a yi billeez baz ubbitay salo Xooss kale billintteez baz maaqqada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:19">Mat. 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:23">Wan. 20:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19"/>«Maakka ta yinttis odiza; sa7a yinttipp nam7itay pettii wozinar maaqqii Xooss woossiza baz maaqqiko salo yez ta Aday yinttis oothoda. <verse eid="MAT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20"/>Tana kaallizitaypp nam77ii woy hayidzii maaqqii shiiqiza bessa ta u gancce benttoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atto guuss bagga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21"/>Ye wode Phixiroosa Yesuusako yi7ii, «Godayyo, ta ishay tana qohiko aappun toke ta atto godayis beezinee? Laappun toke hellodayissonee?» gi oyiceeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21-22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:3-4">Luq. 17:3-4</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Yeya baaya, laappun tam toke laappunpp attin laappun toke baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:24">Medhe. 4:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23"/>«Yey gishos, Xooss kaattetithay fa ooso asitayir fa mishay paccezakonnee fucceezako be7adayis qoppeez kaata aaziza. <verse eid="MAT 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24"/>Ye kaatay miishay paccezakonnee fuceezako bi7iza wode gaame mukule aco yez pettii atha eziko ke7eeza. <verse eid="MAT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25"/>Zin ye ayllay aca ciggodayis gaminttin eza, e machchatira, e na7itayirannee ezis yeza baz ubbay bayizinttii aco ciginttod garkk eza goday azazeeza. <verse eid="MAT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26"/>Yeezin ayllay fa goday tokayil afa wodhdhii, ‹Ta godayyo, hayyana xiqqas gam7ooyee, ta ubba ciggoda› yeegii woosseeza. <verse eid="MAT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27"/>Kaatay ezis qadhinttii, dakkii ashsheeza; e acakka maareeza.<verse eid="MAT 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28"/>«Zin ye ayllay kezii yhanigii fa laggee ooso asitaypp pettay ezapp xiqqa miishe tali7eezana, ‹Neell afa yez ta miisha taass ciggoba› gi athayss qoodhat cuuleeza.<verse eid="MAT 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29"/>«Ye e lagge ayllay e tokayil wodhdhii, ‹Hayyana xiqqal ogam7ooyee ta nees ubba ciggoda› yeegii woosseeza.<verse eid="MAT 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30"/>«Zin ixxii ekkii kanggii fa laggay aca ciggod hellodayis achch keetha geliseeza. <verse eid="MAT 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31"/>Yey gishos, hara laggee ooso asitay yeya bi7ii iita yilottii, yhanigii fa godayis E ootheez bazita ubba odeeza.<verse eid="MAT 18:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32"/>«Yeezin goday ye aylla xeegisii, ‹Yha iita ayllayyo, neenii tana woosseez gishos ta ne aca ubba nena maareeza. <verse eid="MAT 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33"/>Yeezin, taanii ne aca maareezay garkk neenii ne laggee maaqqeez ayllay aca maarodayis nees beezoosa?› yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34"/>Yey gishos, goday iita yilottii, E fa aca ubba ciggod hellodayis pathi kaa7inttoday garkk achch keethis aathii inggeeza.<verse eid="MAT 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35"/>«Yey garkke, yi pettay pettay yi isha wozinapp maaram ixxiko salo yez ta Aday yinttan yhay garkk oothoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 18:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Eko baggannee gelo bagga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mar. 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1"/>Yesuusa yeya odii haaseezaypp guye Galilapp denddii Yorddanoosa borikapp seko pino yez Yihuda biitta qitteeza. <verse eid="MAT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2"/>Gaame asay eza kaallii yhanigin u ganccepp hargintteez asita patheeza.<verse eid="MAT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3"/>Ferisaawe asitay eza faaccodayis koyii eziko yi7ii, «pettii asii ababaz gishossikka fa machchato dakkodayis beeznnee?» yeegii oyiceeza.<verse eid="MAT 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Xoossii tiina dhiirathinnee maachchi udii medhdheezana yi nabbabekkasa?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Medhe. 1:27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 5:1">5:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5"/>‹Yey gishos, Pettii asii fa adenne fa indo ashshii fa machchatir petto maaqqiza, nam7itaykka pettii asho maaqqiza›<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Medhe. 2:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6"/>Yey gishos, unttii pettii asho maaqqodaypp attin nam7e maaqqooya. Yikkee, Xoossii acceezana asii billippe» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7"/>Ferisaawe asitay, «Yeezin, Muse pettii as anjjo warqqate inggii fa machchato dakkodaygarkk abis azazeenee?» yeegii oyiceeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:1">Medhe. 24:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Yinttii, yi machchita dakkodgarkk Muse yinttan azazeezay, yi wozina minotithay gishopp attin tiinapp yey garkk baaya. <verse eid="MAT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9"/>Ta yinttis odiza; fa machchat lagttekkazin dakkii hara ekkiz oonkka laammiza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mat. 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10">1 Qor. 7:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10"/>E tamaaritay eziko, «Azininnee machchii bagga yey garkk maaqqiko ekonnee gelo attiko lo77o» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Yey garkk timirttay Xoossii danda7a inggeezitayisapp attin as ubbitayis baaya. <verse eid="MAT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12"/>Yikkee, yelinttitar siilla maaqqii yelintteezitay yeza, ma asii qaaratteezitay yeza, ma salo kaatetith gishos yeegii fana siilliiseezitay yeza. Yey gishos, yhaya ekkodayis danda7iza oonkka eko» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa xiqqa na7ita anjjeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mar. 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luq. 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13"/>Yesuusa fa kushayid duude na7itayil afa gaddii unttis woossod garkk pettii pettii asay na7ita eziko ke7eeza. Zin e tamaaritay asayil kacintteeza. <verse eid="MAT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14"/>Zin Yesuusa, «Xooss kaatetithay yhayititay garkkezitayis maaqqeez gishos duude na7itay taako yi7izana kayippate; ye7o goytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15"/>Fa kushayid unttal afa gaddeezaypp guye ye aqaypp ashshii qiteeza.<verse eid="MAT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sa7a duretithinnee Salo kaatetith</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mar. 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luq. 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16"/>Pettii gallas pettii athay Yesuusako yi7ii, «Asitamaarayyo, taanii medhina de7o denggodays abi lo77o baz ootho?» yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17"/>Yesuusa eziko, «Lo77o baz bagga ne tana abis oyce? Pettii Xoossapp attin hara lo77o baaya. Zin ne medhina de7o ekkodayis koyko azazita naagoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18"/>Athay mahii, «azazitay Aayita?» yeegii oyceeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">Yesuusa mahii, «Wodhippe, laammippe, kasitippe, worddo markattippe,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13-16">Kes. 20:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17-20">Nam7i. 5:17-20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19"/>ne adannee ne indato bonchchoba, ne lagga ne ubay garkk qadhdhoba» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Kes. 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Nam7i. 5:16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lewii. 19:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20"/>Ye paanthay, «Taanii yhayitita ubba na7atithapp aykkii polittar yeza. Yeezin, hara taasi paccizabaz abba?» yeegii oyceeza.<verse eid="MAT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Ne folo maaqqodayis koyko yhanigii nees yeza baz bayizii manqqitayis inggoba; neenii salo duritoda. Yeezii maaqqii yi7ii tana kaalloba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22"/>Zin ye athay dure maaqqeez gishos yeya si7ii azanttar ashshii qiteeza. <verse eid="MAT 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23"/>Yeypp guye, Yesuusa fa tamaaritayir, «Taanii yinttis turo odiza; dure salo kaatetith gelodayi gaame meto. <verse eid="MAT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24"/>Dure asii Xooss kaatetithii gelodaypp gimaale narppe lukor aadhoday kawuzhiza» yeegeeza. <figure style="fig" alt="Man leading unloaded camel" file="LB00039B.tif" size="span" ref="19:24">Gimale </figure><verse eid="MAT 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25"/>Yesuusa tamaaritay yeya si7ii malabaz gi, «Yeezin, oonii attodayis danda7ee?» yeegii oyceeza.<verse eid="MAT 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26"/>Yesuusa unttan dakkii bi7ii, «Yhayi asis danda7initooya, zin Xoossis ubbay danda7inttiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27"/>Phixiroosa mahii, «Nuunii ubba baz ashshii nena kaalleeza. Yeezin, nuunii ab demmadee?» yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28"/>Yesuusa unttiko yhay garkke yeegeeza: «Taanii yinttis turo odiza; As Na7ay ye7od alamayid fa bonchcho zufaanel bettiza wode yi taphpho nam77iitay, tana kaalleez, taphpho nam77ii zufaanell bettii taphpho nam77ii Isreele zerithitayil afa pirddoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:31">Mat. 25:31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:30">Luq. 22:30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29"/>Ta sunthay gishos keethita woy ishita woy mishita, woy ade woy indo woy na7ita woy fa ooso gade ashsheezay oonkka xeet kushe ekkoda. Ma medhina de7okka ekkoda. <verse eid="MAT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30"/>Zin gaamitay tiinitay guyita, ma guyitay tiinita» maaqqada yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:16">Mat. 20:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:30">Luq. 13:30</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 19:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Woyne gancce oothiz ooso asitay aaziso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1"/>«Xooss kaatetithay fa woyne gancce ooso asita oosisodays wontta guura kezeez gade goda aaziza. <verse eid="MAT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2"/>E ye ooso asitayis pettii gallasis pettii diinaare<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:2 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Pettii diinaare: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pettii asii pettii gallas oothii peezhii ekkiza miishe.</char></note> gachchodayis unttar giigii, unttan fa woyne gancce dakkeeza.<verse eid="MAT 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3"/>«Ma wonttapp hayidzii saate maaqqodar kezii ooso dhabin gaabel afa eqqeez hara asitakka denggeeza. <verse eid="MAT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4"/>E unttiko, ‹Yinttikka ta woyne gancce yhanigii oothoytta, ta yinttis beeziza damooze gachchoda› yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5"/>Unttikka yhanigeeza. Maakka E usuppun saaterannee uddufun saater kezii yhay garkk ootheeza. <verse eid="MAT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6"/>Taphpho pettii saate maaqqin E kezodar yhankkita eqqeezita denggii, ‹Yi ooso oothekka gallas muda yhaydda abis eqqii peezheenee?› yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7"/>«U mahii, ‹Nuna oosisiza asii dhabeez gishshosi› yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:7">«Ezii, ‹Yinttikka ta woyne gancce yhanigii oothoytta› yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8"/>«Sa7a omathin, woyne goday ooso asitay halaqayiko, ‹Ooso asita xeegii guyepp ooso gelezitaypp aykkii tiina geleezita hellodays unttis damooze gachchoba› yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:13">Lewii. 19:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:15">Nam7i. 24:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9"/>Taphpho pettii saater ooso aykkeezitay yi7ii, ommar ommar pettii pettii dinnare ekkeeza. <verse eid="MAT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10"/>Tiina ooso aykkeezitay yi7ii, paas gaame inginttoda gi qoppeeza. Zin unttikka ommar ommar pettii pettii dinnare ekkeeza. <verse eid="MAT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11"/>Fa miisha ekkii maaqqii gade godayil afa oolleeza. <verse eid="MAT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12"/>‹Yhayititay guyepp yi7ii pettii saate aadda ootheeza. Zin gallas muda awa mishar daaburii peezheez nuur unttii wayizii petto maaqqode› yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13"/>«Woynnee tukkeez goday ooso asitaypp pettayiko, ‹Ta ishayyo, taanii nena qohekkaya; ne taar giigintteezay pettii diinnares baasa? <verse eid="MAT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14"/>Ne gishito ekkii ne kara qitoba. Ta omathi ye7eezayssikka neesay garkk immadayis koyiza. <verse eid="MAT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15"/>Taanii ta miishayir koyeez baz oothodayis taasi mawute baasa? Woy taanii keeha maaqqeez gishos nena qinaatisinee?› yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16"/>«Yey garkk yhatte guyitay, tiinatoda ma tiinitay guyitoda» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:30">Mat. 19:30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Mar. 10:31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:30">Luq. 13:30</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa fa yhayiqobagga hayidzantho odeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mar. 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luq. 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17"/>Yesuusa Yerusalaame yhanigttar, taphpho nam7i taamarita duma gaxa kess unttiko yeegeeza: <verse eid="MAT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18"/>«Yeezako, nuunii yhatt Yerusalaame yhamol afa yeza. Ezayid as na7ay qeese halaqitayisnnee higge asitamaaritayis aadhii ingginttoda. Unttikka ezal afa yhayiqo pirdde pirddoda. <verse eid="MAT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19"/>Eza Ayihude baa woyas aathii immada. Unttii eza kawushshoda, alangoda, eza mazqalel afakka sottoda. Zin E hayidzintho gallas yhayiqopp dendoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zabdoosa na7itay indatii woosa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mar. 10:35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20"/>Ye wode Zabddosa machchat fa nam7i dhiirathi na7itayir Yesuusako yi7ii, e tiinayid bunqqittii pettibaz eza woosseeza.<verse eid="MAT 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21"/>Yesuusa iziko, «Ne ab koyee?» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:21">Iza mahii, «Ne kaatetithayid yha ta nam7i na7itaypp pettay neesi ushachcha pettay ne haddirssa betto gooye!» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22"/>Zin Yesuusa mahii, «Yi ab woossizako erooya; taanii uzhodayis yez meto xuu7a uzhodayis danda7inee?» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">Unttikka, «Ee nu danda7iza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23"/>Yesuusa, «Tuma ta uzhodayis yez xuu7ayppe yinttii uzhoda. Zin ta ushachchannee haddirssa bettoditana dooreezay tana baaya. Ye aqay ingginttizay, ta aday immadayis giigiseez asitayisii» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24"/>Atteez taphphii e tamaaritay yeya si7ii nam77ii ishitayil afa kacintteeza. <verse eid="MAT 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25"/>Zin Yesuusa unttan ubbita xeegii yhay garkk yeegeeza. «Ayihude baa asa aqisizitay fa asal afa godatizanne unttan kaalithizitay wolqqar aqisizana yi eriza. <verse eid="MAT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26"/>Zin yi gancce yhay garkk maaqqippe. Yinttipp bayratithi koyiz oonkka yinttis aylle maaqqo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:26-27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mat. 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mar. 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Luq. 22:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27"/>Yi gancce ubbaypp aadho maaqqodayis koyiz oonkka yinttis aylle maaqqodayis beeziza. <verse eid="MAT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28"/>Yey garkkekka, As na7ay as maaddodayisnnee gaame as wozodayis fa shemppo immadayis ye7eezapp attin asar maadinttodayis ye7ekkaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa nam7i to7ita patheeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mar. 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luq. 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29"/>Yeypp guye, Yesuusa fa tamaaritayir Iyarkkopp kezii yhammadar, gaame asay unttan kaalleeza. <verse eid="MAT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30"/>Oge gaxa betteez nam77ii to7itay Yesuusa ezayir aadhizana si7ii, «Godayyo, Dawute Na7ayyo, nuuss qadhinttooye» yeegii uukkeeza. <verse eid="MAT 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31"/>Gaame asay unttan, «Hayizoytta» yeegii qoddeeza. Zin unttii, «Godayyo, Dawute na7ayyo, hayana nuna maarooye» gi gujjii uukkeeza.<verse eid="MAT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32"/>Yesuusa eqqii, unttan xeegii, «Ta yinttis ab udod garkk koyinee?» yeegii oyiceeza.<verse eid="MAT 20:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33"/>Unttikka, «Godayyo, nu aafay be7aday garkk nu koyiza» yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34"/>Yesuusa unttis qadhinttii, u aafa bochcheeza. Ellisii u aafay bi7in; u eza kaallii qiteeza.<verse eid="MAT 20:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa gita bonchchor Yerusalaame geleeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar. 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luq. 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Wan. 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1"/>Yesuusara E tamaaritayira Yerusalaame ukkii, Debire Zayite amibal afa yez Beetefaage giz heera hellittar, Yesuusa fa tamaaritaypp nam7ita paapp tiina azazeeza: <verse eid="MAT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2"/>«Yi tiina yez heera yhanigoytta. Ezayid pettii hare achcha yezanno I na7ayira yi ellisii demmada. Unttan billii yhana ekkii ye7oytta. <verse eid="MAT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3"/>Oonkka yinttan oyiciko, ‹Goday unttan koyiza› yeegoytta. E unttan ellis dakkoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4"/>Nabay,<verse eid="MAT 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5"/>«Xiyone katama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">‹Yikkee, ne kaatay ashikke maaqqii, harel afannee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">hare na7al afa bettii, neeko yi7iza› yeegoytta»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 21:5">yeegii xaafeezay polinttodgarkk yey haneeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zak. 9:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6"/>E tamaaritay yhanigii Yesuusa unttan azazeezay garkk ootheeza. <verse eid="MAT 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7"/>Harttonnee hare na7a ki7ii afar ma77eez fa afila u zokkayil oleeza. Yesuusa afilayil afa betteeza. <verse eid="MAT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8"/>Woyay fa afila ogel hiixeeza. Yhankkitay harata shaqqii ogel oleeza. <verse eid="MAT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9"/>Yesuusapp tiinar yedhizitaynnee ezapp guyer kaalliza woyitay,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">«Hosaana!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hosaana: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibrayisixe doonar hosaana guussay «Nuna ashshoba guussii.» Ma asay Xooss galatodayis maadinttiza qaala.</char></note> Dawute na7ay galatintto!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:9">Goday sunthar yi7izay anjjintteezaya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">Bonchcho Ubbapp Dhoqqa Salo Xoossayis maaqqo!»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 21:9">yeegii uukkeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Maz. 118:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10"/>Yesuusa Yerusalaame katama geleez wode ye katama yez asi ubbitay, «Yhayi oonoo?» yeegii shariksharkeeza.<verse eid="MAT 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11"/>Asay, «Yhay Galila biitta yez Naazirete katamapp ye7eez nabe Yesuusabe» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Xooss keetha geleeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mar. 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luq. 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Wan. 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12"/>Yesuusa Xooss keetha gelii, ezayid bayizizitannee wonggizita ubba bayi7ii bale kesseeza. Miishe laammizitay xarpheezitannee hollita bayizizitta oyddita shirii oleeza. <verse eid="MAT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13"/>Ezikka unttiko, «Xooss qaalayid, ‹Ta keethay Xooss woossiza keethi ginttinttoda› yeeginttii xaafintteeza. Zin yi paanitay qosinttiz kom7o udeeza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa. 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 7:11">Ibr. 7:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14"/>Yesuusa Xooss Kara gancce yezin too7itaynnee gunddeezitay eziko yi7in unttan patheeza. <verse eid="MAT 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15"/>Zin qeese halaqitaynnee higge asitamaaritay Yesuusa ootheez malatita bi7izitaynnee xiqqqa na7itay Xooss keeth gancce, «Dawute na7ay, galatintto» yeegii uukkizana si7ii kacintteeza. <verse eid="MAT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16"/>U Yesuusako, «Yhayititay giza ne si7inee?» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">Yesuusa, «Ee si7iza, Xooss qaalayid, ‹Duude na7itay doonannee dhanggiz na7itay doona galata kuntheeza› yeeginttii xaafintteezana yi nabbabekasa?» yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17"/>Unttan ize ashshii Bitaana katama yhanigii aqeeza.<verse eid="MAT 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Goday baaddeez balase mithato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mar. 11:12-14</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18"/>Yesuusa wontta guura katama maaqqii yi7ittar nayintteeza. <verse eid="MAT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19"/>Oge gaxa pettii balase mith bi7ii iziko yhanigeeza. Zin hayepp attin hara abikka denggekkaya. Yey gishos, izo, «Yhannipp medhinas neepp aafe benttippe!» yeegeeza. Ye balase mithata izir meleeza.<verse eid="MAT 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20"/>E tamaaritay yeya bi7ii, «Yha balasat wayizii ellis melare?» yeegii malabaz geeza.<verse eid="MAT 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Taanii yinttis tuma odiza; yinttis ammano yeezako, ma yi sidhaamixxiko balasel afa taanii ootheezan garkk aadda oothaamii, zin ‹Yha amba shodinttii abba gancce wodhdhoba› yeegiko yinttis hanoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mat. 17:20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1 Qor. 13:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22"/>Ammanii yi woossiza baz ababaz maaqqikokka yi ekkoda» yeegeeza. <figure style="fig" alt="Fig tree" file="LB00085B.tif" size="span" ref="21:22">Balase mith</figure><verse eid="MAT 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa mawutay oycintteeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mar. 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luq. 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23"/>Yesuusa Xoossa Keeth gelii tamaarssodar, qeese halaqitaynnee Ayihude cimitay eziko yi7ii, «Neenii yhaya ubba aba mawuter oothee? Nees yha mawuta inggeezay oonoo?» yeegii oyceeza.<verse eid="MAT 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24"/>Yesuusa unttiko, «Taankka yinttan pettibaz oyciza; yi taas izo mahiko, taanii aba mawuter oothizako yinttis ododa. <verse eid="MAT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25"/>Waannisa xammaqod garkk mawutay anapp inggintteennee? Xoossappennee asappee?» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Unttii woli gancce tobbii, «Nuunii, ‹Xoossapp› giiko, E nuna, ‹Yeezin abis ammanekasa?› goda. <verse eid="MAT 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26"/>Nuunii, ‹Asappee› giiko, asii ubbay Waannisana nabe udii bi7iza gishos woyay nuna yashshiza» yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27"/>Yey gishos, «Nuunii erooya» yeegii maheeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Ezikka, «Yikkee, taankka yhaya aba mawuter oothizako yinttis odaamii» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nam77ii na7itay aaziso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28"/>«Yesuusa maaqqikka yhay garkk yeegeeza: Pettii athayis Nam77ii dhiirath na7itay yeza. Ye athay bayra na7ayiko yhanigii, ‹Ta na7ayyo, yhayino woyne gancce yhanigii yhanttoba› yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29"/>Na7ay mahii, ‹I7inno yhanggaamii› yeegeeza. Zin guyeppe fa wozinar qoppii ekkii yhanttodayis qiteeza. <verse eid="MAT 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30"/>Aday fa guye na7ayiko yhanigii, fa bayra na7ayiko geezay garkk azazeeza. Ezikka, ‹Ero, ta adayyo› yeegeeza. Zin yhanigekaya. <verse eid="MAT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31"/>Yha nam77ii na7itaypp fa adayis azazintteezay aaya?» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Unttikka, «Bayra» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Yesuusa unttiko, «Ta yinttis tuma odiza; qaraxe gachishizitaynnee laammizitay yinttipp tiinatii Xooss kaatetith geloda. <verse eid="MAT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32"/>Xammaqqiza Waannisa luulo oge tamaarssittar yi7in E gizana yi ammanekkaya. Zin qaraxe gachisizitaynnee laammizitay ammaneeza. Yi hara attozin, unttan bi7ikka yi nagaraypp maaqqii ammanekkaya» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:12">Luq. 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:29-30">7:29-30</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Woyne yhanttiz asitay aaziso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mar. 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luq. 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33"/>Maakka Yesuusa yhay garkk yeegeeza; «Hara aaziso si7oytta, woyne tukkeez pettii athay yeza. Ye woyne gaxana gaseeza. Woyne buulliz ollakka bookkeeza. Woyna naagodayis shakkokka kocheeza. Yeypp guye, gada mattaye inggii hara gade qiteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:1-2">Isa. 5:1-2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34"/>Woyne aafa maxiza wode hellin fana helliza bagga ekkii ye7od garkk fa ayllita unttiko dakkeeza. <verse eid="MAT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35"/>Mattaye ekkeezitay e ayllita aykkii petta yhadhdheeza, yhankka wodheeza ma atteezana shuchchar shoceeza. <verse eid="MAT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36"/>Woyne atakilitte goday kaseesitaypp gaame hara ayllita azazeeza. Mattaye ekkeezitay unttal gujjikka yhankkitayil afa ootheezay garkk ootheeza. <verse eid="MAT 21:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37"/>Wurssithal E, ‹Ta na7a u bonchchoda!› yeegii fa na7a unttiko azazeeza.<verse eid="MAT 21:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38"/>«Zin mattaye ekkeezitay na7a bi7ii woli gancce ‹Gada laattoday yhaya, eza wodhii gada nuunii ekkoda!› yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39"/>Na7a aykkii woyne gancceppe gaxa kessii wodheeza.<verse eid="MAT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40"/>«Yikkee, woyne atakilitte goday yi7ii ye mattaye ekkeezita wayssadee?» yeegii oyceeza.<verse eid="MAT 21:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41"/>U mahii, «E ye iita asa iita wodho wodhii, woynay kaa7iz wode eza helliz bagga woder woder inggiza hara asis immada» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 21:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42"/>Yesuusa mahii unttiko, Xoossa qaalay,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">«‹Gimbbizitay borii ixxeez shuchchay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">keeth muumer tookkiza kirkiro garkk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">ubbapp aadhiz shuchch maaqqeeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Yhayi Goday ootheez bazi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">nu aafayisikka mala bazi›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 21:42">yeeginttii xaafintteezana yi nabbabekkasa?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Maz. 118:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 21:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43"/>«Yeyi gishos, ta yinttis odiza; Xoossa kaatetithay yinttipp ekinttii lo77o aafe aafiz asitayis ingginttoda. <verse eid="MAT 21:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44"/>[Yha shuchchayil afa wodhdhiz ubbitay meqitoda. Ma ye shuchchay ezal afa wodhdhiz athaykka gaacinttoda]»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pettii pettii binii maxaafitay tayibo 44 gujjiza (Luq. 20:18) bo7oytta.</char></note> yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 21:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45"/>Qeese halaqitaynnee Ferisaawitay Yesuusa odeez aaziso fana odeezana ereeza. <verse eid="MAT 21:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46"/>U Yesuusa aykkodayis koyeeza, zin asay Yesuusa nabe udii bi7iza gishos asayis yashitteeza.<verse eid="MAT 21:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Boss xeessi aaziso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luq. 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1"/>Yesuusa yhattekka asayis yhay garkk yeegii aaziso odeeza. <verse eid="MAT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2"/>«Salo kaatetithay fa na7ayis bossi makkeez kaata aaziza. <verse eid="MAT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3"/>Ye kaatay boss ye7oay garkk odeez asa xeegodayis fa ayllita azazeeza. Zin asay ye7odayis koyekkaya. <verse eid="MAT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4"/>Ma hara ayllita xeegii, xeegintteez asitayiko yhanigii, ‹Taanii ta sanggitannee modhdheez mehita shukkeeza; ubba baz giigeeza. Ta bossayiko ye7oytta yeegoytta› yeegii kiiteeza. <verse eid="MAT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5"/>Zin xeegintteezitay xeessa ixxii, fa yhanttas yhanttas qiteeza. Pettay fa wootas, yhankkay fa zal7es qiteeza. <verse eid="MAT 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6"/>Yhankkitay ma kaatay ayllita aykkii, kawushshishi yhadhdhii wodheeza.<verse eid="MAT 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7"/>«Kaatay iita shenitii, fa wotaaddarita dakkii shemppo wodhizita wodhiseeza, u katamitokka xuuggeeza. <verse eid="MAT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8"/>Yeypp guye, fa ayllitayiko, ‹bossay giigeeza, zin xeegintteezitay bossayis beeziza as baaya. <verse eid="MAT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9"/>Yey gishos, dammo goosa aykkii yhanigii, denggeez as ubbita bossa ye7od garkk xeegoytta› yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10"/>Ayllitay ogel kezii fa denggeez as ubba lo77itannee iitita ki7ii bossa shaqara gelisii kuntheeza.<verse eid="MAT 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11"/>«Zin kaatay muntta maadayis betteez asa be7adayis gelodar bossi afila ma77ekka pettii as denggeeza. <verse eid="MAT 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12"/>Eziko, ‹Naat ne bossi afila ma77ekkazar wayizii yhaydda geleenee?› yeegeeza. Zin athay si77e atteeza.<verse eid="MAT 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13"/>«Kaatay fa ayllitayiko, ‹Yha athayis kushannee toka accii, bale dhuma kessii olloytta. Ezayid ezisi yeefonnee achch coonchii maaqqada› yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:12">Mat. 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Luq. 13:28</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14"/>«Yey garkk, Xooss kaatetithayis xeegintteezitay gaame zin dorintteezitay xiqqa» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Giira gachcho bagga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mar. 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luq. 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15"/>Yeypp guye, Ferisaawitay yhanigii, Yesuusa wayizii odar aykkodazako tobbeeza. <verse eid="MAT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16"/>Fa tamaaritannee Herodoosa baggitaypp petta petta azazeeza. Unttikka, «Asitamaarayyo, ne turo odizana nu eriza. Neenii asapp as shaakkii erooya, asii waagodee gi abikka oothii erooya, Xooss oge turora taamarissiza. <verse eid="MAT 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17"/>An nuus odoba, nuunii Oroome Kaatayis giira giirodayis beezinennee beezoosa?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18"/>Zin Yesuusa u iita qofa erii, «Yha cubbitayyo, tana abis paaccee? <verse eid="MAT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19"/>Giira giiriza miishito tana beezoytta» yeegeeza. Unttikka ezis Dinnare ki7ii beezeeza. <verse eid="MAT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20"/>E, «Yha sunthaynnee mallay o bazo?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21"/>Unttii, «Roome Kaatayis» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Yesuusa unttiko, «Yeezin, Kaatayis beezizana kaatayis, Xoossis beezizana Xoossis inggoytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22"/>U yeya si7ii mala bazi gi ashshii qiteeza.<verse eid="MAT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yhayiqopp denddo bagga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mar. 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luq. 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23"/>Ye gallas yhayiqopp denddo baaya yeegiz Saduqaawitay Yesuusako yi7ii, yeegii eza oycceeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:8">Haw. O. 23:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24"/>«Asitamaarayyo, ‹Muse, pettii asii machcho ekkii na7a yelekkazar yhayqqiko, ye yhayqqeezayis ishay e machchato ekkii, fa ishayis na7a yelo› yeegii azazeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Nam7i. 25:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25"/>Nu eriza laappun ishitay yeza. Bayray machcho ekkii na7a yelekkazar yhayqqeeza. E machchato e kaalo ishay ekkeeza. <verse eid="MAT 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26"/>Yey garkkekka, ye astto ekkeez nam7anthaykka, hayidzinthaykka, yhanigii laappunitay wurod gatho ubbitay yhayqqeeza. <verse eid="MAT 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27"/>Ubbapp wurssithal ye asitakka yhayqqeeza. <verse eid="MAT 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28"/>Yeezin, laappunitay ubbitay izo ekkeez gishos yhayiqopp denddiza gallas, ye astta laappunitaypp aayayis machcho maaqqadee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Yi Xooss qaalay taamarsseez baz woy e wolqqa eroowa gishos balinttiza. <verse eid="MAT 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30"/>Asay yhayiqoppe denddiza wode salo yez kiitanchchitay garkk maaqqodaypp attin ekkooyannee gelooya. <verse eid="MAT 22:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31"/>Ma yhayqqeez asay yhayiqopp dendod baz Xooss yinttis odeezana yi nabbabekkasa? <verse eid="MAT 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32"/>Xoossay, ‹Taanii Afraame Xooss, Isaaqa Xooss, Yayqqooba Xooss› yeegeeza. Yey gishos, Xoossay pathi yezitay Xoossapp attin yhayqqeezitay Xooss baaya»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:32 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Xoossay pathi yezitay Xoossapp attin yhayqqeezitay Xooss baaya: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesuusa yha bessa odizay Xoossay yha yhayqqeez hayidzitay Xooss maaqqiko unttii pathi yeza yeeginttiza.</char></note> yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Kes. 3:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33"/>Gaame asay yeya si7ii, e timirtta malabaz geeza.<verse eid="MAT 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubbapp bayratiza kiita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mar. 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luq. 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34"/>Yesuusa Saduqaawitayis godbaz dhabiseezana Ferisaawitay si7ii wolla shiiqeeza. <verse eid="MAT 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35"/>U ganccepp pettii higge asitamaaray Yesuusa paace oychchi oyiceeza. <verse eid="MAT 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36"/>«Asitamaarayyo, higge ubbaypp aadhizay aaya?» yeegii oyceeza.<verse eid="MAT 22:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37"/>Yesuusa mahii, «‹Ne Goda, ne Xoossa, ne kunthi wozinaypp, ne kunthi shemppopp, ne kunthi qofapp qadhdhoba.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Nam7i. 6:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38"/>Ubbapp aadhizaynne bayra kiitay yhaya. <verse eid="MAT 22:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39"/>Nam77iintho ubbaypp aadhiz kiitay, as ubba ne nena dosizay garkk dosoba› yeegizaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lewii. 19:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40"/>Muse higgaynnee nabitay timirttay ubbay yha kiititayil afa katiza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luq. 10:25-28</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosa bagga oyceez oychchi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mar. 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luq. 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41"/>Ferisaawitay pettipp shiiqii yeezin, Yesuusa unttan, <verse eid="MAT 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42"/>«Kiristtoosa bagga yi waagee? E o na7a?» yeegii oyceeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">U, «E Kaata Dawute na7a» yeegii maheeza.<verse eid="MAT 22:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43"/>Yesuusa unttiko, «Yeezin, Dawute geeshsha Ayyanar maaqqii wayizii Kiristtoosa, ‹Goda› gi xeegee? Dawute giittar,<verse eid="MAT 22:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44"/>« ‹Xoossay, ta Godayiko,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:44 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ta Godayiko: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yha bessayid Dawitte ta Goda gi xeegizay Kiristtoosa.</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz. 110:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">ne morkkita ne tokayis yedhdhiz aqo oothod gatho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">yhaydda taapp ushachchi baggar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:44 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ushachcha baggar: guussay </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mautenee bonchcho aqo.</char></note> bettoba› geeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz. 110:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45"/>Yikkee, Dawute Kiristtoosa Goda gi xeegiko, wayizii Kiristtoosa Dawute na7a maaqqee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 22:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46"/>Yesuusas pettii qaala mahodayis danda7eez as oonkka baaya. Ma ye gallasapp aykkii hara oyichi oyccodayis oonkka danda7ekkaya.<verse eid="MAT 22:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Higge asitamaaritaynnee Ferisaawitay iitatithi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Mar. 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43-46">Luq. 11:43-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1"/>Yeypp guye, Yesuusa woyasinnee fa tamaaritayis yhay garkke yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2"/>«Higge asitamaaritaynnee Ferisaawe asay Muse higge tamarisodayis Muse oyidela betteeza. <verse eid="MAT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3"/>Yey gishos, u yinttan azaziza baz ubbita oothoyttannee naagoytta. Zin u oothizay garkke oothippate. Abis giiko, u odizay garkk oothooya. <verse eid="MAT 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4"/>Unttii tookkin dendoowa deexo toofo accii as toossiza. Zin paasi hara attozin, ye toofo asay tookkodar biradhdhe xeerar bochchodayis koyooya.<verse eid="MAT 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5"/>«Zin u fa ooso ubba asii be7aday garkk oothiza. Fa sinollannee qeseel acciz maxxaafe xiqise yez kiitappe dalggisiza, fa afila macarakka adussiza.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Sinollannee qesell acciz maxxaafe ... afila maccara adussiza: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yeya u oothizay Xoossayis ta ingintteezaya gi fana beessadayis (Nam7i. 15:37-41).</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:1">Mat. 6:1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:8">Nam7i. 6:8</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 15:38">Tay. 15:38</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6"/>Mokkinttiza aqo bonchcho aqonne Ayihuditay Woosa keetha gaame lo77iza oyde dosiza. <verse eid="MAT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7"/>Asay gabe gancce unttan bonchchor sarothodanannee ‹Asitamaarayyo› gi xeegod garkk koyiza.<verse eid="MAT 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8"/>«Zin yi asitamaaray pettay aadda maaqqeez gishonnee yi ubbitay e ishita maaqqeez gishos ‹Asitamaarayyo› ginttinttii xeeginttippate. <verse eid="MAT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9"/>Yinttis salo pettii aday aadda yez gishos yha sa7a oonakka ‹adayyo› gi xeegppatte. <verse eid="MAT 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10"/>Yinttis pettii Goday Kiristtoosa aadda yeza gishos ‹Goda› ginttinttii xeeginttippate. <verse eid="MAT 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11"/>Yinttapp aadhizay yinttis aylle maaqqo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:26">Mat. 20:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12"/>Fana dhoqqi udiz oonkka kawuzhoda; fana kawuzhisiza oonkka dhoqqi goda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luq. 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">18:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Higge asitamaaritaynnee Ferisaawe asitay borintteeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Mar. 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luq. 11:39-42</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13"/>«Yinttanno, cubbittayyo, higge asitamaaritaynnee Ferisaawttayyo, as tiina salo kaatetitha gorddizitayyo yinttan ayye. Yinttii, yi ubbas gelaamii ma yhankkitakka gelsaamii.<verse eid="MAT 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14"/>[«Yinttanno cubbitayyo, higge asitamaaritaynnee, Ferisaawttayyo, am7itay keetha yi bonqqittar, asii be7o gi woosa adussiza. Yey gishos, yinttan ayye. Ubbapp aadhiz pirdday yinttan naagiza.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pettii pettii binii maxaafitay tayibo 14 gujjiza.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15"/>«Yinttanno, cubbittayyo, higge asitamaaritaynnee Ferisaawttayyo, yinttii pettii atha ammanthodayis abarannee sa7ar yuuyiza. Zin yi eza ammantheez wode ye atha yinttipp aathii Gaannames giigsiza ooso oothiza gishos yinttan ayye.<verse eid="MAT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16"/>«Oonkka Xooss Keetha caaqqiko akkokka baaya. Zin Xooss Keetha yez worqqa caaqqiko, ye caaqay ezis gomoda giz to7itayyo, yi ubbas to7ii hara as kaalithizitayyo, yinttan ayye. <verse eid="MAT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17"/>Yinttanno, boozitayyo, to7itayyo, worqqay aadhinenee? Worqqa Xoossayis dummasiza Xooss Keethay aadhee? <verse eid="MAT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18"/>Ma ‹Oonkka yarshsho yarshshiza aqo caaqqiko, akkokka baaya. Zin oonkka ezal afa yeza yarshsha caaqqiko, ye caaqay ees gomoda› yeegii taamarssiza. <verse eid="MAT 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19"/>Yinttanno, tullitayyo to7itayyo, yarshsho aadhinenee? Yarshsho Xoossayis dummasiza aqay aadhee? <verse eid="MAT 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20"/>Yey gishos, yarshsho aqayir caaqqiza athay, ye yarshsho bessaaydanne ezal afa yeza ubbabazal caaqqiza. <verse eid="MAT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21"/>Xooss Keetha caaqqiza athay, ye Xooss Keeth giddonnee ezayid yeza Xoossa caaqqiza. <verse eid="MAT 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22"/>Salo caaqqiza athay Xooss zufaanannee ye zufaanayil afa bettiz Xoossa caaqqiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Isa. 66:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:34">Mat. 5:34</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23"/>«Yinttanno, cubbitayyo, higge asitamaaritayyonnee Ferisaawttayyo, yinttan ayye. Yi karthi gaallapp, shaashincheppennee booth gaallapp asiraata kessiza. Zin higgayid yez aadhii koshshizita ashshiza: yeykka luule pirdde, qadhdheene ubbabazal ammanintto. Harabazitakka ashshekkazar yhayttita yi oothodayis beeziza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:30">Lewii. 27:30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24"/>Yinttis to7ii hara as kaalithizitayyo, yi ushshapp wununo kessii gimaale mittiza.<verse eid="MAT 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25"/>«Yinttanno, cubbitayyo, higge asitamaaritayyonnee Ferisaawe assayyo, yinttan ayye. Yi shaatessinnee keres afa bagga geeshshiza. Zin gancce baggay bonqqannee uuzatithii kumeeza. <verse eid="MAT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26"/>Neno to7a Ferisaawayyo, shaatesinnee keres gancce tiina geeshshoba. Yeypp guye, afa baggaykka geeshshii maaqqada.<verse eid="MAT 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27"/>«Yinttanno, cubbitayyo, higge asitamaaritayyonnee Ferisaawttayyo, yinttan ayye. Afa baggar borshonttor lo77ii, gancce meqqethinnee wooqqeezibaz kumeez duufo aaziza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:3">Haw. O. 23:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28"/>Yey garkkekka, afa baggar asis lo77o aaziza. Zin yi gancce cubbotithinnee iitatithii kumeeza.<verse eid="MAT 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29"/>«Yinttanno, cubbitayyo, higge asitamaaritayyonnee Ferisaawitayyo, yinttan ayye. Yi nabitayis duufo ginbbiza, ma xillitay duufakka lo7ithiza. <verse eid="MAT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30"/>Ma yinttii, ‹Nuunii binii nu aditay wode yeza baz maaqqeezako, unttar wolla nabitay suuthi laalamizin› yeegiza. <verse eid="MAT 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31"/>Yey gishos, yi nabita wodhdheez as na7ita maaqqeezana yinttii yi ubbas markkattiza. <verse eid="MAT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32"/>Yeezako, yi aditay aykkeezana yi poloytta.<verse eid="MAT 23:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33"/>«Yha shooshuntho, goppe na7untho, yi Gaanname pirddapp wayizii attodee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:7">Mat. 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:34">12:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:7">Luq. 3:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34"/>Yey gishos, ta odizana si7oytta; taanii nabita, eca asitannee asitamaarita yinttiko kiittoda. Unttapp petta petta yi wodhoda mazqqalel afa sottoda. Baggita Ayihuditay Woosa keetha gelissii alangoda katamapp katama bayi7oda. <verse eid="MAT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35"/>Yey gishos, xilla Aabeela wodhdheez wodepp aykkii, Xooss Keethissinnee yarshsho aqopp giddo yi wodhdheez Barakiyu na7a Zakkireesa suuthii hellodar yhayqqeez geesh as ubbay gishos yi seerinttoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Medhe. 4:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20">2 Zeena. 24:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36"/>Taanii yinttis turo odiza; yinttinnee yi aditay ootheez buutayis yha pirdda ubbay yha yeletithayil afa helloda.<verse eid="MAT 23:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Yerusalaames yeekkeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luq. 13:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37"/>«Yerusalaame, Yerusalaame, nabita wodhizannee! Xoossay neeko kiitteezita shuchchar shocizannee! Shugula fa na7ita fa qefer haphphizay garkk taanii ne na7ita ta shiishodayis aappun toke koyennee! Zin tana ne kayeeza. <verse eid="MAT 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38"/>Yikkee, yi keethay kaysa maaqqada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:5">Erim. 22:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39"/>Taanii yinttis odiza; ‹Goday sunthar yi7izay anjjintteezaya› yi god gatho yhaypp guye tana yi be7aamii» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Maz. 118:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 23:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Xooss keethay laalilinttodana tiinatii odeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mar. 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luq. 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1"/>Yesuusa Xooss keethapp kezii yhammadar, e tamaaritay eziko yi7ii, Xooss Keeth gimba beezeeza. <verse eid="MAT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2"/>Yesuusa unttiko mahii, «Ee! Yhaya ubbita yi bi7inee? Taanii yinttis turo odiza; shuchchi shuchchal afa ginbbintteezay laalinttekkazar attaamii» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tiinas hanod bazita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mar. 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luq. 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3"/>Yesuusa Debrezayte amball afa betteezin, e tamaaritay fa aaddas eziko yi7ii, «Yey ayide hanodazako nuus odoba. Ma ne yi7ithayssinnee wode wurssithayis mallay abba?» yeegii oyceeza.<verse eid="MAT 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Yinttan oonkka balthaam garkk naaginttoytta! <verse eid="MAT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5"/>Abis giiko, gaame asay ta sunthar, ‹Taanii Kiristtoosa› giittar ta sunthar yi7ii gaame as balithoda. <verse eid="MAT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6"/>Olannee ola baz nashshodar yi si7odayis yeza. Yey hanodayis beeziza gishos hirigipatte. Zin wurssithay haga. <verse eid="MAT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7"/>Woyay woyara, pettii kaatetithay hara kaatetithar olinttoda. Nayennee biitta eni7o gaame aqo hanoda. <verse eid="MAT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8"/>Yey ubbay yelo iqithi zooke ayithgarkke.<verse eid="MAT 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9"/>«Ye wode asay yinttan metos aathii immada, wodhoda. Ta sunthay gishos asii ubbay yinttan ixxoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mat. 10:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10"/>Ye wode gaamitay ammano ashshoda. Fa gancce pettay petta aathii immada, pettay petta ixxoda. <verse eid="MAT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11"/>Ma gaame worddo nabitay denddii gaamita ballithoda. <verse eid="MAT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12"/>Wucetithi ganggizay gishos gaame asayis siiqo irxxoda. <verse eid="MAT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13"/>Zin wurssith hellodayis garzhiza athay attoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mat. 10:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14"/>As ubbas markka maaqqad garkk Xooss kaatetith Wonggilay biitta ubbayil sabbakinttoda. Yeypp guye, wurssithay ye7oda.<verse eid="MAT 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bixa beeziz meto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mar. 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luq. 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15"/>«Yey gishos, nabe Daalene odeez dhabisiza tuna ooso geesh aqo eqqeezana yi be7ada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:27">Nam7i. 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 11:31">11:31</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:11">12:11</ref></char></note> Nabbabizay akaako! <verse eid="MAT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16"/>Ye wode Yihuda biittal yezitay ambal qosintto. <verse eid="MAT 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17"/>Keeth kusittel yez athay fa kara yez baz ekkodayis wodhdhippe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:17-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:31">Luq. 17:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18"/>Gade oosol yezay fa afila ekkodayis guye maaqqippe. <verse eid="MAT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19"/>Ye aginayid wodeth maachitayisnnee ammisiza maachchitayis iita metto maaqqada. <verse eid="MAT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20"/>Yi qosinttay Barigor woy Maala gallas maaqqaam garkk Xoossa woossoytta. <verse eid="MAT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21"/>Abis giiko, sa7a medhintteezaypp yhayino hellodays hanekka baz, ma tiinassikka yesha hanaam meto ye wode hanoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1">Medhe. 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:14">Wan. Qon. 7:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22"/>Ye gallasitay payida haatisekkazako asho ma7eez oonkka attaamii. Zin E fa dooreez asay gishos ye gallasitay payida haatithoda.<verse eid="MAT 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23"/>«Ye wode oonkka yinttan, ‹Yhayishshee, Kiristtoosa yhaydda› woy ‹Sendaydda yeza› yeegiko ammanppatte. <verse eid="MAT 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24"/>Abis giiko, worddo Kiristtoositayirannee worddo nabitayira dendoda. Unttis danda7inttiko, hara attozin Xoossii dooreezitakka balithod hellodayis mallannee malabaz beezoda. <verse eid="MAT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25"/>Akaakoytta, taanii yinttis yhaya tiinatii odeeza.<verse eid="MAT 24:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26"/>«Yey gishos, asay yinttiko, ‹Kiristtoosa liizho yeza› giiko, ize yhanigppatte, woy yinttiko, ‹Qol7a yeza› giiko, ammanippatte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:26-27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:23-24">Luq. 17:23-24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27"/>Abis giiko, zeelinthii salo zeellinggii, awa kessapp awa gelo hellodayis benttizaygarkk, Asii Na7a yi7ithay yhayigarkk hanoda.<verse eid="MAT 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28"/>«Gawuxa yeza aqo ankko shiiqoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:37">Luq. 17:37</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 24:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29"/>«Ye wode ye meto gallasitaypp guye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 24:29">elle awa dhumoda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 24:29">agina fa poo7o kayoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa. 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:10">Erim. 2:10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">Xoolinttitay salopp wodhdhoda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 24:29">ma salo yez wolqqitaykka buqinttoda.<verse eid="MAT 24:29"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30"/>Ye wode As Na7a mallay salol afa benttoda. Sa7a yez as ubbay yeekkoda. Ma As Na7ay, wolqqarannee gita bonchchor salo shaara ganccer ye7odar unttii be7ada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:13">Nam7i. 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zak. 12:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31"/>E fa kiitanchchita puggiza damma tulitular kiittoda. U sa7a oyddii zooze yhanigii, gaxapp gaxa hellodayis yez eesi doorintteezita shiishoda.<verse eid="MAT 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Goday ye7od gallasayis malla</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mar. 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luq. 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32"/>«Belese<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Belese: Nu biitta beella fudhiko bone kezizaygarkke</char></note> mithapp tamaaroytta. I xeeray ciizhiko hayitay aaco aykkiko bone ukkeezana yi eriza. <verse eid="MAT 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33"/>Yey garkkekka, yi yha ubba be7adar As na7ay yi7iza woday peenggel yezana eroytta. <verse eid="MAT 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34"/>Taanii yinttis turo odiza; yha ubba bazay polinttod hellodayis, yha yeletithay aadhamii. <verse eid="MAT 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35"/>Salonnee sa7ay aadhoda, zin ta qaalay aadham.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:5">Medhe. 6:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Goday ye7od gallasana oonkka erooya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mar. 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luq. 17:26-30</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36"/>«Ye gallasatinnee ye saatatii bagga salo yez ta adaypp attin hara salo kiitanchchita maaqqin woy Na7a maaqqin oonkka erooya. <verse eid="MAT 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37"/>As Na7a yi7ithay, Nohe wode haneezay garkk maaqqada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:5">Medhe. 6:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38"/>Ye agintte dhabo haathay ye7odaypp tiina Nohe markkabe gancce gelod hellodayis, asay miitarannee uzhittar, ekkittarannee gelttar gam7eeza. <verse eid="MAT 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39"/>Dhabo haathay yi7ii, unttan ubba dhabisod hellodayis akaakekaya. As Na7a yi7ithaykka yhay garkk hanoda.<verse eid="MAT 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40"/>«Ye wode nam77ii asay gade gancce oothoda. Unttapp pettay ekkinttoda, yhankkay attoda. <verse eid="MAT 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41"/>Nam77ii maachchitay wolla gaaccoda. Unttapp pettat ekkinttoda yhankkat attoda.<verse eid="MAT 24:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42"/>«Yikkee, yi Goday aba gallas ye7odazako eroowa gishos miinggii naagoytta. <verse eid="MAT 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43"/>Zin kayzo qammapp aappun saatel ye7odazako kara aday erizako, fa kara bookinttamay garkk barkk naagodazin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:43-44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:39-40">Luq. 12:39-40</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44"/>Yey garkk, As Na7ay yi qoppekka saate ye7od gishos yinttikka giiginttii yezoytta.<verse eid="MAT 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iitannee lo77o aylle aaziso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luq. 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45"/>«Yeezin, fa kara asayis katha beeziza woder immad garkk e goday dooreez ammanthizaynnee wozinaama ayllay oonoo? <verse eid="MAT 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46"/>E fa goday azazeezana oothodar e goday yi7ii denggiza ayllay anjjintteezaya. <verse eid="MAT 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47"/>Taanii yinttis turo odiza; goday ye aylla fabaz ubbayil afa shuumoda. <verse eid="MAT 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48"/>Iita ayllay, ‹Ta goday gam7ii ye7oda› yeegii fa wozinar qoppii, <verse eid="MAT 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49"/>fa ooso laggita yhadho aykkiko, mathizitayira miikonnee uzhiko, <verse eid="MAT 24:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50"/>ye ayllay goday E qoppekka gallasnnee E erekka saater, <verse eid="MAT 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51"/>yi7ii eza nam77ii kessii phalqqoda. E anjakka cubbittayir udoda. Ezayid eesi yeefonnee achch coonch maaqqada.<verse eid="MAT 24:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Taphphii wudiritay aaziso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1"/>«Ye wode salo kaatetithay fa kuraaze aykkii, machcho ko7odayis yhanigeez atha mokkodayis kezeez taphphii wudirita aaziza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:35">Luq. 12:35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2"/>Unttapp ichchinitay boozita, ichchinitay ecita. <verse eid="MAT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3"/>Boozitay kuraaze aykkeeza, zin hara lamba aykkekkaya. <verse eid="MAT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4"/>Zin ecitay fa kuraazannee hara gujjo lamba aykkeeza. <verse eid="MAT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5"/>Machcho ekkiza athay gam7in, ye wudiritay unttan gentta aykkin gentteeza.<verse eid="MAT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6"/>«Giddii bilahe maaqqodar ‹Machchato ekkizay ye7eeza, eza mokkodayis kezoytta› yeegiz gita cabbotith sintteeza.<verse eid="MAT 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7"/>«Ye wode ye wudiritay ubbitay barkkii, fa kuraaza giigiseeza. <verse eid="MAT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8"/>Boozitay ecitayko, ‹Nu xomppay to7od haniza gishos yi lambaypp nuusi inggoytta› yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9"/>«Zin ecitay unttiko mahii, ‹Yey hanaamii, nuusinnee yinttis gidiza lamba baaya. Yey gishos, yinttis yhanigii wonggii ekkoytta› yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10"/>Boozo wudiritay lamba woonggodayis qiteezin, machchat ekkiza athay putti geeza. Giiginttii betteez ichchin wudiritay ezar wolla bossa sibirel geleeza; pengaykka gorddintteeza.<verse eid="MAT 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11"/>«Guyepp yhankko wudiritay yi7ii, ‹Godayyo, Godayyo, nuusi dooyooyee› yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12"/>«Zin E unttiko mahii, ‹Taanii yinttis turo odiza; ta yinttan erooya!›<verse eid="MAT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13"/>«Yikkee, As Na7ay ye7od gallasa woy saata yi eroowa gishos barkkii naagoytta.<verse eid="MAT 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Haaydzi ooso asitay aaziso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luq. 19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14"/>«Xooss kaatetithay fa ayllita xeegii faasi yeza baz unttis hadarii oge yhammadayis kezeez atha aaziza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:14-30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luq. 19:11-27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15"/>Unttis ommar ommar u wolqqay garkk pettayis ichchin mekilite<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mekilite guussay pettii gallasa ootho oothiz athayis taphpho ichchin laythi damooze guusii</char></note>, pettayis nam77ii mekilite ma pettayis pettii mekilite inggii hara gade qiteeza. <verse eid="MAT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16"/>Ichchin mekilite ekkeez ayllay elle yhanigii zal7i, hara ichchin mekilite tirppiseeza. <verse eid="MAT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17"/>Yey garkkekka, ma nam77ii mekilite ekkeez ayllay hara nam77ii mekilite tirppiseeza. <verse eid="MAT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18"/>Zin pettii mekilite ekkeezay yhanigii, olla bookkii, fa goday miisha moogeeza.<verse eid="MAT 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19"/>«Gaame wodepp guye ye ayllitay goday yi7ii, fa miisha unttan oyicceeza. <verse eid="MAT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20"/>Ichchin mekilite ekkeez ayllay yi7ii, hara ichchin mekilite ki7ii, ‹Ta godayyo, ne taassi ichchin mekilite inggeeza. Zin ta hara ichchin mekilite tirppiseeza› yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21"/>E goday, ‹Zambay! Neenii lo77o ammanthiza aylle; neenii xiqqa bazal ammantteeza. Taanii nena gaame bazal shuumoda; yhana ne goday ufayssayid geloba› yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22"/>«Ma nam77ii mekilite ekkeezay yi7ii, ‹Ta godayyo, neenii taas nam77ii mekilite inggeeza. Zin taanii hara nam77ii mekilite tirppiseeza› yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23"/>E goday, ‹Zambay! Neenii lo77o ammanthiza aylle; neenii xiqqa bazal ammantteeza. Taanii nena gaame bazal shuumoda; yhana ne goday ufayssayid geloba› yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 25:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24"/>«Ma pettii mekilite ekkeezay yi7ii, ‹Ta godayyo, neenii zerekka aqopp buuciz laalekka aqopp maxiz iita as maaqqeezana taanii eriza. <verse eid="MAT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25"/>Ta Yashittii ne mekilita biitta gancce moogeeza. Ne mekilita yhayshe› yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 25:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26"/>«E goday mahii, ‹Yha iita azaalla ayllayyo, taanii zerekka aqopp buucizannee laalekka aqopp maxiza as maaqqeeza ne erinee. <verse eid="MAT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27"/>Yikkee, neenii ta miishito bankke gaddeezako wodher ekkodanno ne kayeeza. <verse eid="MAT 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28"/>Yey gishos, miisha eep ekkii, taphphii mekilite yezayis inggoytta. <verse eid="MAT 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29"/>Abis giiko, yeza ubbayis gujinttoda gaanggoda. Zin baazaypp hara attozin, ye ezis yeza xiqqatakka ekkinttoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mat. 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mar. 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Luq. 8:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30"/>Yha maaddoowa aylla bale dhuma kessii oloytta. Ezayid ezis yeefonnee achch coonchii maaqqada› yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:12">Mat. 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22:13">22:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Luq. 13:28</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wode wurssithal hanod pirdde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31"/>«As Na7ay, kiitanchcho ubbitayira, fa bonchchor ye7i E fa bonchcho kaatetith zufaanayil afa bettoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:27">Mat. 16:27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:28">Mat. 19:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 25:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32"/>As kochch ubbitay e tiina shiiqoda. Heenggiz na7ay durta deeshitaypp qurizay garkk E ye asa nam77ii aqo shagoda. <verse eid="MAT 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33"/>Durta ushachchi baggar deeshita haddirs baggar essoda.<verse eid="MAT 25:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34"/>«Ye wode, kaatay ushachchi baggar yezitayko yhay garkk yeegoda: ‹Ta Aday anjjeezitayyo, yhana yi7ii sa7a medhintteezaypp aykkii yinttis giigeez kaatetitha laattoytta. <verse eid="MAT 25:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35"/>Abis giiko, taanii nayinttin yi ta muzeeza, saaminttin ushsheeza, imath maaqqii yhanigin mokkeeza, <verse eid="MAT 25:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36"/>kallottin ma7iseeza, hargginttin oyiceeza, acinttin tana yi be7eeza› yeegoda.<verse eid="MAT 25:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37"/>«Yeypp guye, xillitay mahii, ‹Godayyo, neenii nayinttin ayde bi7ii nena nu muzeenee? Woy neenii saaminttin ayde bi7ii nena nu ushsheennee? <verse eid="MAT 25:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38"/>Neenii imath maaqqii yi7in ayde bi7ii nena nu mokkennee? Woy neenii kallottin ayde nena nu ma7iseenee? <verse eid="MAT 25:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39"/>Neenii hargginttin woy acinttin neeko yhanigii ayde nena nu oyceennee?› yeegoda. <verse eid="MAT 25:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40"/>Kaatay mahii, ‹Taanii yinttis turo odiza; yinttii tana kaalliza yha ubbaypp xiqqiza ishitaypp pettayis ootheezana taas ootheeza› yeegoda.<verse eid="MAT 25:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41"/>«Ye wode haddiris baggar yezitayiko, ‹Yha baaddintteezitayyo, ta lanqqaypp haakkoytta. Xalahesinnee e kiitanchchitayis giigeez medhina tama gancce yhanigoytta. <verse eid="MAT 25:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42"/>Abis giiko, nayinttin tana yi muzekkaya; saaminttin tana yi ushshekkaya. <verse eid="MAT 25:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43"/>Taanii imath maaqqii yhanigin tana yi mokkekkaya, kallottin ma7isekkaya, harggin acinttin tana oycekkaya› yeegoda.<verse eid="MAT 25:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44"/>«Ye wode unttii, ‹Godayyo, neenii nayinttin woy saaminttin woy imath maaqqii yhanigin woy kalladhin woy hargginttin woy acinttin bi7ii nena ayide maaddam ixxeenee?› yeegii mahoda.<verse eid="MAT 25:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45"/>«Ye wode kaatay mahii unttiko, ‹Taanii yinttis turo odiza; yinttii tana kaalliza yha ubbapp xiqqizitaypp petta maaddam ixxeezay, tana maaddam ixxeeza› yeegoda. <verse eid="MAT 25:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46"/>Yey gishos, ye asay medhina pirddes ma xillitay medhina de7os yhammada» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Daan. 12:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 25:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusal tobbeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar. 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luq. 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Wan. 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1"/>Yesuusa yha timirtta ubba wursseezaypp fa tamaaritayko, <verse eid="MAT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2"/>«Nam77ii gallasapp guye, Paaziqa Baale bonchchiza gallas maaqqizana yi eriza. Ye gallas As Na7ay mazqalel afa sotinttodayis as kushe aadhii inginttoda» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1">Kes. 12:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3"/>Ye wode qeese halaqitaynnee gade cimitay, Qayyaafa giz qeese halaqay kara shiiqii, <verse eid="MAT 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4"/>asii erekkazin Yesuusa aykkii, wodhodayis tobbeeza. <verse eid="MAT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5"/>Zin unttii, «Asay cabotaamay garkk gi, Paaziqa bonchchiza gallas yeya oothaamii» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusana shitto tizheez asito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mar. 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Wan. 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6"/>Yesuusa Bitaana katama gancce borqqontto hargger yez Simoona kara yeza. <verse eid="MAT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7"/>Yesuusa muntttal yezin pettii astta albasxirosa bilggaaxe kunthi gaame al7o shitto ekkii yi7ii Yesuusa ommayil qoleeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:37">Luq. 7:37</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8"/>Zin Yesuusa tamaaritay yeya bi7ii kacinttii, «Yha shitta cere iissizay abiso? <verse eid="MAT 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9"/>Yha shittay al7o waagar bayizinttii, miishay manqqitayis ingginttodayis danda7inttizazin» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10"/>Yesuusa unttii geezana erii, unttiko, «Yha astto abis waaythe? Iza taasi lo77o baz ootheeza. <verse eid="MAT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11"/>Manqqitay ubba wode yinttar yezoda. Zin taanii yinttar ubba wode yezaamii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Nam7i. 15:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12"/>Iza yha shitta taal afa qoleezay tana moogos giigiseeza. <verse eid="MAT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13"/>Taanii yinttis turo odiza; biitta ubbayil yha Wonggilay sabbakinttiza aqo abamaaqqikokka, asay izis qoppiso maaqqaday garkk odinttoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yihuda Yesuusana aathii immadayis giigintteeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mar. 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luq. 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14"/>Ye wode taphpho nam77ii Yesuusa tamaaritaypp pettay, Asiqorontto Yihuda ginttinttizay qeese halaqitayiko, <verse eid="MAT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15"/>yhanigii, «Taanii yinttis Yesuusa aathii inggiko, yi taasi ab immadee?» yeegii unttan oyceeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:12">Nam7i. 11:12</ref></char></note> Unttii tobbii hasttam bira<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:15 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Bira santte: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akkokka guzhinttekka geeshshi bira guussii.</char></note><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:15 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hasttam bira santte: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hasttam bira santtife Isreele biitta aylle woonggitizanne bayizinttiza gatee.</char></note> inggeeza. <verse eid="MAT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16"/>Yeypp guye, Yihuda Yesuusa aathii immadayis giiga gallas koyiza.<verse eid="MAT 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa paaziqa kaho fa hawaaritayir meeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mar. 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luq. 22:7-14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Wan. 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17"/>Boora Baale bonchchiza tiina gallas, Yesuusa tamaaritay eziko yi7ii, «Paaziqa bonchchiza gallas neenii maad katha nuunii aba makko?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18"/>Yesuusa unttiko, «Katama yi gelodar helleez athayiko yhanigii, ‹Asitamaaray, taas wode helleez gisho ta tamaaritayir Paaziqa bonchchiza gallasa ne kara aathoda yeegeeza› goytta» geeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19"/>E tamaaritay Yesuusa kiiteezay garkk udii, Paaziqa Baale gallas maad katha giigiseeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20"/>Sa7ay omathodar Yesuusa taphpho nam77ii hawaaritayir katha maadayis betteeza. <verse eid="MAT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21"/>U maadar, Yesuusa unttiko, «Taanii yinttis turo odiza; yinttapp pettay tana aathii immada» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22"/>U iita dagamii, ommar ommar, «Godayyo, turo tanashsha?» gi eza oyceeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Fa kusha taar wolla fil7o gancce dakkizay E tana aathii immada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Maz. 41:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24"/>As Na7ay, Xooss qaalayid ezis xaafintteezay garkk yhayqqoda. Zin As Na7a aathii inggiza atha ayye; ye athay yelinttekka atteezako ezisi lo77ozin» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25"/>Eza aathii immadayis yez Yihuda mahii, «Asitamaarayyo, ne gizay tanannee?» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:25">Yesuusa mahii, «Ne geezaygarkk» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Goday kaho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mar. 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:15-20">Luq. 22:15-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Qor. 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26"/>Unttii maadar, Yesuusa boora ekkii Xoossa galateeza. Ye boora baxxii fa tamaaritayis inggii, «Yhashittee, moytta, yhayi ta asho» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27"/>Xuu7a ekkii, Xoossa galateeza. Unttis inggii, «Ubbay yhaypp uzhoytta. <verse eid="MAT 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28"/>Yhayi gaame asay nagaray atto inttinttoday garkk gogiz oroth ta caaqo suuthii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Kes. 24:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31">Erim. 31:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29"/>Zin taanii yinttis odiza; taanii ta Aday kaatetititha oroth woyne ushsh yinttar uzhod gallasa hellodayis yhannipp gede yha woyne ushsha uzhaamii» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30"/>Galata mazmuure yexxeezaypp guye Debre zayite ambal qitteeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Phixiroosa kaddodana tiinatii odeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar. 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luq. 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Wan. 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31"/>Ye wode Yesuusa unttiko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 26:31">«‹Xoossay heenggizana shocoda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 26:31">duritaykka laalinttoda›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 26:31">ginttinttii Xooss qaalayid xaafintteezay garkk yhayino qamma yi ubbitay taal dhubinttoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zak. 13:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32"/>Zin taanii yhayiqopp denddeezaypp guye yinttipp tiinatii Galila yhammada» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:16">Mat. 28:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 26:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33"/>Phixiroosa mahii, «Unttii ubbay nena ashshii dhabikokka, taanii nena ashshaamii» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34"/>Yesuusa Phixiroosako, «Taanii nees turo odiza; yhayino qamma shugula uukkodaypp tiina neenii tana hayidzii toke kaddoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35"/>Phixiroosa mahii, «Taanii neer wolla yhayiqopp attin nena yesha kaddamii» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:35">Yhankko e tamaarttay ubbitaykka yhay garkk geeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Geetesemaane giz aqo woosseeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mar. 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luq. 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36"/>Ezaypp guye, Yesuusa fa tamaaritayir Geetesemaane giz aqo yhanigii, unttiko, «Taanii sendayid yhanigii Xooss woossoda, yi yhaydda bettoytta» yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37"/>Phixiroosannee Zabidoosa na7a nam7ita paar ekkii yhanigii azanonnee yilo aykkeeza. <verse eid="MAT 26:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38"/>Maakka unttiko, «Taanii yhayqqod hellodayis azzaneeza. Yhaydda gam7oyttannee barkkii naagoytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39"/>Xiqqa tiinal yhanigii biittal fa sinayir xuggunii, «Ta adayyo, danda7inttiza baz maaqqiko yha meto xuu7ay taapp aadho. Zin ne shene hanopp attin ta shenay hanppe» yeegii Xoossa woosseeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40"/>Yesuusa fa tamaaritayiko maaqqii yi7ii unttii gentteezin denggii, Phixiroosako, «yinttii pettii saatezakkonnee genttekkazar taar minggodayis danda7ekkasa? <verse eid="MAT 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41"/>Paace gancce yi gelaamay garkk barkkii naagoyttannee Xoossa woossoytta. Ayyanay ingginttii yezin asho daabureeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42"/>Yesuusa ma nam7intho yhanigii woossii, «Ta adayyo, taanii yha meto xuu7aypp uzhekazin aadhodayis danda7inttoowa baz maaqqiko ne shenay hano» yeegii Xoossa woosseeza. <verse eid="MAT 26:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43"/>Maakka maaqqii ye7odar e tamaaritay gentta gamin, woyi7eezin denggeeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44"/>Maakka unttan ashshii yhanigii, tiina geez qaalato izo mahii hayidzintho woosseeza. <verse eid="MAT 26:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45"/>Yeypp guye, fa tamaaritayiko yi7ii, «yhanno hellodayis genttallannee shemppol yenee? yikkee genttoytta. Yikkee, As Na7ay, nagara oothizittay kushe aadhii ingginttiza saatay helleeza. <verse eid="MAT 26:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46"/>Denddii yedhdhoytta, tana aathii inggizay yhayishshee helleeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa morkkitay kushe ayikintteeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar. 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luq. 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Wan. 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47"/>Yesuusa haga yeya odinttodar, taphpho nam7i tamaaritaypp pettay, Yihuda ye7eeza. Qeese halaqitaynnee gade cimitay kiitteez gaame asay mashshannee gufe aykkeezittay ezar wolla ye7eeza. <verse eid="MAT 26:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48"/>Yesuusa aathii inggiz Yihuda ye gaame asayiko, «Taanii yeerizay yi koyizay eza, eza aykkoytta» yeegii malla inggii gaddeeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49"/>Ellisii Yesuusako shiiqii, «Asitamaarayyo, saro nees maaqqo» yeegii eza yeereeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50"/>Yesuusa eziko, «Ta dabbayyo, neenii abis ye7eenee»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta laggayyo, neenii oothod bastto oothii ashshoba: woy hara birshshithay ta laggayyo, ne yhaydda abi oothee?</char></note> yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Yeypp guye, shiiqii, fa kusha Yesuusal gaddii aykkeeza. <verse eid="MAT 26:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51"/>Yesuusar yezitaypp pettay fa mashsha shoddii qeese halaqay aylla shocii, e haya gachchii oleeza. <verse eid="MAT 26:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52"/>Zin Yesuusa, «Ne mashsha guye shookayid mahoba. Abis giiko, mashsha shoddiz ubbitay mashshar yhayqqoda. <verse eid="MAT 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53"/>Ta, ta Adana woossizako gaame mukulo payidinttiz kiitanchchita dakkodayis danda7oowa baz neess aazinnee? <verse eid="MAT 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54"/>Yeya maaqqiko, Xoossa qaalayid yhay garkk hanodayis beeziza ginttinttizay wayizii polinttode?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55"/>Ye saatte, Yesuusa ye shiiqeez gaame woyayiko, «Tana paanno mahii aykkodayis mashshannee gufe aykkii ye7eenee? Taanii Xooss Keetha gallas gallas taamaristtar yinttar yez wode yi tana aykkibe7ekkaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luq. 19:47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 26:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56"/>Zin yhay ubbay haneezay nabitay Xooss qaalayid xaafeezay polinttoday garkke» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:56">Ye wode e tamaaritay ubbitay eza ashshii qosintteeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa pirdde Shanggo tiina Shiiqeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mar. 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luq. 22:54-55</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Wan. 18:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57"/>Yesuusa aykkeezitay qeese halaqa Qayyaafa eza kanggeeza. Ezayid higge asitamaaritaynnee biitta cimitay shiiqii yeza. <verse eid="MAT 26:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58"/>Zin Phixiroosa qeese halaqay zabba hellodayis haakor eza kaalleeza. E wurssitha be7adayis zabba gelii naagiztayir betteeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59"/>Qeese halaqitaynnee shiiqeez as ubbitay Yesuusa wodhodayis ezal afa worddo markka koyeeza. <verse eid="MAT 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60"/>Gaamitay yi7ii ezal afa worddo markka markkatteeza, zin abikka denggekkaya. Guyepp nam77ii asay yi7ii, <verse eid="MAT 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61"/>«Yha athay, ‹Taanii Xoossa Keeth laalii hayidzii gallasar mahii keexxodayis danda7iza› geeza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:61 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:19">Wan. 2:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 26:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62"/>Qeesitay halaqay denddii eqqii Yesuusako, «yhayititay nena mootiza mootayis neenii mahizbaz baasa?» yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 26:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63"/>Zin Yesuusa si77i atteeza. Maakka qeese halaqay, «Taanii nena de7o Xoossa sunthar aykkiza; neenii Xoossa Na7a Kiristtoosa maaqqiko nuus odoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Yeya ne geeza. Zin taanii yinttis odiza; yhaypp guye, As Na7ay wolqqama Xoossa ushachch baggar betteezin, salo shaarar ye7odar yi be7ada» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:64 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Daan. 7:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 26:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65"/>Ye wode qeese halaqay fa afila peedhii, «Yhaya bo7oytta Xooss cazheeza! Nuna hara markka ab koshshee? E yhatti cazheezana yi si7eeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:65-66 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:15-16">Lewii. 24:15-16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 26:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66"/>Yi qofay abba?» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Unttikka, «Ezis yhayiqo beeziza» yeegii maheeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:66"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67"/>Ye wode, u e sinayid cuttii zhultteeza, yhankkitay eza baqqii,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:67 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 50:6">Isa. 50:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 26:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68"/>«Kiristtoosa! Nena shoceezay oonoo? An nuus tinbbite odoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:68"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phixiroosa Yesuusana kaddeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mar. 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luq. 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Wan. 18:15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69"/>Phixiroosa zabbayid betteezin, pettii gadhindata eziko yi7ii, «Neekka Galila Yesuusar wolla yeza baasa» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70"/>Zin E u ubbitay tiina ye gadhindatiko, «Ne giz bazay abizako ta erooya» yeegii kaddeeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71"/>Ma yhanigii gase pengeko hellodar yhankkat eza bi7ii, ize yeza asayiko, «Yha athay Naazirete Yesuusar yeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72"/>Phixiroosakka nam7intho caaqqii, «Taanii ye aththa erooya!» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:72"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73"/>Xiqqa gam7odar, ize eqqeez asay Phixiroosako yi7ii, «Neekka turo unttar wolla yeza bay; neenii ne nashshayir erinttiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:73"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74"/>Yeypp guye, Phixiroosa, «Taanii ye atha erooya!» yeegii, fana baadithinnee caaqo aykkeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">Ye wode izir shugula uukkeeza. <verse eid="MAT 26:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75"/>Yesuusa eziko, «Neenii shugula uukodaypp tiina tana hayidzii toke kaddoda» geezana Phixiroosas elqqi gin, bale kezii dukka suuthth yeekkeeza.<verse eid="MAT 26:75"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Yihuda fana sotteeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mar. 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-3">Luq. 23:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Wan. 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1"/>Wontta guura qeese halaqitaynnee gade cimitay ubbitay Yesuusana wodhodayis tobbeeza. <verse eid="MAT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2"/>Unttii Yesuusa accii kanggii gade aqisiz Philaaxoosas aathii inggeeza.<verse eid="MAT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3"/>Ye wode Yesuusana aytheez Yihuda, Philaaxoosa Yesuusal afa pirddeezana bi7ii, qiirattii, ye hasttam bira qeese halaqitayisnnee gade cimitayis guye maheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:3-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Haw. O. 1:18-19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4"/>«Taanii geeshsh as yhayiqosi aathii inggii nagara ootheeza» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">Zin unttii, «Yey nu meto baaya ne meto» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5"/>Yihuda mishitto Xooss Keetha olii ashshii u lanqqaypp yhanigii, sotinttii yhayqqeeza.<verse eid="MAT 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6"/>Qeese halaqitay miisha ekkii, «Yha miishay suuth miishe maaqqeez gishos nuunii Xooss Kara miisher walakkodayis beezooya» yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7"/>Yeypp guye, wolla tobbii, bete as moogodayis zhiice biitta wonggeeza. <verse eid="MAT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8"/>Yey gishos, ye gaday yhayino hellodayis suuth biitta ginttinttii xeeginttiza.<verse eid="MAT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9"/>Ye wode Nabe Erimaasa geezay garkk «Isreele na7itay wachcheez e gata hasttam bira ekkeeza<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:9-10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 11:12-13">Zak. 11:12-13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10"/>Goday tana azazeezay garkk zhiice biitta woongodayis inggeeza» geezay ye wode polintteeza.<verse eid="MAT 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Philaaxoosa tiina shiiqeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mar. 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luq. 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Wan. 18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11"/>Yesuusa gade aqisiza Philaaxoosa tiina shiiqin, Philaaxoosa eziko, «Neenii Ayihude kaato» yeegii oyceeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">Yesuusa mahii, «Ne geeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12"/>Qeese halaqitaynnee gade cimitay eza mootodar unttis aba maalssekka mahekkaya.<verse eid="MAT 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13"/>Ye wode Philaaxoosa Yesuusako, «Yhayititay nena mootiza moota ubba ne si7oosa?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14"/>Yesuusa hara attozin, pettii qaalakka mahaam ixxin, gade aqisizay yhay malabaz geeza.<verse eid="MAT 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusal afa yhayiqo pirdde pirddintteeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mar. 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luq. 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-40">Wan. 18:39-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:1-16">19:1-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15"/>Gade aqisizay laytha laytha Paaziqa Baale bonchchiza gallas, woyay koyiz pettii as achchapp bili7iz woga yeza. <verse eid="MAT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16"/>Ye wode pettii Bairbaana giz daafar erintteez iita athay achch keetha yeza. <verse eid="MAT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17"/>Yey gishos, gaame as shiiqii yeezin Philaaxoosa, «Taanii yinttis Bairbaana, billone Yesuusa giz Kiristtoosana bili7o?» yeegii woya oyceeza. <verse eid="MAT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18"/>E yeya geezay u qinaattii Yesuusa aathii inggeezana eriza gishshosi.<verse eid="MAT 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19"/>Philaaxoosa pirdde kara betteezin, e machchat, «Taanii yhayino qamma abukkar E bagga undenna waayttar aqeez gishos ye geeshsh athayil afa ababazkka oothippe» yeegii azazeeza.<verse eid="MAT 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20"/>Zin qeese halaqitaynnee gade cimitay Philaaxoosa Bairbaana bili7ii, Yesuusa wodhod garkk, woyay eza woossod garkk, woya doosheeza.<verse eid="MAT 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21"/>Philaaxoosa mahii unttiko, «Taanii u nam7aypp yinttis oona billod garkk koyinee?» yeegii oyceeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">U, «Baribaana billod garkk nu koyiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22"/>Philaaxoosa, «Yeezin, Yesuusa giz Kiristtoosa ab udo?» yeegii unttan oyceeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">Ubbay mahii, «Sottintto» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23"/>Philaaxoosa woyayiko, «Abiso? E ab iitta baz ootheenee?» yeegii oyceeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Zin asay tiinaasaypp aathii, «Mazqqalel afa eza sottoba» gi uukkeeza.<verse eid="MAT 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24"/>Philaaxoosa cabbo denthithopp hara ababazkka oothodayis danda7inttaamiza bi7ii, wursii haath ekkii, «Yha athay yhayiqayid taanii baaya. Yeya oothizay yinttan» yeegii woya tiina fa kushe meecceeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:6">Nam7i. 21:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25"/>As ubbitay mahii, «E suuthay nuulannee nu na7itayil afa maaqqo» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 27:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26"/>Yeezin, Philaaxoosa Bairbaana unttis bili7ii, Yesuusa garaffii, mazqqalel afa sottinttii yhayqqod garkk aathii inggeeza.<verse eid="MAT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wotaaddaritay Yesuusana leqqeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mar. 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Wan. 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27"/>Yeypp guye, Philaaxxosa wotaaddaritay Yesuusana gade aqisizay zabba kanggin, wotaaddaritay e kalayid shiiqeeza. <verse eid="MAT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28"/>E afila qaarii ekkii zoqo afila<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:28 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Zoqo afila: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Binii wode kaatitay afar ma77iz afila.</char></note> ma7iseeza. <verse eid="MAT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29"/>Ma angguth zawude kochchii, e ommayil gaddeeza. E ushachch kushayid shomboqo gufe ayithii, e tiinayid bunqqittii, «Ayihude kaatayyo saro nees maaqqo!» yeegii, ezal afa qaldeeza. <verse eid="MAT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30"/>Ezal afa cutteeza. Ye shomboqo gufa ekkii, e ommayid shoceeza. <verse eid="MAT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31"/>Unttii ezal afa qalideezaypp guye zoqo afila eepp qaarii ekkii, e afila eza ma7isi Sottodayis ekkii kanggeeza.<verse eid="MAT 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa sotintto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar. 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:25-43">Luq. 23:25-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Wan. 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32"/>Unttii bale kezii, pettii Simoona giz Qerena biitta atha denggii, Yesuusa mazqala wolqqar toosseeza. <verse eid="MAT 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33"/>Golggotta giz aqo helleeza. «Golggotta» guussay «Omma Ota aqo» guussii. <verse eid="MAT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34"/>Yeyid u cizher walakintteez woyne ushshii uzho gi ees inggeeza. Zin E yeya ganxxii bi7ii, uzhaam ixxeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Maz. 69:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 27:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35"/>Unttii mazqalel afa eza sotteezaypp guye e afila shaakkii, ixa olii ekkeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Maz. 22:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36"/>Yeypp guye, ezayid bettii eza naageeza. <verse eid="MAT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37"/>Ma, «Yhayi Ayihude Kaati Yesuusa» yeegiz e daafa beeziz mooto xuufe e omma achcha gaddeeza. <verse eid="MAT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38"/>Yesuusar ye wode nam77ii paanitaypp petta eep ushachchi baggar, yhankka eep haddirs baggar, mazqalel afa sotteeza.<verse eid="MAT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39"/>Oger aadhiz asay fa omma eni7isittar Yesuusa cazhitar,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:7">Maz. 22:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:25">109:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40"/>«Xooss Kara laalii hayidzii gallas gancce keexxizayyo, nena ashshoba. Neenii Xooss Na7a maaqqiko, ane mazqqalaypp wodhdhoba» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:61">Mat. 26:61</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:19">Wan. 2:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 27:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41"/>Yey garkkekka, qeese halaqitay, higge asitamaaritaynnee biitta cimitay wolla Yesuusal afa qaldeeza. Yhay garkk yeegeeza: <verse eid="MAT 27:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42"/>«Hara asa ashsheeza, zin fana ashshodayis danda7ekkaya. E Isreele kaat maaqqiko, ane mazqqalaypp yhatti wodho, nuukka eza ammanoda. <verse eid="MAT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43"/>Xoossal E ammaninttiza, Xoossay eza ashshodayis koyko ane ashsho. Abis giiko, E fana, ‹Taanii Xooss Na7a› giza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:8">Maz. 22:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 27:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44"/>Ma hara attozin, ezar mazqqalel afa sottintteez paanitaypp pettay yhay garkk gi ezal afa qaldeeza.<verse eid="MAT 27:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa yhayiqo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:3-41">Mar. 15:3-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luq. 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Wan. 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45"/>Usuppun saatepp yhanigii, uddufun saate hellodayis biitta ubbay dhumeeza. <verse eid="MAT 27:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46"/>Uddufun saate maaqqeezan garkk Yesuusa, «Elohee, Elohee, laama sabaqitanii?» gi gita uufo uukkeeza. «Elohee, Elohee, laama sabaqitanii?» guusayis birshshithay «Ta Xoossayyo, ta Xoossayyo, tana abis ashsharee?» guussii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:1">Maz. 22:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 27:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47"/>Ezayid eqqeez asaypp pettay pettay yeya si7ii, «Yha athay Eelaasa xeegiza» yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 27:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48"/>Izir unttapp pettay woxxii yhanigii, zanzar caala woyne ushsh ekkii. Yeya shomboqo gufe xeeral gaddii ushshodayis e doonayiko ukkitheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Maz. 69:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49"/>Zin yhankkitay, «Ashshoytta, Eelaasa eza ashshodayis ye7odazako ane wolla be7ada» yeegeeza. <verse eid="MAT 27:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50"/>Yesuusa nam7intho gita uufo uukkii, yhayqqeeza.<verse eid="MAT 27:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51"/>Ye saatayid Xooss Kara soxintteez magarazhay woko xeerapp yeko xeera hellodayis nam7i kezii, per7inttii wodhdheeza. Biitta eni7eeza, zaallitaykka phalqqintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31">Kes. 26:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52"/>Duufitay dooyinttin Geesh asitaypp gaamitay yhayiqopp dendeeza. <verse eid="MAT 27:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53"/>Yesuusa yhayiqopp dendeezaypp guye Unttii duufopp kezii, Geesh katama qiteeza; ezayid undenna asayis bentteeza.<verse eid="MAT 27:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54"/>Mato halaqaynnee ezar Yesuusa naagiza wotaaddaritay biittay eni7eezannee aqayid haneezibaza be7eez wode gaame yashittii «Tuma yhay Xooss Na7a» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 27:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55"/>Yeyid gaame maachchitay, Galilapp aykkii Yesuusa maaddittar kaalleezittay haakor eqqii bi7iza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:55-56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:2-3">Luq. 8:2-3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56"/>U gancce Magdeela Mayirama,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:56 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Magdeela Mayiramo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Guussay Magideela gizi katamappi ye7eeza Mayiramo guusii.</char></note> Yayqqobaranee Yooseefa indat Maaraamannee Zabdoosa na7itay indat yeza.<verse eid="MAT 27:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa moogintteeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar. 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luq. 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Wan. 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57"/>Sa7a lem7ilem7odar Yooseefa giz pettii dure athay, Armataasa katamapp ye7eeza. E fa ubbaskka Yesuusa kaaliza asii. <verse eid="MAT 27:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58"/>Yooseefa Philaaxoosako yhanigii, Yesuusa aha ekkodayis woosseeza. Philaaxoosa ahay Yooseefas ingginttod garkk azazeeza. <verse eid="MAT 27:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59"/>Yesuusa aha ekkii, geesh afilar sawaxeeza. <verse eid="MAT 27:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60"/>Shuchchapp wooceez oroth duufo gancce aha gaddeeza. Ma ye duufay doonayid damma shuchch goli7isii gaddii qitteeza. <verse eid="MAT 27:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61"/>Magdeela Maaramira yhankko Maarama ye duufayiko maaqqii betteeza.<verse eid="MAT 27:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62"/>Wonttitha maala gallas, qeese halaqitaynnee Ferisaawitay Philaaxoosako yi7ii, yhay garkk yeegeeza: <verse eid="MAT 27:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63"/>«Godayyo, yha balithizay pathi yezar, ‹Taanii hayidzii gallasapp guye yhayiqopp dendoda› yeegeezay nuus elqqi geeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:63 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Mat. 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:23">17:23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:19">20:19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mar. 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:31">9:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:33">10:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64"/>Yey gishos, E moogintteez duufa hayidzii gallas hellodayis, miinthii naagod garkk azazooba. Yey hanaam ixxiko, e tamaaritay yhanigii e aha kastti dhabisii, ‹yhayiqopp dendeeza› yeegii woyayis odiko nam7intho balithay tiinaasaypp ubba yhana iitoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 27:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65"/>Philaaxoosa unttiko, «Yinttis naagizitay yeza; yhanigii yinttis danda7intteezay garkk naagisoytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 27:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66"/>Yey gishos, unttii yhanigii duufay bochinttamay garkk shuchchayil afa maatame attaamii wotadarttayir wolla gorddii naagiseeza.<verse eid="MAT 27:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa yhayiqopp denddo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mar. 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luq. 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Wan. 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1"/>Maala gallasay aadheez Wogga wode guura, Magdeela Mayiramira yhankko Mayrama Yesuusa moogintteez duufa be7adayis yhanigeeza. <verse eid="MAT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2"/>Qoppekka wolqqama biitta eni7o haneeza. Goday kiitanchchay salopp wodhdhii duufay doonayil yez shuchcha goli7isii ezal afa betteeza. <verse eid="MAT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3"/>E ciray zeellinthi aaziza. E afilaykka shachchigarkk boothi. <verse eid="MAT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4"/>Naagizitay kiitanchcha bi7ii, yashshar kukkurii, yhayqqeez asgarkk haneeza.<verse eid="MAT 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5"/>Kiitanchchay maachitayiko, «Yashittippate yi mazqalel afa sotintteez Yesuusa koyizana ta eriza. <verse eid="MAT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6"/>E tiin odeezay garkk yhayiqopp dendeeza; yhaydda baaya. Yhana yi7ii eza woytheez aqa bo7oytta. <verse eid="MAT 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7"/>Yi yhatti ellisii yhanigii, e tamaaritayis, ‹Yesuusa yhayiqopp dendeeza. Ma E yinttipp tiinattii Galila yhammada; yi eza ezayid be7ada› yeegii odoytta. Taanii yinttis yhaya ododayis ye7eeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8"/>Unttii yashittittarannee gaame ufayttittar, duufay lanqqaypp ellisii yhanigii, e tamaaritayis ododayis woxxeeza.<verse eid="MAT 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9"/>Qoppekkazin Yesuusa unttar woli hellii unttiko, «Saro yinttis maaqqo» yeegeeza. Unttii eziko shiiqii, e toka aykkii ezis goynneeza. <verse eid="MAT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10"/>Ye wode Yesuusa unttiko, «Yashittippate; yhanigii ta tamaaritay Galila yhammadgarkk unttis odoytta. U ezayid tana be7ada» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11"/>Ye maachchitay yhammadar, duufa naagiza wotaaddartaypp baggitay katama yhanigii, haneezibaza ubbita qeese halaqitayis odeeza. <verse eid="MAT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12"/>Qeese halaqitaynnee cimitay shiiqii tobbii, wotaaddartayis gaame miishe inggeeza. <verse eid="MAT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13"/>«‹Nuunii gentteezin e tamaaritay qamma yi7ii, e aha kasiteeza› yeegoytta. <verse eid="MAT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14"/>Yha oda gade aqisizay si7iko, yey yi buuta baza nuunii eza odii ammanthoda. Yinttan abikka hirigisppe» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15"/>Wotaaddartay miishe ekkii, kiitintteezaygarkk udeeza. Yha oday Ayihuditay kale yhayino hellodayis odinttitar yeza.<verse eid="MAT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Damma kiita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar. 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luq. 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Wan. 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Haw. O. 1:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:3-8">1 Qor. 15:3-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16"/>Taphpho pettii e tamaarttay Yesuusa unttan yhanigoytta geez Galila Derell afa yhanigeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:32">Mat. 26:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:28">Mar. 14:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17"/>Ezayid unttii eza be7eez wode ezisi goynneeza, zin unttapp pettay pettay sidheeza.<verse eid="MAT 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18"/>Yesuusa unttiko shiiqii, «Salonnee sa7a mawute ubbay taas inggintteeza. <verse eid="MAT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19"/>Yikkee, yinttii ubba aqo yhanigii, wongila sabbakkii tana kaallizita mahoytta, Ada, Na7a, geeshsha Ayyana sunthar woya ubba xammaqoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">Haw. O. 1:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20"/>Taanii yinttan azazeeza ubba u naagod garkk taamarssoytta. Taanii wode wursith hellodayis ubba wode ta yinttar yeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="MAT 28:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28"/>
</usx>
